ифасига эга бўлган педагог кадрлар улушини ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мажбурий ва ихтиёрий равишда аттестацияга жалб этиладиган педагогларни Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлигининг «pedagog.edu.uz» платформаси орқали рўйхатдан ўтишларни таъминлаш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">2</span></strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">. Педагогларни аттестациядан ўтказиш ва уларга тегишли малака тоифаларини бериш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 12.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="12%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margi