to;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">33.</span></p></td><td style="width: 20.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Аҳолининг жисмоний фаоллиги даражасини ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Аҳолининг жисмоний фаоллиги даражасини ошириш ва соғлом турмуш тарзини тарғиб қилиш чораларини кўриш. Бунда:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> Бирламчи тиббий-санитария ёрдами муассасаларида тўғри овқатланиш ва жисмоний фаоллик бўйича тарғибот ишларини олиб бориш режасини ишлаб чиқиш ва амалга ошириш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> «Маҳалла еттилиги» билан биргаликда аниқ режа-график асосида маҳаллаларда тўғри овқатланиш ва жисмоний фаоллик бўйича тарғибот ишларини ташкил этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 12.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="12%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил февралдан бошлаб режа-график асосида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ўзбекистон маҳаллалари уюшмаси</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">(К. Куранбаев)</span></em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 100"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">19-мақсад: Соғлом ва фаол кексаликни таъминлаш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 101"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Ўзбекистон маҳаллалари уюшмаси (К. Куранбаев)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 102"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 2.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">34.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 20.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Катта ёшдаги аҳоли орасида тўғри овқатланиш, жисмоний фаоллик ва юқумли бўлмаган касалликлар профилактикаси бўйича индивидуал ва оммавий тарғибот тадбирларини ўтказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.0%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Кекса ёшдаги аҳолининг кун тартибини тўғри ташкиллаштириш, жисмоний фаоллиги ва касалликлар профилактикаси бўйича тарғибот материалларини тарқатиш ва оммавий ахборот воситаларида ёритиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 12.0%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="12%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил февраль-март</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 14.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">«Нуроний» жамғармаси маблағлари</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 21.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">(А. Худаяров)</span></em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Спорт вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">(А. Икрамов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 103"><td style="width: 28.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Катта ёшдаги аҳоли орасида скандинавча юриш ва уларга мос бошқа спорт турларини жорий қилиш, «Кексалик гашти» шиори остида енгил спорт мусобақаларини ўтказиб бориш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 12.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="12%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил апрель — ноябрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 104"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">20-мақсад: Аҳоли орасида тўғри овқатланиш ва соғлом турмуш тарзини шакллантириш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 105"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги (А. Худаяров)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 106"><td style="width: 2.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">35.</span></p></td><td style="width: 20.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Аҳоли орасида тўғри овқатланиш ва соғлом турмуш тарзини шакллантириш бўйича тарғиботни кучайтириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ёши, тана тузилиши, турмуш тарзи ва касалликларга мойиллигидан келиб чиқиб, катталар ва кексалар учун тўғри овқатланиш, соғломлаштириш машқлари ва гигиена қоидаларини маҳаллаларда тарғиб қилиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 12.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="12%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил февраль ойидан бошлаб йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="14%"></td><td style="width: 21.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Санитария-эпидемиологик осойишталик ва жамоат саломатлиги қўмитаси</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">(Б. Юсупалиев)</span></em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 107"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">21-мақсад: Тиббиёт соҳасида рақамли технологияларни кенг жорий қилиш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 108"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги (А. Худаяров)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 109"><td style="width: 2.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">36.</span></p></td><td style="width: 20.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Рақамли технологиялар жорий этилган тиббиёт муассасалари улушини ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> Барча турдаги стационар ва амбулатор тиббиёт муассасаларида онлайн қабулга ёзилиш, тиббий хизматлар учун мобиль иловалар орқали электрон тўлов тизимини жорий қилиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 12.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="12%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил февралдан бошлаб режа-график асосида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Тиббиёт муассасаларига ажратилган маблағлар</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 110"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">22-мақсад: Профессионал ижтимоий хизматларни кўрсатиш тизимини тубдан такомиллаштириш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 111"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Ижтимоий ҳимоя миллий агентлиги (М. Оллоёров)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 112"><td style="width: 2.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">37.</span></p></td><td style="width: 20.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижтимоий хизматларни кўрсатишда нодавлат сектор ташаббусларини қўллаб-қувватлаш, парваришлаш хизматларини бозор талаблари асосида йўлга қўйиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Парваришлаш хизматларини кўрсатиш тизимини такомиллаштириш чора-тадбирлари тўғрисида норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш. Бунда:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">ўзгалар парваришига муҳтож шахслар учун кундузги қатнов асосида қараб туриш ҳамда уйда ётоқ тартибидаги шахсларга тиббий-ижтимоий реабилитация хизматларини кўрсатиш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">хизматлар самарадорлигини баҳолаш мезонларини белгилаш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">хизматларни ташкил этишда минимал стандарт талабларини шакллантириш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">институционал муассасалар хизматларининг альтернатив шаклларини маҳалла даражасида ташкил қилиш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">давлат томонидан кафолатланган ижтимоий хизматларни кўрсатишда тадбиркорлик субъектларининг иштирок этиш имкониятларини кенгайтириш масалалари назарда тутилади.</span></p></td><td style="width: 12.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="12%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил май</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Давлат бюджетидан ушбу мақсадлар учун ажратилган маблағлар, Ижтимоий ҳимоя давлат жамғармаси</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">(А. Худаяров)</span></em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">(И. Норқулов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 113"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">23-мақсад: Ногиронлиги бўлган шахсларни қўллаб-қувватлаш бўйича янги тизимни яратиш ҳамда улар учун қулай ва мақбул муҳитни яратиш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 114"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Ижтимоий ҳимоя миллий агентлиги (М. Оллоёров)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 115"><td style="width: 2.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">38.</span></p></td><td style="width: 20.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ногиронлиги бўлган болаларнинг таълим сифатини ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">1. </span></strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Тошкент шаҳрида тажриба-синов тариқасида кўп функцияли коррекцион мактаб ташкил этиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ногиронлиги бўлган ўқувчилар ўқув режаларини такомиллаштириш ва индивидуал ёндашувни кенгайтириш мақсадида ўқув-режаларни тасдиқлаб, ўқувчиларни ихтисослаштириш (фан, касб-ҳунар, IT, санъат ёки спортга йўналтириш).</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 15.15pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">3. </span></strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">«Бизнес — махсус мактаб» ҳамкорлик моделини йўлга қўйиш орқали ногиронлиги бўлган болаларни меҳнат бозорига мақсадли тайёрлашни йўлга қўйиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 12.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="12%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">2025/2026 ўқув йилидан бошлаб</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижрочиларга ажратилган бюджет маблағлари ва бюджетдан ташқари маблағлар доирасида</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">(Ш. Умурзаков)</span></em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-languag