n';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">2. 150 нафар</span></strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> касбий кўникмалар маркази ўқитувчиларини халқаро стандартлар асосида малакасини ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 12.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="12%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Халқаро молия жамғармалари</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR"