 none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7524278" id="7524278">Изоҳ. Чораклар кесимидаги мақсадли кўрсаткичларга асосий масъул ташкилот раҳбарининг асослантирилган таклифи асосида «Ўзбекистон — 2030» <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/6600413#6605157">стратегиясини</a> амалга ошириш бўйича Республика комиссияси раиси — Бош вазир томонидан ўзгартиришлар (белгиланган йиллик мақсадли кўрсаткичлар доирасида) киритилиши мумкин.</div></div><div class="CHANGES_ORIGINS"><label id="s1104"></label><div name="7524281" id="7524281">(3-илова Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 8 майдаги ПФ-84-сонли <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7519176?ONDATE=12.05.2025 00#7519555">Фармони </a>таҳририда — Қонунчилик маълумотлари миллий базаси, 12.05.2025 й., 06/25/84/0432-сон)</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372017" id="7372017"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372019" id="7372019">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />4-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372215" id="7372215">«Ўзбекистон — 2030» стратегиясининг Барқарор иқтисодий ўсиш орқали аҳоли фаровонлигини таъминлаш йўналиши бўйича 2025 йилга мўлжалланган</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372216" id="7372216">АМАЛИЙ ТАДБИРЛАР РЕЖАСИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372217" id="7372217"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="7372218" id="7372218"><a name="_heading=h.fwa7sd308xp8"></a><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Т/р</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Вазифа</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Амалий чора-тадбирлар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро муддати</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Молиялаштириш манбалари</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳамижрочилар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">II. БАРҚАРОР ИҚТИСОДИЙ ЎСИШ ОРҚАЛИ АҲОЛИ ФАРОВОНЛИГИНИ ТАЪМИНЛАШ</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">45-мақсад: 2030 йилга қадар иқтисодиёт ҳажмини 2 баробар ошириш ва «даромади ўртачадан юқори бўлган давлатлар» қаторига кириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мамлакат иқтисодиётини янги сифат босқичига олиб чиқиш учун иқтисодий ўсишни камида </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">6 фоиз</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> даражада таъминлаш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Саноатни </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">6,1 фоиз</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">га, бозор хизматларини </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14,5 фоиз</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">га, қишлоқ хўжалигини </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4,1 фоиз</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">га ва қурилиш ишларини </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14,2 фоиз</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">га, асосий капиталга ўзлаштириладиган инвестициялар ҳажмини </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">9,7 фоизга</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">, товар ва хизматлар экспортини камида </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15 фоиз</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">га ўсишини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Марказий банк</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Т. Ишметов)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> <b>Йиллик инфляция </b>даражасининг <b>7-8 фоиздан</b>, консолидациялашган бюджет тақчиллигининг ЯИМга нисбатан <b>3 фоиздан ошмаслигини таъминлаш</b> чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> <b>Ҳ</b></span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ар бир тармоқ</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">, </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">соҳа</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> ва </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳудудлар</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> кесимида 2025 йилнинг чораклик </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">мақсадли кўрсаткичлар </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">параметрларини ва уларга эришиш </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">режасини ишлаб чиқиш</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги (Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="2"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экспорт салоҳиятини ўрганиб, тадбиркорлар билан <b>«корхонабай»</b> ишларни ташкил қилиш ва маҳаллий маҳсулотларнинг экспорт географиясини кенгайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ишлаб чиқариш фаолияти билан шуғулланадиган корхоналар ўртасида<b> </b>уларнинг экспортга чиқариш имкониятини ўрганиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ишлаб чиқарилаётган маҳаллий маҳсулотларга халқаро бозорлардаги талабни ўрганиш ва таҳлил қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Хорижий мамлакатлар билан музокаралар ўтказиш орқали маҳсулотларининг экспорт кўламини кенгайтириш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахабов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="3"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистонда ишлаб чиқарилган»</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> бренди остида <b>маҳаллий маҳсулотларнинг ташқи бозорлардаги ўрни</b>ни мустаҳкамлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тўқимачилик, электротехника, чарм, қишлоқ хўжалиги маҳсулотлари экспортини ошириш учун <b>нуфузли хорижий брендлар</b> билан музокаралар ўтказиш ва уларни Ўзбекистонга олиб кириш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахабов)</span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></b></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б. Саидов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">46-мақсад: Фискал барқарорликни таъминлаш ва давлат мажбуриятларини самарали бошқариш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб палатаси (М. Абдуллаев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="4"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бюджет маблағларидан фойдаланиш самарадорлиги ва натижадорлигини ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Вазирлик ва идораларнинг бюджет маблағларидан фойдаланиш билан боғлиқ мақсадли индикаторларига эришилганлигини ташқи аудитдан ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Парламент ва ҳукумат ҳамкорлигида бюджет маблағларидан самарали фойдаланиш устидан қатъий парламент назоратини ўрнатиш. Бунда давлат қарзи ҳажмини қонунчиликда белгиланган меъёрда сақлашни таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодий жиноятларга қарши курашиш департаментининг Давлат молиявий назорати инспекцияси,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="5"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Айрим маҳсулотларни ишлаб чиқариш ва реализация қилиш учун компенсация тўлов (йиғим)ини жорий этиш бўйича таклифлар тайёрлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда углерод изи юқори бўлган саноат маҳсулотлари (цемент, кўмир, сиқилган газ ва бошқ.) учун «Карбон йиғими» тизимини жорий этиш ва улардан келиб тушадиган маблағларни ҳудудларда экология муаммоларини ҳал этишга йўналтириш масалалари бўйича таклифлар тайёрлашни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">47-мақсад: Маҳаллий хомашё базасидан самарали фойдаланиш ва илғор технологияларга асосланган саноатни ривожлантириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги (Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="6"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвесторларни жалб қилган ҳолда йирик корхоналар томонидан импорт ўрнини босувчи саноат маҳсулотларини ишлаб чиқаришни кенгайтириш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Импорт қилинаётган саноат маҳсулотларини таҳлил қилиш, маҳаллийлаштириш ва импорт ўрнини босувчи маҳсулотларни ишлаб чиқариш. Бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">импорт ҳажми юқори бўлган саноат маҳсулотларини таҳлил қилиш ва уларни маҳаллийлаштириш бўйича чора-тадбирларни белгилаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">импорт ўрнини босувчи маҳсулотлар ишлаб чиқариш бўйича инвестиция лойиҳалари бўйича таклифларни ишлаб чиқиш ҳамда инвесторларни жалб қилиш чораларини кўриш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">саноатнинг «драйвер» соҳаларини ривожлантириш мақсадида йирик корхоналар томонидан импорт ўрнини босувчи саноат маҳсулотларни ишлаб чиқаришни йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Божхона қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Мавлонов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">48-мақсад: Саноатнинг «драйвер» соҳаларини ривожлантириш ва ҳудудларнинг саноат салоҳиятини тўлиқ ишга солиш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги (Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="7"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳудудлар салоҳиятидан келиб чиқиб, хорижий ва маҳаллий инвесторларни жалб қилиш учун янги инвестиция лойиҳа таклифларини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳудудлардаги лойиҳа офислари томонидан ҳудудларнинг ихтисослигидан келиб чиқиб, лойиҳалар рўйхатини шакллантириш ва бизнес режаларни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Янги лойиҳа таклифларини хорижий ва маҳаллий инвесторларга тақдим қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Янги лойиҳаларни ишга тушириш бўйича амалий ишларни бошлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="8"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Йирик корхоналар томонидан <b>ESG ҳисоботларини</b> юритиш амалиётини йўлга қўйиш ҳамда жамоатчиликка ошкор этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Йирик стратегик корхоналарда ESG тамойилларини жорий этиш бўйича ҳар бир корхона (банк)да тайёргарлик даражасини ўрганиш (диагностика ўтказиш).</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил август</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхоналарнинг маблағлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">халқаро молия институтлари</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«UzAssets» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Яшил иқтисодиёт маркази,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">стратегик корхоналар ва тижорат банклари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Диагностика натижаларига кўра корпоратив ESG дастурларини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил октябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тайёргарлик даражаси юқори бўлган 5 та йирик корхоналарда ESG ҳисоботини тайёрлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="9"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кимё саноати корхоналарининг иссиқхона газлари ажратмаларини хатловдан ўтказиш ва углеродни тартибга солиш механизмлари таъсирини баҳолаш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Маҳаллий кимё саноати маҳсулотларини ишлаб чиқарувчи 2 та корхонанинг иссиқхона газлари ажратмаларини тажриба-синов тариқасида хатловдан ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзкимёсаноат» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Яшил иқтисодиёт маркази,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзгидромет агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Хабибуллаев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хатлов натижасидан келиб чиқиб, халқаро талабларга тайёргарлик даражасини ошириш бўйича таклифлар ишлаб чиқиш ва Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил октябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="10"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Миллий шаффофлик тизими доирасида иссиқхона газларини </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">мустақил текшириш ташкилоти</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> (валидация ва верификация компанияси) фаолиятини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иссиқхона газлари ажратмаларини текшириш ташкилотини (валидация ва верификация компанияси) белгиланган тартибда аккредитациядан ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Яшил иқтисодиёт маркази,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Жуманазаров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="11"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Яшил энергия» сертификатларининг эмиссия ҳажмини <b>400</b> мингга етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхона ва банкларда «углерод изи»ни қисқартириш бўйича қайта тикланувчи энергия манбалари орқали ишлаб чиқарилган ҳар бир <b>1000</b> кВТ/с электр энергияси учун хўжалик юритувчи субъектларга, шу жумладан давлат иштирокидаги корхона ва банкларга «яшил энергия» сертификатларининг эмиссия ҳажмини <b>400</b> мингтага етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Йил якунига қадар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхона ва банкларнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Яшил иқтисодиёт маркази,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«UzAssets» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Тоғ-кон саноати ва геология вазирлиги (Б. Исламов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="12"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Мурунтов» конини ўзлаштириш инвестиция лойиҳасининг навбатдаги босқичларини амалга ошириш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Инвестиция лойиҳасини (<i>V навбат 1-босқич)</i> амалга ошириш доирасида асбоб-ускуналарни қурилиш майдончасига етказиш, ўрнатиш ва қурилиш-монтаж ишларини якунига етказиш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хорижий банкларнинг кредит маблағлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">халқаро облигациялар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«НКМК» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Қ. Санакулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Мурунтов» конини ўзлаштириш инвестиция лойиҳасининг V навбат 1-босқичини фойдаланишга топшириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="13"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзметкомбинат» АЖда йилига 1 млн тонна иссиқ ҳолда прокатланган лист ўрамлар ишлаб чиқариш қувватига эга Қуюв прокатлаш мажмуасини фойдаланишга топшириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Мажмуанинг қурилиш ишларини якунлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Техник-иқтисодий асосга мувофиқ</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(хорижий банк кредит маблағлари)</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзметкомбинат» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Мажмуанинг технологик ускуналарининг монтаж ишларини якунлаш ҳамда совуқ ва иссиқ ҳолда синовлардан ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май-июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Қуюв прокатлаш мажмуасини фойдаланишга топшириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="14"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ёшлик I»</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> конини ўзлаштириш» (<i>I навбат 1-босқич)</i> инвестиция лойиҳаси доирасида 60 млн тонна рудани қайта ишлаш қувватига эга 3-Мис бойитиш фабрикасини тўлиқ ишга тушириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 65 млн тонна маъданни ташиш қувватига эга циклли оқим технологияси қурилиши доирасида қурилиш-монтаж ишларини тўлиқ якунлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ТИАга мувофиқ «Олмалиқ КМК» АЖ маблағлари ва хорижий банк кредитлари)</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Олмалиқ КМК» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 3-мис бойитиш фабрикаси учун асосий технологик ускуналарни қурилиш майдончасига етказиш, ўрнатиш ва монтаж қилиш ишларини якунига етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 60 млн тонна рудани қайта ишлаш қувватига эга 3-мис бойитиш фабрикасининг биринчи линиясини фойдаланишга топшириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="15"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистонда қора металлургия саноатини 2030 йилга қадар ривожлантириш стратегиясини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қора металлургия саноатини 2030 йилга қадар ривожлантириш стратегиясини ишлаб чиқиш ва Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда:</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">металлургия корхоналарини қора металл хомашёси билан барқарор таъминлашни;</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">қора металл прокати маҳсулотлари ишлаб чиқариш ҳажмини 2 бараварга оширишни;</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">импорт қилинадиган бутловчи буюмлар, эҳтиёт қисмлар ва материалларни маҳаллийлаштиришни;</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">энергетика, шу жумладан қайта тикланувчи энергия манбалари ва қурилиш соҳалари учун металл конструкциялар ишлаб чиқаришни ўзлаштиришни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Абдухакимов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Жуманазаров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="16"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиётнинг драйвер тармоқлари учун минерал хомашё базаси захираларини кўпайтириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Геология соҳасини истиқболли ривожлантириш ҳамда олиб борилаётган геология-қидирув ишларини янада жадаллаштиришга қаратилган 2026 — 2030 йилларга мўлжалланган минерал хомашё базасини ривожлантириш стратегиясини ишлаб чиқиш ва Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Энергетика вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(Ж. Мирзамахмудов)</i>,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="17"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳудудларда мавжуд минерал хомашё ресурсларидан самарали фойдаланиш мақсадида истиқболли майдонларда қимматбаҳо, рангли ва ноёб металлар бўйича геология-қидирув ишларини ўтказиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тадбиркорлик субъектларига қимматбаҳо, рангли, ноёб металлар ҳамда норуда кон ва участкаларини (жами 390 та) шаффоф механизмлар асосида онлайн аукцион орқали таклиф этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хорижий ва маҳаллий инвестициялар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кадастр агентлиги</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(Ф. Пулатов)</i>,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат активларини бошқариш агентлиги</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(А. Ортиқов)</i>,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">49-мақсад: Мамлакатимизнинг инвестициявий жозибадорлигини янада ошириш ва қимматли қоғозлар бозорини жадал ривожлантириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги (Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="18"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Йирик ва салоҳиятли хорижий инвесторларни Ўзбекистонга кенг жалб этиш орқали тўғридан-тўғри инвестициялар оқимини кўпайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тўртинчи Тошкент халқаро инвестиция форуми </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ва Хорижий инвесторлар кенгашининг учинчи ялпи мажлисига пухта тайёргарлик кўриш ва уларни юқори савияда ўтказиш юзасидан барча зарурий чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б. Саидов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="19"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йилда 42 млрд доллар хорижий инвестицияларни жалб қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳаларни амалга ошириш ҳолати ва инвестицияларни ўзлаштириш режасини бажариш бўйича ойлик мониторинг олиб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тегишли вазирлик, идора ва хўжалик бирлашмалари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳаларни амалга оширишнинг барча жараёнларида вазирликлар, идоралар, тижорат банклари ва ҳудудлар раҳбарлари фаолиятини мувофиқлаштириб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳалар доирасида аниқланган муаммоларни ҳал қилиб бориш ва режа кўрсаткичларининг бажарилишини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="20"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Истиқболли лойиҳаларга салоҳиятли инвесторларни жалб этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Истиқболли лойиҳалар рўйхатини шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Манфаатдор вазирлик, идора ва хўжалик бирлашмалари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ташаббускорлар билан биргаликда лойиҳаолди ҳужжатларини тайёрлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хорижий инвесторлар ва халқаро молия институтлари билан тақдимот ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Истиқболли лойиҳалар бўйича салоҳиятли хорижий инвесторлар билан келишувларга эришиш ва уларни амалга ошириш босқичларини назарда тутувчи «йўл харитаси»ни тасдиқлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="21"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвесторларга давлат хизматларини кўрсатишда қулайликлар яратиш, инвестиция лойиҳаларини ишга тушириш билан боғлиқ жараёнларни соддалаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">бандлик, биржа, кадастр, ер муносабатлари, аукцион, солиқ, лицензиялаш ва бошқа давлат хизматлари билан боғлиқ электрон платформалар Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлигининг инвестиция порталига интеграция қилинишини таъминлаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">инвесторларга мазкур портал орқали инвестиция лойиҳаларини ишга тушириш ва амалга ошириш билан боғлиқ барча давлат хизматлари «ягона дарча» тамойили асосида кўрсатиш амалиётини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Камбағалликни қисқартириш ва бандлик вазирлиги (Б. Зохидов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="22"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Меҳнат давомида ходимнинг ҳаёти ёки соғлиғига етказилган зарарнинг ўрнини қоплаш кафолатларини кучайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Иш берувчининг суғурта мажбуриятига риоя этишини кузатиш ва назорат қилишга имкон берувчи ахборот тизимини яратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ахборот тизими орқали иш берувчининг фуқаролик жавобгарлигини суғурталаш ҳолатини таҳлил қилиш орқали суғурта шартномаси тузмаган иш берувчиларга нисбатан қонунчиликда белгиланган тартибда жавобгарликка тортиш амалиётини йўлга қўйишни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Истиқболли лойиҳалар миллий агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Ли)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги (Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="23"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Вазирлик ва идораларнинг мавжуд ахборот тизимларида хизматлар кўрсатиш (бизнесни рўйхатдан ўтказиш, инфратузилмага уланиш, махсус ҳуқуқий режимда иштирок этиш учун ариза бериш ва бошқалар) орқали <b>«ягона инвестиция платформаси»</b>ни тўғридан-тўғри интеграция қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги ва Адлия вазирлигининг сўралган ахборот тизимлари ва хизматларини «invest.gov.uz» платформаси билан тўғридан-тўғри интеграция қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Интеграциялашган тизимларга эга бўлган платформадаги барча хатолар ва кечикишларни текшириш ва бартараф этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Якуний синов ва дастурий таъминотни ишга тушириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><i>Ижро учун асосий масъул</i></b><i> — «Ўзкимёсаноат» АЖ (О. Темиров)</i></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="24"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Навоийазот» АЖ томонидан технологик кластерлар учун 300 МВт фото электр станциясини ташкил этиш лойиҳасини ишга тушириш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳа доирасида қуёш панелларини етказиб келиш ва ўрнатишни бошлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май-июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хорижий инвестициялар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Энергетика вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ж. Мирзамахмудов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Объектни фойдаланишга топшириш ва тармоққа улаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="25"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Acwa Power UKS Green Н2» МЧЖ ҚК томонидан 52 МВт шамол электр станцияси ва йилига 3000 тонна «яшил» водород» ишлаб чиқаришни ташкил этиш лойиҳасини ишга тушириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳанинг 1-босқичи доирасида «яшил» водород» лойиҳасини ишга тушириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хорижий инвестициялар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Энергетика вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ж. Мирзамахмудов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бухоро вилоят ҳокимлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б. Зарипов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳанинг 2-босқичи доирасида шамол турбиналарини етказиб келиш ва ўрнатиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Шамол турбиналарини ишга тушириш орқали лойиҳани тўлиқ фойдаланишга топшириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил октябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="26"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Молиялаштириш манбаларини диверсификация қилиш ва халқаро инвесторлар базасини кенгайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Бозор шароитидан келиб чиқиб Ўзбекистон Республикасининг навбатдаги суверен халқаро облигацияларини жойлаштириш бўйича таклиф киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Халқаро тажрибани ўрганган ҳолда Ўзбекистон Республикасида муқобил молия инструментларини жорий қилиш юзасидан таклиф киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Давлат ғазначилик облигациялари бозорини ривожлантириш чораларини кўриш. Бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">йиллик чиқариладиган жами давлат қимматли қоғозларининг камида 30 фоизи ўрта ва узоқ муддатли облигацияларни ташкил этишини таъминлаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">давлат ғазначилик облигациялари ликвидлигини ошириш ҳамда мажбуриятларни бошқариш амалиётини қўллаш юзасидан таклифлар ишлаб чиқиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">халқаро инвесторларни ички молия бозорига жалб қилиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Ташкулов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Марказий банк</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б. Ҳамраев),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат активларини бошқариш агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Ортиқов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">50-мақсад: Банк тизимида ислоҳотларни жадаллаштириш, банк хизматлари бозори ҳажмини ошириш ва соҳада рақобатни ривожлантириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Марказий банк (Т. Ишметов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="27"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Барқарор иқтисодий ўсиш суръатларини таъминлашда ички жамғармалар ва молиявий ресурслардан самарали фойдаланиш имкониятларини кенгайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Аҳолининг молиявий саводхонлигини ва банк хизматлари билан қамраб олиш даражасини ошириш мақсадида <b>Молиявий оммабопликни ошириш стратегиясини</b> ишлаб чиқиш ва амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Аҳолининг банклардаги депозитлари ҳажмини <b>11 млрд долларга</b> ва банклардаги жами муддатли депозитларни <b>10 млрд</b> долларга етишини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тижорат банклари томонидан иқтисодиётга жами <b>300 трлн</b> сўмлик кредит ресурслари йўналтирилишини, шу жумладан кичик ва ўрта тадбиркорлик субъектларига <b>120 трлн</b> сўмлик кредитлар ажратилишини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">51-мақсад: «Яшил иқтисодиёт»га ўтиш, унинг асоси бўлган қайта тикланувчи энергиядан фойдаланиш кўрсаткичларини кескин ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Энергетика вазирлиги (Ж. Мирзамахмудов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="28"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иссиқлик станцияларидаги <b>эски</b> ва <b>энергия самарадорлиги паст</b> қурилмаларни босқичма-босқич фойдаланишдан чиқариш (консервация қилиш). </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Иссиқлик электр станцияларидаги маънан ва жисмонан эскирган қурилмаларни фойдаланишдан чиқариш бўйича Вазирлар Маҳкамасига таклиф киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Иссиқлик электр станциялари» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ангрен ИЭСда маънан ва жисмонан эскирган 3-сон қозон ва 1, 2-сон турбина агрегатларини фойдаланишдан чиқариш бўйича Вазирлар Маҳкамасига таклиф киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="29"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳридаги 4 та туманда <b>«когенерация»</b> қурилмаларини ишга тушириш лойиҳасини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳани амалга ошириш учун ўрганиш ишларини олиб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Иссиқлик электр станциялари» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳани амалга ошириш бўйича инвесторлар билан музокаралар ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳани амалга ошириш учун Инвесторлар билан тегишли битимларни имзолаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳани амалга ошириш учун Ҳукумат қарори лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш ва Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Қурилиш ишларини бошлаш ва фойдаланишга топшириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил август — декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши Раиси, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимлари</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="30"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат ижтимоий соҳа объектларида «яшил энергия» манбаларидан фойдаланишни кенгайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Боёвут тумани тажрибаси» ўрганиш асосида мактабгача ва мактаб таълими ҳамда соғлиқни сақлаш муассасаларида «яшил энергия» манбаларини жорий қилиш бўйича ҳудудий режаларни белгилаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a0CxSpFirst" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" class="a0CxSpLast" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">халқаро молия институтлари грант маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Энергетика вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ж. Мирзамахмудов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Мазкур режалар асосида ҳар бир ҳудудга <b>грант</b> маблағларини жалб қилиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил якунига қадар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">52-мақсад. Иқтисодиёт тармоқлари ва аҳолини зарур энергия ресурслари билан узлуксиз таъминлаш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Энергетика вазирлиги (Ж. Мирзамахмудов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="31"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республика бўйича янги генерация қувватларини ишга тушириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Умумий қуввати <b>4,5 ГВт</b> бўлган йирик <b>қуёш</b> ва <b>шамол</b> электр станциясини ишга тушириш, қуввати <b>785 мегаватт</b> бўлган қуёш панелларини ўрнатиш, қуввати <b>225 мегаватт</b> бўлган <b>гидроэлектр станцияларини </b>барпо этиш ва <b>1782 мегаватт</b> энергия сақлаш тизимини ишга тушириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь-декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тўғридан-тўғри инвестициялар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекгидроэнерго» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон миллий электр тармоқлари» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">53-мақсад:Ўзбекистон Республикасининг глобал транспорт-логистика тармоқларига интеграциясини чуқурлаштириш ва миллий транспорт тизимининг салоҳиятини ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Транспорт вазирлиги (И. Махкамов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="32"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Миллий <b>транспорт тизимини ривожлантириш</b> бўйича чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш ҳисобига мамлакатнинг <b>барқарор иқтисодий ўсиш</b>ини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мамлакатнинг <b>глобал транспорт-логистика тармоқларига интеграцияси</b>ни жадаллаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">республика ҳудуди орқали транзит юкларини ташиш ҳажмини <b>14,6 млн</b> тоннага етказиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">йўловчи ва юк ташиш хизматлари ҳажмини <b>10 фоиз</b>га ошириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">электрлашган темир йўллари улушини <b>51 фоиз</b>га етказиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">авиақатновлар сонини <b>15 фоиз</b>га оширишни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон темир йўллари» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Uzbekistan Airports» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Uzbekistan Airways» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон темир йўллари» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Uzbekistan Airports» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Uzbekistan Airways» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="33"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республика темир йўл <b>вагонлар паркини янгилаш</b> ва модернизация қилиш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон темир йўллари» АЖ таркибидаги юк вагонлар паркини янгилаш мақсадида <b>1200 та</b> янги юк вагонини ишлаб чиқариш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон темир йўллари» АЖ маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон темир йўллари» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="8" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="34"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="8" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳудудларда жамоат транспорти</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> тизимини ривожлантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="1" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">1.</span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> Ҳудудларда жамоат транспортининг <b>50 та</b> янги йўналишлар тармоғини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="7" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="7" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="7" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳудудларда жамоат транспортида электрон тўловлар жозибадорлигини ошириш ва электрон тўловлар улушини ўртача <b>30 фоиз</b>га етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳудудларда жамоат транспорти учун янги замонавий жами <b>700 та</b> автобус харид қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳудудларда <b>743 та</b> оралиқ бекатларини қуриш ва реконструкция қилиш ишларини ташкиллаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳудудларда <b>16 та</b> </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">автовокзал ва автостанциялар қуриш ва реконструкция қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">6.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Автобуслар ҳаракатига устуворлик бериш мақсадида ҳудудларда жамоат транспорти учун алоҳида автобус йўлакларини <b>150 км</b></span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">га<b> е</b>тказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Жамоат транспортининг йўналишини аҳоли ўртасида электрон танлов асосида овоз йиғиш орқали аниқлаш амалиётини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">8. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Жамоат транспорти тизимини тартибга солиш, аҳолининг вақтини тежаш мақсадида ҳозирда вилоят марказларида мавжуд автобуслар қатновини туман марказларида ҳам жорий қилиш бўйича таклифларни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><s><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></s></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="35"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳри жамоат транспорти</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> тизимини ривожлантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тошкент шаҳридаги автобус йўналишларидаги мавжуд бекатларнинг рўйхатини шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тадбиркорлик субъектлари маблағлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«АТТО» АЖ маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Тошшаҳартрансхизмат» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Автоматлаштирилган тўлов тизими оператори» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Тошкент метрополитени» ДУК</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тошкент шаҳри автобус йўналишларининг бекатларида нақд пулларни қабул қилувчи бир марталик электрон чипта сотиб олиш имконини берувчи, ўзига ўзи хизмат кўрсатиш асосида ишловчи <b>автоматлаштирилган инфокиосклар</b> билан жиҳозлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Брутто-шартнома асосида ташкил этилган йўналишлардаги барча автобусларни <b>«QR чипта»</b>ларни қабул қилувчи <b>«QR reader»</b> қурилмалари билан жиҳозлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Бекатларга нақд пулларни қабул қилувчи бир марталик электрон чипта сотиб олиш имконини берувчи, ўзига ўзи хизмат кўрсатиш асосида ишловчи автоматлаштирилган инфокиосклар ўрнатилганлиги юзасидан тарғибот-ташвиқот ишларини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="36"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро ва вилоятлараро йўналишларда ҳаракат хавфсизлигини таъминлаш ҳамда туристик йўналишларда автобус қатновларининг улушини ошириш мақсадида </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">янги йўналишлар очиш.</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Халқаро автобус йўналишлари сонини <b>36 та</b>дан <b>40 та</b>га етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Масофаси <b>400 км</b>дан ошиқ бўлган вилоятлараро йўналишлар бўйича янги <b>10 та</b> йўналишда катта ҳажмли автобуслар қатновини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="37"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Автомобиль транспорти соҳасини рақамлаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="1" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">1.</span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> Қирғизистон, Тожикистон, давлатлари билан автомобилда юк ва йўловчиларни халқаро ташишга рухсатномаларни айирбошлашда <b>«Е-Permit» ахборот тизимини жорий этиш.</b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:35.4pt 70.8pt 106.2pt 141.6pt 177.0pt 212.4pt 247.8pt 283.2pt 318.6pt 354.0pt 389.4pt 424.8pt 460.2pt 495.6pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">октябрь</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Транспорт ва логистикани ривожлантириш жамғармаси </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Божхона қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Мавлонов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Транспорт назорати инспекцияси</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="1" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2.</span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> Республикада юк ташувлари ва логистика хизматларини рақамлаштириш орқали таъминот занжири иштирокчилари учун мавжуд <b>«Е-logistika» ахборот тизимининг мобиль иловасини ишга тушириш.</b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:35.4pt 70.8pt 106.2pt 141.6pt 177.0pt 212.4pt 247.8pt 283.2pt 318.6pt 354.0pt 389.4pt 424.8pt 460.2pt 495.6pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="38"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Аҳоли ва сайёҳларга қулайликларни янада ошириш мақсадида темир йўл чипталарини онлайн электрон тизим орқали сотиш жараёнини <b>85 фоиз</b>га етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон темир йўллари» АЖ тизимида темир йўл чипталарини мобиль илова ва электрон тўлов тизимлари орқали сотишни ривожлантириб, онлайн электрон тизим орқали сотиш ҳажмини <b>85 фоиз</b>га етказиш чораларини кўриш.<b> </b></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Темир йўл чипталарини сотиш шаффофлигини таъминлаб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон темир йўллари» АЖ маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон темир йўллари» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="39"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички йўлларни таъмирлаш ва сақлаш ва молиялаштириш тизимини такомиллаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Республиканинг барча туман ва шаҳар ободонлаштириш бошқармалари (208 та) таркибида ички йўлларни сақлаш участкаларини ташкил этиш, уларни, шу жумладан юқори малакали йўл хўжалиги мутахассислари билан тўлдириб, муносиб иш шароитларини яратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маҳаллий бюджетлардан ажратилган маблағлар доирасида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ободонлаштириш бошқармаларига ички йўлларни сақлаш учун зарур бўладиган 493 та техника (443 млрд сўм) харид қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳар бир туман ва шаҳар ободонлаштириш бошқармалари таркибида ташкил этиладиган участкаларга қўшимча штат бирликлари ажратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 2025 йилдан бошлаб ҳар бир туман ва шаҳар ободонлаштириш бошқармаларига ички йўлларни сақлаш ва таъмирлаш учун 4 млрд сўмдан жами 832 млрд сўм маблағ ажратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Автомобиль йўллари қўмитаси (Ж. Турсунов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="40"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Автомобиль йўлларида <b>транспорт воситалари ва пиёдаларнинг хавфсиз ҳаракати</b>ни таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Умумий фойдаланишдаги автомобиль йўлларида йўл белгиларини ўрнатиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Автомобиль йўлларида <b>80 та</b>дан ортиқ светофор объектларини ўрнатиш ва мавжудларини реконструкция қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Аҳоли пунктларида пиёдалар ҳаракатланиши учун <b>350</b> <b>км</b>дан ортиқ пиёдалар йўлакларини барпо этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(П. Бобожонов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="41"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республикадаги кўприк инфратузилмасини яхшилаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси ва вилоятлардаги <b>80</b> <b>та</b> кўприк иншоотлари ҳолатини яхшилаш бўйича техник-иқтисодий асосларни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ишлаб чиқилган техник-иқтисодий асосларга кўра халқаро молия институтлари маблағларини жалб қилиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро молия институтлари маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(С. Садуллаев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="42"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маҳаллий ва ички йўлларни цемент-бетон қоплама асосида қуриш ва сақлаш тизимини жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси ва вилоятларда <b>180 км</b> маҳаллий ва ички йўлларни цемент-бетон қоплама билан янгидан қуриш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро молия институтлари маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(С. Садуллаев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="43"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Йўл хўжалиги соҳасида <b>хусусий сектор фаолиятини ривожлантириш</b>.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Автомобиль йўлларида автоматлаштирилган вазн ва ҳажм параметрлари назорати бўйича стационар ва кўчма шохобчалар ўрнатиш ва соҳага хусусий секторни жалб қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда 2025 йилда <b>40 та</b> ўлчов-назорат шохобчалари ўрнатиладиган жойларни электрон онлайн аукцион савдолари орқали тадбиркорлик субъектларига бириктириш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Аутсорсинг асосида <b>260 километр</b> йўлларни эксплуатация қилиш ишларига хусусий секторни жалб қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — «Ўзавтосаноат» АЖ (У. Розукулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="44"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маҳаллий ишлаб чиқарувчилар томонидан жамоат транспорти эҳтиёжлари учун транспорт воситалари ишлаб чиқаришни йўлга қўйиш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республикамизда электробус, автобус ва микроавтобуслар ишлаб чиқариш имкониятларини ўрганиб, маҳаллий тадбиркорлар ва тўғридан-тўғри хорижий инвестициялар жалб қилиш ҳисобига ишлаб чиқаришни йўлга қўйиш лойиҳаларини бошлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хорижий инвестициялар ва тадбиркорлар маблағлари, тижорат банклари кредитлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Жуманазаров)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Андижон вилояти ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Олий Мажлис Сенати (келишув асосида)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="45"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Йўлларни қуриш ва таъмирлашда сифатни таъминлаш ва йўлларни светофорлар билан жиҳозлаш борасида парламент назоратини кучайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳудудларда маҳаллий йўлларнинг аҳволини Автомобиль йўллари қўмитаси ва бошқа масъул вазирлик ва идоралар билан ҳамда маҳаллий Кенгашлар билан биргаликда жойларга чиққан ҳолда ўрганиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Йўл қурилиш соҳасида Автомобиль йўллари қўмитаси ва тегишли вазирлик ҳамда идоралар раҳбарларининг ахборотини Сенат Кенгашида эшитиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил февраль-март ойлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Вазирлар Маҳкамаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ж. Қўчқоров)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Автомобиль йўллари қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ж. Турсунов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маҳаллий ҳокимликлар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">54-мақсад: Қишлоқ хўжалигида ҳосилдорлик ва рентабеллик даражасини кескин ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги (И. Абдурахмонов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="46"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бир гектардан олинадиган ўртача даромадни 5 минг долларга етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Юқори авлодли ва хорижий давлатлардан олиб келинган уруғларни экиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Интенсив технологиялардан (томчилатиб ва ёмғирлатиб суғориш технологиялардан самарали фойдаланиш ва бошқа) фойдаланган ҳолда экинлар парваришини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Агротехник тадбирларни ўз вақтида тизимли ташкил қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Доимий</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Абдухакимов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маҳаллий ҳокимликлар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="47"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалигида сувни тежайдиган суғориш технологияларини жорий қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Қишлоқ хўжалиги экин майдонларида сув тежовчи технологияларни жорий этишни янада кенгайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Жами 500 минг гектар сув тежовчи технологиялар, шундан 232 минг гектар томчилатиб, дискрет суғориш технологияларини жорий этиш, 268 минг гектар майдонларда лазерли текислаш ишларини амалга ошириш ҳисобига 2 — 2,5 млрд куб метр сувни иқтисод қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил октябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Хамраев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="48"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Чорвачиликда йиллик ўсиш суръатини камида 3,8 фоизга етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Чорвачиликда ўсиш суръатини ўртача 3,8 фоизга ошириш бўйича чора-тадбирлар дастурини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ветеринария ва чорвачиликни ривожлантириш қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б. Норқобилов</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">),</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Паррандасаноат» уюшмаси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">қорамоллар бош сонини 14,6 млн бошга, қўй-эчкилар бош сонини 25,3 млн бошга, паррандалар бош сонини 116,1 млн бошга, гўшт ишлаб чиқаришни 3,0 млн тоннага (тирик вазнда), сутни 12,7 млн тоннага етказиш ва 9,5 млрд дона тухум ишлаб чиқариш; </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">чорвачилик субъектлари томонидан четдан 20 мингдан зиёд наслли қорамол ва 80 минг бошга яқин наслдор қўй-эчкиларни олиб келиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">аҳоли хонадонлари ва фермерлардаги 2,5 млн бош сигир ва таналар сунъий уруғлантирилишини ташкил этиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">150 та чорвачилик субъектини наслчилик тоифасига ўтказиш орқали наслчилик хўжаликлари сонини 1800 тага етказишни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="49"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ипак маҳсулотлари ишлаб чиқариш ҳажмини 1,2 баробарга, экспорт ҳажмини 1,5 баробарга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Янги тутзорлар барпо қилиш учун белгиланган ер майдонларини ижарага бериш учун «E-auksion» электрон савдо платформасига жойлаштириш ҳамда ажратилишини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 3,7 трлн сўмлик ипак маҳсулотларини ишлаб чиқаришни ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ипак маҳсулотларининг экспортини 87 млн долларга етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ипакчилик ва жун саноатини ривожлантириш қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Эргашев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="50"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Шаффоф механизмларни жорий этиш орқали рақамли технологиялар ёрдамида қишлоқ хўжалиги маҳсулотлари етиштирувчиларига қулайлик яратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Соҳада ишлаб чиқилган 10 дан ортиқ ахборот тизимларини такомиллаштириб бориш, хизматлар кўрсатилишини йўлга қўйиш орқали қишлоқ хўжалиги маҳсулотлари етиштирувчиларига маълумот алмашиш учун қулай муҳит яратиш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бюджетдан ташқари маблағлар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="51"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мева-сабзавотчиликка ихтисослашган 51 та туманда мева-сабзавотларни шок усулида музлатишни йўлга қўйиш бўйича янги лойиҳаларни амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Йил якуни билан умумий қуввати 44 минг тонна бўлган агрологистика марказларини қуриш лойиҳаларини амалга ошириш, бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар, Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 51 та мева-сабзавотчиликка ихтисослашган туманда мева-сабзавотларни сақлаш бўйича лойиҳаларни шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил август</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳаларнинг манзилли рўйхатини шакллантириш ва молиявий манбаларини аниқлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тармоқ жадвалига асосан</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳаларни ишга тушириш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тармоқ жадвалига асосан</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="52"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маҳаллий сабзавот, полиз, картошка уруғлик таъминотини 50 фоизга етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Уруғчилик соҳасида хусусий сектор жалб қилиниши, элита уруғчилик хўжаликлари хусусийлаштирилиши ҳисобига маҳаллий сабзавот, полиз ва картошка уруғчилигида бирламчи уруғлик материаллари кўпайтирилишини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда оммавий савдолар орқали сотиладиган 39 та элита уруғчилик хўжаликлари томонидан сабзавот, полиз ва картошка уруғларининг юқори авлодли уруғликлари етиштирилишини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Уруғчиликни ривожлантириш маркази,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Шоличилик илмий-тадқиқот институти</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">55-мақсад: Миллий иқтисодиётнинг экспорт салоҳиятини кучайтириш ва унинг таркибида қўшилган қиймати юқори бўлган маҳсулотлар улушини кескин ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги (Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="53"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Драйвер соҳаларнинг экспорт салоҳиятини янада ривожлантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Маҳаллий корхоналар томонидан ишлаб чиқарилаётган экспортбоп маҳсулот ва хизматларни экспорт қилишдаги муаммоларни таҳлил қилиш ва улар юзасидан таклифлар ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Европа, Яқин Шарқ, Африка, Жанубий-Шарқий Осиё мамлакатлари драйвер соҳаларининг бизнес-миссиясини ташкил этиш ҳамда йирик ташкилот ва компаниялар билан музокаралар ўтказиб Ўзбекистондан маҳаллий саноат маҳсулотлари экспортини амалга ошириш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдога кўмаклашиш жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо саноат палатаси</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(Д. Вахабов)</i>,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Савдони ривожлантириш компанияси» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(И. Норқулов)</i>,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Солиқ қўмитаси</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(Ш. Кудбиев)</i>,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Божхона қўмитаси</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(А. Мавлонов)</i></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="54"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Акселератор дастурлари орқали тадбиркорларни экспорт фаолиятига кенг жалб этиш ҳамда экспорт географияси ва <b>товарлар номенклатурасини кенгайтириш.</b></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Европа, Жануби-шарқий Осиё, Яқин Шарқ ва Африка</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> мамлакатларига экспортни жадаллаштириш мақсадида алоҳида «<b>100 маҳсулот акселератор</b>» дастурини ишга тушириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда дастур доирасида нуфузли халқаро консалтинг компаниялари жалб қилиниб, экспортбоп миллий маҳсулотларни ташқи бозорларга олиб кириш бўйича аниқ чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдога кўмаклашиш жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахабов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Савдони ривожлантириш компанияси» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="55"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хориждаги йирик компаниялар билан маҳаллий корхоналар ўртасида бевосита ҳамкорлик ўрнатишга кўмаклашиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хориждаги савдо соҳасида юқори тажрибага эга илғор хорижий мутахассисларни </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Миллий савдо агентлари» сифатида жалб этиш</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> ва улар томонидан:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">истиқболли бозорлардаги салоҳиятли компаниялар билан савдо миссиялари, </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«B2B» учрашувлар ташкил этиш;</span></span></b></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маҳаллий корхоналарда хорижий компаниялар билан музокаралар ўтказиш </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">кўникмаларини шакллантириш</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">истиқболли бозорлардаги компаниялар ва маҳаллий корхоналар ўртасида тўғридан-тўғри экспорт </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">шартномаларини имзолашга кўмаклашиш</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдога кўмаклашиш жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахабов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Савдони ривожлантириш компанияси» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="56"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хорижий мамлакатларда ташкил этиладиган халқаро кўргазма ва ярмаркаларда иштирок этиш самарадорлигини ошириш мақсадида<b> «Made in Uzbekistan»</b> дастури концепциясини такомиллаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. «</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Made in Uzbekistan» дастурини амалга ошириш концепциясини такомиллаштирган ҳолда мазкур дастурни ташкил этишда соҳада узоқ муддатли тажрибага эга малакали </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">хусусий компанияни очиқ танлов асосида жалб қилиш</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдога кўмаклашиш жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахабов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б. Саидов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Кўргазмада намойиш этиладиган маҳсулотлар таркибини қайта кўриб чиққан ҳолда ўзбек брендлари ва маҳсулотларини хорижда илгари сурадиган </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маҳсулот турларини кўпайтириш</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Маҳсулотларни кўргазма стендларида замонавий ва жозибадор шаклда жойлаштириш мақсадида </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«мерчандайзерлар» жалб этиш</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Маҳаллий корхоналарнинг ташқи бозорларда имижини ошириш, маҳсулотлар тўғрисида маълумотларни салоҳиятли харидорларга тўлиқ етказиш мақсадида </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«брендбук»лар яратиш</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Жалб қилинадиган хусусий компания хизмати учун зарур маблағларни </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тўлаб бериш</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="57"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Экспорт қилинаётган маҳсулотлар сифатини назорат қилиш ҳамда хорижий харидорларнинг <b>шикоятлари билан ишлаш тизимини йўлга қўйиш.</b></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Экспорт шартномаларини бажаришни такомиллаштиришга доир Ҳукумат қарори лойиҳасини Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахабов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўсимликлар карантини ва ҳимояси агентлиги,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Божхона қўмитаси</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(А. Мавлонов)</i></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Экспорт шартномасини бажармаётган корхоналар бўйича шикоятларни йўллаш тизими тўғрисидаги маълумотларни ўз ичига олган <b>«Дата Матрикс» усулидаги «QR» кодлаш тизимини йўлга</b> қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Экспорт шартномасига зид равишда маҳсулотни келишилган нав, сифат ва муддатларда сурункали равишда етказиб бермаган корхоналарни <b>«Ноҳалол экспортчилар реестри»га</b> киритиш амалиётини жорий қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> <b>«Ноҳалол экспортчилар реестри»га</b> кирган корхоналарни экспорт қилишда «қизил йўлак» орқали чуқурлаштирилган божхона назоратидан ўтказиш тартибини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="58"><li align="center" class="a0CxSpFirst" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="a0CxSpLast" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Соҳа ва тармоқлар бўйича амалдаги<b> 3 074 та </b>стандартнинг Жаҳон савдо ташкилоти талабларига <b>мослигини кўриб чиқиш.</b></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Вазирлик, идора ва хўжалик бирлашмалари таклифига асосан кўриб чиқиладиган амалдаги стандартлар рўйхатини шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Рўйхатга мувофиқ ЖСТ талаблари асосида таҳлилларни ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Таҳлил натижалари асосида стандартларни Жаҳон савдо ташкилоти талабларига мослиги тўғрисида хулоса тайёрлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Хулоса натижалари асосида Стандартлаштириш дастурини шакллантириш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Жуманазаров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> —</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги (А. Жуманазаров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="59"><li align="center" class="a0CxSpFirst" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="a0CxSpLast" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Янги халқаро стандартларни амалиётга жорий этиш бўйича чора-тадбирлар режасини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тегишли вазирлик, идора ва хўжалик бирлашмалари таклифига мувофиқ <b>1 700</b> <b>та</b> халқаро (минтақавий) стандартни харид қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон стандартлар институтининг ҳисоб-китобларига асосан</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Стандартларни давлат тилига таржима қилиш учун Ўзбекистон стандартлар институтига зарур маблағларни ажратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Буюртмага асосан</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="a0CxSpLast" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Халқаро (минтақавий) стандартларни ўрнатилган тартибда қабул қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> ISO, Global GAP, FDA, Halal, Organic каби халқаро стандартларни <b>1 334</b> та корхонада жорий этилишини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="60"><li align="center" class="a0CxSpFirst" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="a0CxSpLast" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республикада халқаро даражада тан олинган, синовлар ишончлилигини таъминлашга хизмат қилувчи ҳамда хорижий давлатлар амалиётида ижобий самара берган <b>аккредитация хизматларини</b> жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Миллий аккредитация тизимида кўрсатилаётган ва халқаро даражада тан олинган аккредитация хизматлар турини ошириш ва <b>14 тага</b> етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Халқаро тажрибага асосланган ва ILAC талабларидан келиб чиқиб, малакани текшириш провайдерларини <b>ISO/IEC 17043</b>, тиббий-ташхис лабораторияларини <b>ISO 15189</b>, инспекция органларини <b>ISO/IEC 17020</b> халқаро стандартлар бўйича аккредитация қилиш хизматларини жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон стандартлар институтининг ҳисоб-китобларига асосан</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Худаяров),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="61"><li align="center" class="a0CxSpFirst" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="a0CxSpLast" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Синов лабораториялар базасини ривожлантириш</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> бўйича инвестицияларни кенг жалб қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Қуёш панеллар, совиткич ва музлаткичлар</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> ҳамда <b><span>қишлоқ хўжалиги техникалари ағдариш бурчаги</span></b> синовини амалга оширувчи замонавий синов лабораториялари мавжуд ривожланган давлатлар тажрибасини ўрганиш ва ҳамкорликни йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Мазкур лабораторияларни республикада ташкил этиш учун талаб этиладиган <b>ускуналар рўйхатини</b> шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> <b>Қуёш панеллар, совиткич</b> <b>ва музлаткичлар</b> ҳамда <b>қишлоқ хўжалиги техникалари ағдариш бурчаги</b> синовини амалга оширувчи замонавий синов лабораторияларини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хорижий инвесторлар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзэлтехсаноат» уюшмаси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзавтосаноат» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="62"><li align="center" class="a0CxSpFirst" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="a0CxSpLast" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Миллий эталонлар базасини кенгайтириш ва уларнинг умумий сонини <b>51 тага</b> етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Янги миллий эталонлар юзасидан техник топшириқларни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. 9 та</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> эталонларни қонунчилик ҳужжатларида белгиланган тартибда харид қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат бюджетидан ажратилган маблағлар доирасида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Хайдаров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">56-мақсад: Монопол соҳаларни бозор тамойилларига изчил ўтказиш, иқтисодиётда хусусий сектор улушини ошириш, тадбиркорларга эркин фаолият юритиши учун энг қулай шароитлар яратиш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Рақобатни ривожлантириш ва истеъмолчилар ҳуқуқларини ҳимоя қилиш қўмитаси (А. Қаюмов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="63"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Истеъмолчиларнинг мурожаатларини кўриб чиқиш самарадорлигини ошириш мақсадида 2025 йил 1 декабрдан бошлаб <b>«Истеъмолчи мурожаати»</b> электрон тизимини жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мазкур <b>«Истеъмолчи мурожаати»</b> электрон тизими орқали барча истеъмолчиларнинг мурожаатларини қабул қилиш ва барча босқичларда мониторинг қилиб боришни йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Истеъмолчиларнинг мурожаатларини тизим орқали онлайн равишда тўғридан-тўғри тадбиркорлик субъектига йўналтириш ва хўжалик юритувчи субъект томонидан масала ҳал этилишига эришиш. Шунингдек, тизимда онлайн равишда корхоналарнинг мурожаатларни ҳал этиш бўйича рейтингини шакллантириб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 2025 йил сентябрь ойида техник йўриқнома ишлаб чиқилиб, экспертизадан ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 2025 йил ноябрь ойида тест режимида ишга тушириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 2025 йил декабрь ойида тўлиқ ишга тушириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Натижада истеъмолчиларнинг мурожаатларини кўриб чиқишда тадбиркорлик субъектлари фаолиятига давлат органларининг аралашуви камайишига эришиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг Халқ қабулхонаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(У. Мухаммадиев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бош прокуратура</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Н. Йўлдошев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Солиқ қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Кудбиев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Тошқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон техник тартибга солиш агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Жуманазаров)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Хидоятов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Худаяров)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Кутбиддинов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахабов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бизнес-омбудсман</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Касимов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">57-мақсад: Рақамли технологияларни ривожлантирган ҳолда мамлакатни минтақавий «IT-HUB»га айлантириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги (Ш. Шерматов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="64"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро аҳамиятга эга автомагистрал ва темир йўлларда мобиль интернет қамровини кенгайтириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро аҳамиятга эга автомагистрал ва темир йўлларнинг мобиль интернет билан қамров даражасини 95 фоизгача етказиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="65"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақамли технологиялар соҳасида экспорт қилувчи корхоналар сони ҳамда IT хизматлар ва дастурий маҳсулотлар ҳажмини ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>1.</b> IT парк экспорт қилувчи резидентлари сонини 250 тага ошириш, шу жумладан хорижий капитал иштирокидаги компанияларни 50 тага кўпайтириш.</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>2.</b> IT парк резидентлари сонини 3 000 тага ҳамда IT хизматлар ва дастурий маҳсулотлар ҳажмини 20 трлн сўмга етказиш.</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>3.</b> IT парк резидентлари фаолиятига салбий таъсир кўрсатувчи турли хил чекловларни камайтириш ва олиб ташлаш юзасидан таклифларни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="66"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақамли технологиялар соҳасидаги стартап-лойиҳаларни қўллаб-қувватлаш ва соҳада яратилган иш ўринлари сонини ошириш. </span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Рақамли стартаплар» дастури доирасида хорижий тажриба асосида 4 та акселерация дастурларини ташкиллаштириш ва уларда 50 та стартап-лойиҳалар иштирокини таъминлаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">58-мақсад: Ўзбекистонда ташқи ва ички туризмни ривожлантириш учун кенг шароитлар яратиш орқали сайёҳлар сонини ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Туризм қўмитаси (У. Шадиев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="67"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Табиий маҳсулотлардан фойдаланган ҳолда ўзига хос сувенирларни ишлаб чиқарувчи <b>ҳунармандларни қўллаб-қувватлаш</b>, миллий анъаналарни сақлаш ва моддий меросни тарғибот қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳунармандларга <b>хом ашёни арзон </b>ва<b> тез етказиб бериш</b> механизмларини яратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳунарманд уюшмаси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Янги маҳсулот (сувенир) турларини яратиш учун креатив ёндашувларни рағбатлантириш, айниқса замон билан ҳамнафас ёш ҳунармандлар учун қулай ишлаб чиқариш инфратузилмасини яратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳунарманд уюшмаси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маҳаллий ва халқаро кўргазмалар ташкил этиш орқали ҳунармандлар маҳсулотларини кенг аудиторияга етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳунарманд уюшмаси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б. Саидов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳунармандлар учун замонавий технологиялар, маҳаллий ва халқаро тўлов тизимлари билан ҳамкорликда нақд пулсиз-онлайн тўлов механизмларини кенгайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳунарманд уюшмаси</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="68"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Туризм хизматларини диверсификация қилиш ва янги туризм йўналишларини кенгайтириш ва хорижий сайёҳларнинг республикада ўртача қолиш муддатини 10 — 12 кунга етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мамлакатнинг бой табиати, кўплаб миллий боғлари ва ёввойи ҳайвонот оламига саёҳатчиларни жалб қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">миллий боғлар ва табиий қўриқхоналарни сафари турлари учун мослаштириш, уларнинг инфратузилмасини яхшилаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақум ва Қизилқум чўллари ҳудудида сайёҳлар учун кўнгилочар масканларни ташкил этиш чораларини кўриш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сафари ва кемпинг масканлари ҳудудларига олиб борувчи йўллар ва инфратузилмани яхшилаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сафари ҳудудларида экологик меъёрларга мос меҳмонхона, ётоқ жойлари ва кемпингларни ташкил қилиш, бу орқали туристларга қулай ва табиатга зарарсиз туризмни амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташаббускорлар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="69"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Туристларга қулайлик яратиш мақсадида соҳани рақамлаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сайёҳларга меҳмонхоналарни банд қилиш, авиа ва темир йўл чипталарини сотиб олиш, такси хизматларидан фойдаланиш, маданий тадбир ёки объектларга чипталар харид қилиш имкониятини берувчи Миллий туризм ягона платформасини яратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Туризмни қўллаб-қувватлаш жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Транспорт вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Махкамов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маданият вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(О. Назарбеков)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маданий мерос агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Транспорт вазирлиги (И. Махкамов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="70"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ногиронлиги бўлган шахслар учун жамоат транспорти ҳамда транспорт инфратузилмаларида тўсиқсиз ҳаракатланиш учун шароитлар яратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тошкент шаҳри ва вилоят марказларидаги 4600 та автобус бекатлари, 14 та автовокзал ва 156 та автостанцияларда, 37 та темир йўл вокзалларида, Тошкент шаҳри ҳамда вилоят марказларида ҳаракатланадиган барча автобусларда ногиронлиги бўлган шахслар учун тўсиқсиз ҳаракатланиш учун шароитлар яратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Пиёдалар йўлларида ногиронлар учун тенг шароитлар яратиш, светофорларда ногиронлар учун махсус товуш чиқарувчи қурилмалар ўрнатиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташаббускорлар ҳамда хўжалик бирлашмалари маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижтимоий ҳимоя миллий агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(С. Абдуллаев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(П. Бобожонов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон темир йўллари» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">59-мақсад: Ҳудудларда хизматлар соҳасини жадал ривожлантириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Давлат активларини бошқариш агентлиги (А. Ортиков)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="71"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Аҳоли гавжум бўлган кўчаларда савдо, маиший, сайилгоҳ ва кўнгилочар хизматларини ривожлантириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳудудларда савдо, маиший, сайилгоҳ ва кўнгилочар хизматларини ривожлантириш учун ҳар йили бир мингта бўш ер майдонларини аукцион савдоларига чиқариш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">инфратузилмаси мавжуд ва аҳоли гавжум ҳудудларда бўш ер майдонларини аниқлаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">аниқланган ер майдонларини белгиланган тартибда аукционга чиқариш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">аукционга чиқарилган ер майдонларини улар тўғрисида ҳоким ёрдамчилари томонидан, шунингдек, оммавий ахборот воситаларида тарғибот ишларини жадаллаштириш орқали сотиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(Ш. Хидоятов)</i>,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(И. Норқулов)</i>,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кадастр агентлиги</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(Ф. Пулатов)</i>,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:76%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><i>Ижро учун асосий масъуллар</i></b><i> — Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</i></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Кўчаларда «Street food» фестивалларини ташкил этиш орқали озиқ-овқат хизматларини ривожлантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги (Ш. Хидоятов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="72"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Шаҳар ва туманлар меъморий қиёфасини яхшилаш, мавжуд биноларнинг ташқи фасад қисмини таъмирлаш, кўнгилочар ва тадбиркорлик биноларини қуриш мақсадида шаҳар ва туманлар марказий кўчаларининг лойиҳа концепцияларини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Шаҳар ва туманларнинг марказий кўчаларини танлаб олиш ҳамда лойиҳа концепциясини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">махсус лицензияга эга маҳаллий ва хорижий лойиҳа ташкилотларини жалб қилиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳудудларнинг иқлим шароити ҳамда ушбу ҳудудда яшовчи аҳолининг асосий касб турини инобатга олиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Автомобиль йўллари қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ж. Турсунов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Туризм қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(У. Шодиев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Абдурахмонов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="73"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро ва давлат аҳамиятидаги магистрал йўли бўйи ҳудудларида хизмат кўрсатиш объектларини кўпайтириш, логистика марказларини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Халқаро аҳамиятга эга А-380 ва М-37 йўли бўйида ҳудудидаги қишлоқ хўжалигида фойдаланилмайдиган ер майдонларини танлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Танланган ер майдонларида хизмат кўрсатиш объектларини жойлаштириш бўйича лойиҳа концепциясини ишлаб чиқиш ҳамда аукцион (е-auksion, k-savdo) савдоларига чиқариш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Амалга ошириладиган лойиҳалар доирасида зарурий кредит маблағларини тижорат банклари томонидан ажратилишига кўмаклашиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳаларни белгиланган муддатларда ишга тушириш ҳамда доимий мониторинг қилиб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Автомобиль йўллари қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ж. Турсунов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Абдураҳмонов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> —<s> </s>Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="74"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="21" style="text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо, маиший, сайилгоҳ ва кўнгилочар хизматларини ривожлантириш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Танлаб олинган кўчаларда хатлов ўтказиб, бўш ер майдонларини аниқлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Аниқланган бўш ер майдонларини лотларга ажратиб </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">аукцион (е-auksion, k-savdo)<i> </i>савдоларига чиқариш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Шаҳарсозлик лойиҳалари асосида зарурий инфратузилмаси мавжуд ва аҳоли гавжум бўлган кўчаларда <b>221 та</b> савдо, маиший, сайилгоҳ ва кўнгилочар хизматларини ташкил этиш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кадастр агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ф. Пулатов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Хидоятов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат активларини бошқариш агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">А. Ортиков)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="75"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="21" style="text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Янги Ўзбекистон» массивларида ва халқаро автомобиль йўллари бўйида савдо ва сервис объектларини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Янги Ўзбекистон» массивлари ҳудудларидаги ҳамда халқаро автомобиль йўллари бўйларидаги қишлоқ хўжалигида фойдаланилмайдиган ер майдонларини танлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Танланган ер майдонларида хизмат кўрсатиш объектларини жойлаштириш мақсадида бўш ер майдонларини аукцион (</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">е-auksion, k-savdo) савдоларига чиқариш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Амалга ошириладиган лойиҳалар доирасида зарур кредит маблағларини тижорат банклари томонидан ажратилишига кўмаклашиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳаларни белгиланган муддатларда ишга тушириш ҳамда доимий мониторинг қилиб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Транспорт вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Маҳкамов</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кадастр агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ф. Пўлатов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Хидоятов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат активларини бошқариш агентлиги</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(А. Ортиқов)</i></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Вазирлар Маҳкамаси (Ж. Ходжаев, Ж. Қўчқоров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="76"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="21" style="text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳудудлараро саноат кооперация алоқаларини ривожлантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳудудлар кесимида ҳар йили Ҳудудлараро кооперация ва ҳамкорлик форумини ташкил этиш амалиётини йўлга қўйиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">форум республика ҳудудидаги саноат корхоналари, етказиб берувчи ташкилотлар ва кенг тадбиркорлик доираси вакиллари, молия, банк, логистика ва бошқа бизнес хизматларини кўрсатувчи ташкилотлар иштирокида ташкил этиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">форум натижалари бўйича ҳудудлараро янги бизнес алоқаларини йўлга қўйиш, саноат ва бошқа соҳаларда янги лойиҳаларни бошлаш учун шароитлар яратиш, шунингдек, соҳада мавжуд муаммоларни ўрганиш, уларни ҳал этиш бўйича таклифларни Ҳукуматга киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил якунига қадар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">60-мақсад: Ҳудудларни комплекс ривожлантириш, урбанизация стратегиясини амалга ошириш, аҳолини арзон уй-жой билан таъминлаш даражасини ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги (Ш. Хидоятов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="77"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">135 минг хонадонли кўп қаватли уй-жойлар қуриш ва «Янги Ўзбекистон» массивлари сонини 55 тага етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 2025 йил учун уй-жой қурилиши ва ипотека дастурини ишлаб чиқишда янгидан барпо этиладиган «Янги Ўзбекистон» ва бошқа массивларни шаҳарлар ҳамда уларга туташ ҳудудларда жойлаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Янги Ўзбекистон» массивлари ва уй-жойга талаб юқори бўлган ҳудудларда 135 минг (шундан 15 мингтаси янги Тошкент) хонадонли кўп қаватли уй-жойлар қурилишини амалга оширишни ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тижорат банкларининг кредитлари, Давлат бюджети маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Марказий банк</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Т. Ишметов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="78"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="21" style="text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Миришкор, Ғиждувон, Ромитан, Чимбой ва Амударё туманларининг комплекс иқтисодий ривожланиш <b>мастер-режаларини</b> тажриба-синов тариқасида <b>«яшил» тамойиллар</b> асосида ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:25.55pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Танланган туманларнинг ижтимоий-иқтисодий ҳолатини ўрганиш, аҳоли, тадбиркорлар ва маҳаллий ҳокимлик вакиллари билан учрашувлар ва муҳокамалар ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Макроиқтисодий ва ҳудудий тадқиқотлар институти,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, Бухоро ва Қашқадарё вилоятлари ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:25.55pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳудудларни ривожлантириш йўналишларининг «яшил тамойиллари»дан келиб чиққан ҳолда белгилаш ва «яшил» пилот лойиҳаларни шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:25.55pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Танланган туманларни комплекс иқтисодий ривожлантириш мастер-режаларини «яшил тамойиллар» ва «яшил» пилот лойиҳаларни ҳисобга олган ҳолда ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="79"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="21" style="text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Зарбдор тажрибаси» асосида </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1156</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">та</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">, «драйвер» лойиҳаларни амалга ошириш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Танлаб олинган «драйвер» лойиҳаларни зарур инфратузилма <i>(электр, сув таъминоти, йўлни, ирригация, канализация, дренаж тизимларини таъмирлаш, ҳудудни ободонлаштириш ва ҳоказо)</i> билан таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Инфратузилма билан таъминланган ҳудудлардаги бўш ер майдонларни лотларга ажратиб аукцион савдоларига чиқариш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Аукцион савдоларида сотиб олинган ёки тадбиркорнинг ўзининг ер майдонида саноат, савдо ва сервис ҳамда қишлоқ хўжалигида <i>(сой бўйи, соҳил бўйи, 24/7 кўча, боғлар, сайилгоҳлар, янги ерларни ўзлаштириш ва </i></span></span><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳоказо</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> лойиҳаларни амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бюджет маблағлари, тижорат банкларининг кредитлари, аҳоли ва тадбиркорларнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Марказий банк</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Т. Ишметов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="80"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="21" style="text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида Республикада 15 та туман (шаҳар)ни жадал комплекс ривожлантириш дастурини амалга ошириш ҳамда қўшимча 15 та ҳудудлар бўйича таклифлар киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Туман марказини аҳоли яшаши ва дам олиши учун қулай шаҳарга айлантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Замонавий ёшлар ҳудудини ташкил қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Йўлбўйи инфратузилмасини ривожлантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Инфратузилмани ривожлантириш, «яшил тамойиллар»ни жорий қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бюджет маблағлари, тижорат банкларининг кредитлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Марказий банк</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Т. Ишметов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кадастр агентлиги (Ф. Пулатов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="81"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фазовий маълумотлар миллий инфратузилмасини яратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Фазовий маълумотлар миллий инфратузилмасини яратиш» инвестицион лойиҳасининг техник топшириғини ишлаб чиқиш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Қудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Техник-иқтисодий асосланувини тегишли вазирлик ва идоралардан билан келишиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Фазовий маълумотлар миллий инфратузилмасини яратиш» инвестицион лойиҳасини амалга ошириш тўғрисидаги Ҳукумат қарори лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш ва тасдиқлашга киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">август</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">61-мақсад: Инфратузилма лойиҳаларини барқарор ва узоқ муддатли молиялаштириш манбалари билан таъминлаш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги (Ш. Хидоятов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="82"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳудудларда иссиқлик таъминоти тизимларини давлат-хусусий шериклик асосида модернизация қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:34%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.95pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Зарафшон шаҳридаги</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 1967 йилда қурилган <b>марказий қозонхонани давлат-хусусий шериклик асосида модернизация қилиш</b> ва бошқарувга бериш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:14%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="page-break-after:avoid"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат-хусусий шериклик асосида</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Навоий вилояти ҳокимлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзсувтаъминот» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Умрзаков)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372221" id="7372221">Изоҳ: Дастурда назарда тутилган чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш жараёнида уларни молиялаштириш манбаларига ҳамда чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш муддатларига «Ўзбекистон — 2030» <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/6600413#6605157">стратегиясини</a> амалга ошириш бўйича Республика комиссияси раиси — Бош вазир томонидан ўзгартиришлар киритилиши мумкин.</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372020" id="7372020"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372021" id="7372021">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />5-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372222" id="7372222"><strong>«Ўзбекистон — 2030» стратегиясининг Барқарор иқтисодий ўсиш орқали аҳоли фаровонлигини таъминлаш йўналиши бўйича 2025 йилда ишлаб чиқиладиган норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжатлар лойиҳалари</strong></div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372223" id="7372223"><strong>РЎЙХАТИ</strong></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372224" id="7372224"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="7372235" id="7372235"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Т/р</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасида назарда тутиладиган чора-тадбирлар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро муддати</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳамижрочилар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">II. БАРҚАРОР ИҚТИСОДИЙ ЎСИШ ОРҚАЛИ АҲОЛИ ФАРОВОНЛИГИНИ ТАЪМИНЛАШ</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">46-мақсад: Фискал барқарорликни таъминлаш ва давлат мажбуриятларини самарали бошқариш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат пенсия таъминоти</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> тизимини ислоҳ қилиш <b>Концепцияси </b>лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро валюта жамғармаси, Осиё тараққиёт банки, Халқаро меҳнат ташкилоти ҳамда маҳаллий экспертларни жалб қилган ҳолда <b>Давлат пенсия таъминоти тизимини ислоҳ қилиш бўйича концепция лойиҳаси бўйича таклифларни </b>Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил август</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (А. Хайдаров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Молиявий ҳисоб тизимига <b>молиявий ҳисоботнинг </b><b>халқаро стандартларини кенг жорий қилиш</b> бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">молиявий ҳисоб тизимига халқаро стандарт ва жаҳон талабларини янада кенг жорий қилиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">бухгалтерия ҳисоби миллий стандартларини Молиявий ҳисоботнинг халқаро стандартларига уйғунлаштириш чораларини кўриш масалалари назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><strong>47-мақсад: Маҳаллий хомашё базасидан самарали фойдаланиш ва илғор технологияларга асосланган саноатни ривожлантириш</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><i>Ижро учун асосий</i></b><i> <b>масъул</b> — Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (И. Норқулов)</i></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қўшилган қиймат занжири ва меҳнат унумдорлигини ошириш бўйича дастур лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳар бир тармоқ кесимида <b>2025 йилда қўшилган қиймат занжири ва меҳнат унумдорлигини ошириш бўйича дастур</b> лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш ва Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш. </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ушбу дастурда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тармоқ корхоналарида харажатларни оптималлаштириш ҳисобига камайтириш ҳамда <b>«тежамкор ишлаб чиқариш»</b> тизимини жорий этиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">кадрлар салоҳиятини ривожлантириш ва <b>малакасини ошириш</b>;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ишлаб чиқариш жараёнларини <b>технологик янгилаш</b>, қувватларни модернизациялаш ҳамда соҳада <b>автоматлаштиришни</b> кучайтириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">стандартлаштириш ва <b>сифат менежментларини</b> кучайтириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">самарали ва амалий ечимларга эга <b>илмий ишланмаларга</b> <b>(R&D) </b>маблағларни йўналтиришни рағбатлантириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">мавжуд <b>қувватларни кенгайтириш</b> ва инвестиция дастурлари доирасида юқори технологик маҳсулотлар ишлаб чиқаришга қаратилган янги қувватларни ишга тушириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маҳаллийлаштириш ва кооперация алоқаларини кенгайтириш ҳисобига <b>маҳсулотлар номенклатурасини кенгайтириш</b>;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">меҳнат унумдорлигини ошириш бўйича халқаро ҳамкорлик алоқаларини ривожлантириш каби механизмларни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахобов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><strong>48-мақсад: Саноатнинг «драйвер» соҳаларини ривожлантириш ва ҳудудларнинг саноат салоҳиятини тўлиқ ишга солиш</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><i>Ижро учун асосий масъул</i></b><i> — Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (И. Норқулов)</i></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="CxSpFirst" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республика саноатида </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳудудий</span></span></b> <b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">саноат</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> улушини </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">45 фоизга</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> олиб чиқиш чора-тадбирлари тўғрисида норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳудудларда саноатни жадал ривожлантиришни янги босқичга олиб чиқиш чора-тадбирлари тўғрисидаги қарор лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиб, Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш. </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳудудларда саноат корхоналари билан манзилли ишлаш, саноатнинг жорий ҳолатини таҳлил қилиб бориш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳудудларда энергия тежамкор технологиялар асосида юқори қўшилган қийматли маҳсулотлар ишлаб чиқаришни ривожлантиришни рағбатлантириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«</span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">саноат</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> туманлари»ни янада ривожлантиришга туртки берадиган лойиҳалар бўйича ишлаб чиқилган микродастурни тасдиқлашни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахабов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳудудларда </span></span><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Республика — вилоят — туман» </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тамойили асосида вертикал тизим орқали саноат корхоналари фаолиятини соғломлаштириш ва тўлиқ қувватда ишлашини таъминлашни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">49-мақсад. Мамлакатимизнинг инвестициявий жозибадорлигини янада ошириш ва қимматли қоғозлар бозорини жадал ривожлантириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги (Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Махсус иқтисодий зоналар тўғрисида»</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ги қонун лойиҳаси (янги таҳрирда).</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">МИЗнинг амалдаги иштирокчиларининг инвестиция шартномалари доирасидаги ўз ҳуқуқ ва мажбуриятларини сақлаб қолиш;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">МИЗ иштирокчилари учун тенг инвестицияларни ҳимоя қилиш кафолатларини тақдим этиш;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">суд низоларини кўриб чиқишда халқаро Арбитражга рухсат бериш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Марказий банк</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Т. Ишметов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">51-мақсад: «Яшил иқтисодиёт»га ўтиш, унинг асоси бўлган қайта тикланувчи энергиядан фойдаланиш кўрсаткичларини кескин ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (У. Абидходжаев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">6.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистонни кам углеродли ривожлантириш бўйича узоқ муддатли стратегияси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон Республикасини 2055 йилгача кам углеродли ривожлантириш ва углерод нейтраллигига эришиш стратегиясини тасдиқлаш» бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Абдухакимов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Абдурахмонов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Хамраев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Энергетика вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ж. Мирзамахмудов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро углерод бозорида иштирок этишни тартибга солувчи </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг фармони лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада 2024 йилда Боку шаҳрида бўлиб ўтган БМТнинг Иқлим ўзгариши Конвенциясининг Конференцияси (СОР-29) доирасида углерод савдосининг (Paris Agreement, Article 6) халқаро тартиби қабул қилинганлигини инобатга олган ҳолда халқаро углерод савдосида иштирок этишнинг миллий тартиботларини назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Абдурахмонов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Хамраев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">8.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро иссиқхона гази савдоси бўйича лойиҳаларни амалга ошириш тартибини янада такомиллаштириш </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">бўйича<b> </b>Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг қарори лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳа билан халқаро иссиқхона гази савдоси бўйича лойиҳаларни амалга ошириш тартибини ишлаб чиқиш ва тасдиқланишини назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Абдухакимов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">9.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маҳаллий корхоналарда ESG тамойилларини жорий этишни </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">назарда тутувчи Вазирлар Маҳкамаси қарори лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳа билан маҳаллий корхоналарда ESG тамойилларини жорий этишни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахабов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">10.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон Республикасида яшил молиялаштириш (Climate Finance) тизимини такомиллаштириш бўйича миллий дастурни </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тасдиқлаш юзасидан Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг фармони лойиҳаси.<b> </b></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳа билан 2026–2030 йилларга мўлжалланган Ўзбекистон Республикасида яшил молиялаштириш (Climate Finance) тизимини такомиллаштириш бўйича миллий дастурнинг ишлаб чиқиш ва тасдиқланиши назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Марказий банк</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Т. Ишметов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзмиллийбанк» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">52-мақсад: Иқтисодиёт тармоқлари ва аҳолини зарур энергия ресурслари билан узлуксиз таъминлаш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — «Ҳудудгазтаъминот» АЖ (М. Ходжаев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">11.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Аҳоли ва тадбиркорлик субъектларига табиий ва суюлтирилган газни етказиб бериш тизимини ривожлантириш концепциясини тасдиқлашга оид норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">соҳани узоқ муддатли ривожлантириш, инвестициялар ва хусусий секторни жалб қилиш имкониятларини кенгайтириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">соҳани тартибга солувчи қонунчилик базасини такомиллаштириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">замонавий, тезкор ва қулай газ етказиб бериш ускуналарини жорий қилиш, йўқотишларни камайтириш ва тизимни тўлиқ рақамлаштириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">муқобил энергия манбаларидан фойдаланиш, истеъмол маданияти ва тежамкорликни ошириш бўйича чора-тадбирларни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Энергетика вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ж. Мирзамахмудов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Ташкулов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">53-мақсад: Ўзбекистон Республикасининг глобал транспорт-логистика тармоқларига интеграциясини чуқурлаштириш ва миллий транспорт тизимининг салоҳиятини ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Транспорт вазирлиги (И. Махкамов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">12.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Жамоат транспортини ривожлантириш стратегияси»ни тасдиқлаш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">жамоат транспорти тизимининг барча турларини узвий боғлаган ҳолда комплекс ривожлантириш ҳамда жамоат транспортининг янги йўналишлари тармоғини жорий этиш орқали тубдан такомиллаштириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">замонавий транспорт-ўтиш боғламалари, автотураргоҳлар, оралиқ автобус бекатларини ташкил этиш ҳамда жамоат транспорти ҳаракатига устуворлик бериш учун автомобиль йўллари ва чорраҳаларини қайта лойиҳалаштириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">жамоат транспорти ҳаракат таркибини замонавий, экологияга зарари нисбатан кам бўлган электробус, автобус ва микроавтобуслар билан янгилаш орқали йўналишларни оптималлаштириш ҳамда транспорт хизматлари сифатини ошириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">автоматлаштирилган тўлов тизимини такомиллаштириш, ташувчиларни молиялаштириш ва тариф сиёсатини такомиллаштириш орқали давлат томонидан қўллаб-қувватлаш тизимини яратиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">рақамли технологияларни ва инновацион ёндашувларни кенг қўллаган ҳолда транспорт воситалари ҳаракатини бошқаришнинг интеллектуал тизимларини жорий этиш ҳамда йўл ҳаракати хавфсизлигини таъминлаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">автотураргоҳлар, оралиқ автобус бекатлари, жамоат транспорти ҳамда автомобиль йўллари ва чорраҳаларини ногиронлиги бўлган шахсларнинг тўсиқсиз ҳаракатланиши учун мослаштириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«яшил» транспортни, хусусан велосипед ва бошқа моторсиз транспорт турларини ривожлантиришни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">13.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳрида самарали транспорт бошқаруви тизимини ташкил этиш ва тирбандликларнинг олдини олиш бўйича сифат жиҳатдан янги тизимни яратиш чора-тадбирлари бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳрининг транспорт инфратузилмасини ривожлантириш лойиҳаларини ишлаб чиқиш ва амалга ошириш тартиби;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳрида йўл ҳаракатини илмий ёндашув ҳамда илғор хорижий тажриба асосида ташкил этиш бўйича замонавий техник ечимларни ишлаб чиқиш орқали транспорт оқимини самарали бошқариш ва тирбандликни олдини олишга қаратилган тадқиқотларни амалга ошириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">жамоат транспорти ҳаракатини ташкил этиш ва тартибга солиш, унинг жозибадорлигини ошириш механизмларини ишлаб чиқиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳрида тирбандликларнинг олдини олиш ва йўл ҳаракатини самарали ташкил этиш юзасидан ташкилий чоралар кўришга ҳамда қонунчилик ҳужжатларини такомиллаштиришга қаратилган таклифларни ишлаб чиқиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳри кўчаларида йўл ҳаракатини тўғри ташкил этиш, жумладан йўл чизиқларини чизиш, йўл белгилари ва кўрсаткичларини ўрнатиш, алмаштириш, сақлаш ва уларга техник хизмат кўрсатиш ишларини амалга ошириш, шунингдек, ушбу ишларга аутсорсинг асосида хусусий секторни жалб қилиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">йўл ҳаракати иштирокчиларининг ҳуқуқий маданиятини ошириш ва йўл ҳаракати қоидаларига риоя этилишини таъминлашга қаратилган ахборот-тарғибот ишларини амалга ошириш, шунингдек, йўл-транспорт ҳодисаларининг профилактикасига қаратилган бошқа чора-тадбирларни амалга оширишни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(П. Бобожонов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">54-мақсад: Қишлоқ хўжалигида ҳосилдорлик ва рентабеллик даражасини кескин ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги (И. Абдурахмонов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон Республикасида агротуризмни ривожлантиришни қўллаб-қувватлаш чора-тадбирлари тўғрисида норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">агротуризмни ривожлантириш, рақобатбардошлик ва кўрсатилаётган хизматлар сифатини ошириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">миллий агротуризм маҳсулотини фаол ва ҳар томонлама тарғиб қилиш учун қулай шарт-шароитлар яратишни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Туризм қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(У. Шадиев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республика ҳудудларида кимёлаштириш ва ўсимликларни ҳимоя қилиш воситаларининг қўлланилишини тартибга солиш ҳамда назорат қилиш соҳаси бўйича<b> </b></span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">кимёлаштириш ва ўсимликларни ҳимоя қилиш воситаларини олиб кириш, улгуржи ва чакана савдо қилиш босқичларида лицензия учун зарур бўлган хусусиятларга эга ёки эга эмаслигини текшириш тартиб ва тамойиллари;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">кимёлаштириш ва ўсимликларни ҳимоя қилиш воситаларини қўллашга чиқарилган партияларининг сифат даражаси, шунингдек, бевосита уларнинг қўлланилишида қоида ва меъёрларга амал қилиниши устидан назорат ўрнатиш тартиби;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">рўйхатдан ўтган кимёлаштириш ва ўсимликларни ҳимоя қилиш воситаларининг сифати, қадоғи, маркировкаси, рекламаси, интернет савдоси ва маълумотлари, шунингдек, назорат ва синов учун намуналар олишга доир жараёнлар устидан ҳамда қўлланилишидаги назорат механизмларини назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўсимликлар карантини ва ҳимояси агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Эргашев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Абдуҳакимов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Худаяров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">55-мақсад: Миллий иқтисодиётнинг экспорт салоҳиятини кучайтириш ва унинг таркибида қўшилган қиймати юқори бўлган маҳсулотлар улушини кескин ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги (Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">16.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хизматлар экспортини қўллаб-қувватлаш бўйича </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">хизматлар экспортини қўллаб-қувватлаш бўйича алоҳида дастур қабул қилиш;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">гастрономик, туристик, тиббий, таълим, девелоперлик <i>(қурилиш-монтаж)</i> йўналишларини ташқи бозорга олиб чиқишда кўмаклашиш;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ташкилий ва юридик қўллаб-қувватлаш тизимини ишлаб чиқишни кўзда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахобов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">17.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистоннинг 2026 — 2028 йилларга мўлжалланган Миллий экспорт стратегиясини тасдиқлаш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Стратегия:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">институционал салоҳиятни кучайтириш ва мувофиқлаштириш ҳамда савдо инфратузилмаси ва логистикани ривожлантириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">стандартлаштириш ва сертификатлаштириш соҳасини такомиллаштириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ташқи бозорларга киришни кенгайтириш, маҳаллий маҳсулотларни хорижий бозорларда кенг тарғиб қилиш ва брендларни жалб қилиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">юқори қўшилган қийматли рақобатбардош маҳсулотларни ишлаб чиқаришни қўллаб-қувватлаш ва экспортга йўналтириш каби комплекс чора-тадбирларни ўз ичига олиш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д. Вахобов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">56-мақсад. Монопол соҳаларни бозор тамойилларига изчил ўтказиш, иқтисодиётда хусусий сектор улушини ошириш, тадбиркорларга эркин фаолият юритиши учун энг қулай шароитлар яратиш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Рақобатни ривожлантириш ва истеъмолчилар ҳуқуқларини ҳимоя қилиш қўмитаси (Х. Турахўжаев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">18.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Истеъмолчилар ҳуқуқларини ҳимоя қилиш мақсадида акция ва чегирмалар ўтказилишини ҳуқуқий жиҳатдан тартибга солиш ва давлат томонидан назорат механизмини ишлаб чиқиш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Чакана савдода акциялар ва чегирмаларни ташкил қилиш, ўтказиш ва рўйхатга олиш тартибини ишлаб чиқиш ҳамда чакана савдо қоидаларига қўшимча ва ўзгартиришлар киритиш. Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">чакана савдода акциялар билан боғлиқ асосий тушунчалар, бундай акцияларни ташкил этиш ва ўтказишга қўйиладиган талаблар;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">қонунчилик талаблари бузилган ҳолда ташкил этилган ва (ёки) ўтказилган акция ва чегирмаларни тўхтатиб туриш ёки бекор қилиш тартибини назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Норқулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Шерматов,</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги (Ш. Хидоятов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">19.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш материаллари ва уй-жой қурилиши кластерларини ташкил этиш тартибини белгиловчи норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш материаллари ва уй-жой қурилиши кластерларининг ҳуқуқий мақоми;</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш материаллари ва уй-жой қурилиши кластерларини ташкил этиш тартиби ва уларнинг фаолиятини йўлга қўйиш механизмларини назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил август</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:35.4pt 70.8pt 106.2pt 141.6pt 177.0pt 212.4pt 247.8pt 283.2pt 318.6pt 354.0pt 389.4pt 424.8pt 460.2pt 495.6pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Энергетика вазирлиги (Ж. Мирзамахмудов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">20.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:21.3pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мулкчилик шаклидан қатъий назар барча хўжалик юритувчи субъектлар томонидан ички бозорга импорт қилинган дизель ёқилғиси, суюлтирилган газ ва автобензин маҳсулотларини ягона бозор тамойили асосида фақат биржа савдолари орқали сотиш тартиби бўйича </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Импорт қилинган ёқилғи маҳсулотларини биржа савдолари орқали сотиш мажбуриятини жорий қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Импорт қилинган ёқилғи маҳсулотлар сотилишида уларнинг нархлари асоссиз оширилганлиги ёки пасайтирилиши ҳолатларини аниқлаш механизмларини жорий қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025-йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:35.4pt 70.8pt 106.2pt 141.6pt 177.0pt 212.4pt 247.8pt 283.2pt 318.6pt 354.0pt 389.4pt 424.8pt 460.2pt 495.6pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақобатни ривожлантириш ва истеъмолчилар ҳуқуқларини ҳимоя қилиш қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:35.4pt 70.8pt 106.2pt 141.6pt 177.0pt 212.4pt 247.8pt 283.2pt 318.6pt 354.0pt 389.4pt 424.8pt 460.2pt 495.6pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Х. Турахужаев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:35.4pt 70.8pt 106.2pt 141.6pt 177.0pt 212.4pt 247.8pt 283.2pt 318.6pt 354.0pt 389.4pt 424.8pt 460.2pt 495.6pt"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекистон республика товар-хомашё биржаси» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">60-мақсад. Ҳудудларни комплекс ривожлантириш, урбанизация стратегиясини амалга ошириш, аҳолини арзон уй-жой билан таъминлаш даражасини ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги (Ш. Хидоятов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">21.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:42.55pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Улуш киритиш асосида уй-жой қуриш тўғрисида<b>»</b>ги қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:42.55pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қонун лойиҳасида уй-жойлар қуришга жисмоний ва юридик шахсларнинг пул маблағларини жалб қилишнинг замонавий механизмларини, шу жумладан, улуш киритиш асосида уй-жой қурилишида қатнашиш механизмларини жорий этиш, шу тартиб асосида фуқароларнинг кўп қаватли уй-жойлар қурилишида иштирокини таъминлашнинг қонуний асосларини яратиш, уй-жой қурилишида улуш киритиш асосида иштирок этиш шартлари ва тартибини, қурилиш ташкилотларига нисбатан махсус талабларни белгилашни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Ташкулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Марказий банк</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Т. Ишметов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бош прокуратура</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Н. Йўлдошев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги (И. Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a1" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">22.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:42.55pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республиканинг 15 та ҳудудини жадал комплекс ривожлантириш бўйича Ҳукумат қарори лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:42%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:42.55pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қарор лойиҳасида ҳудудларни жадал комплекс ривожлантириш, юқори иқтисодий ўсишга эришиш, аҳолининг барча қатламлари учун яшаш ва дам олишга қулай шароит яратиш, бизнес муҳитини янада яхшилаш, «ўсиш нуқталари»га туртки бериш, «яшил тамойил» ва ёндашувларни кенг жорий этиш, аҳолини юқори даромадли меҳнат билан банд қилиш ҳамда туманни ижтимоий-иқтисодий ривожлантиришда замонавий ёндашувлар асосида ишлашни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Марказий банк</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Т. Ишметов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372236" id="7372236">Изоҳлар:</div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372237" id="7372237">Дастурда назарда тутилган чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш учун қабул қилинадиган ҳужжатлар шакли заруратга қараб ўзгартирилиши, бошқа бандлардаги ҳужжатлар билан бирлаштирилиши ёки бир неча турдаги ҳужжатларга бўлиниши мумкин;</div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372240" id="7372240">норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжатлар лойиҳаларини ишлаб чиқиш жараёнида мутасадди вазирлик ва идораларнинг таклифлари асосида Дастурда белгиланган чора-тадбирларнинг мазмунига мос келадиган бошқа масалалар ҳам назарда тутилади;</div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372241" id="7372241">Дастурда назарда тутилган чора-тадбирларнинг амалга ошириш жараёнида уларни молиялаштириш манбаларига ҳамда чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш муддатларига «Ўзбекистон — 2030» <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/6600413#6605157">стратегиясини</a> амалга ошириш бўйича Республика комиссияси раиси — Бош вазир томонидан ўзгартиришлар киритилиши мумкин.</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372023" id="7372023"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372024" id="7372024">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />6-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372270" id="7372270">«Ўзбекистон — 2030» стратегиясининг Барқарор иқтисодий ўсиш орқали аҳоли фаровонлигини таъминлаш йўналиши бўйича 2025 йилга мўлжалланган</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372271" id="7372271">МАҚСАДЛИ КЎРСАТКИЧЛАР</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7989210" id="7989210"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7989211" id="7989211"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Т/р</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>2030 йилгача мақсадли кўрсаткич</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Ўлчов бирлиги</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>2025 йил</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>I чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>II чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>III чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>IV чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Масъуллар</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>45-мақсад: 2030 йилга қадар иқтисодиёт ҳажмини 2 баробар ошириш ва «даромади ўртачадан юқори бўлган давлатлар» қаторига кириш</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ялпи ички маҳсулот ўсиш сурати.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">фоиз</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;bo