n style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">13.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳудудларда мавжуд минерал хомашё захирасидан самарали фойдаланиш мақсадида республика бўйлаб <b>60 минг квадрат километр</b> майдонда геология-қидирув ишларини амалга ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">минг квадрат метр</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>20</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">20</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тоғ-кон саноати ва геология вазирлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тўқимачиликда ип-калавани қайта ишлаш даражасини <b>62 фоизга</b> етказиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">фоиз</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>62</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">55</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">58</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">61</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">62</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Савдо-саноат палатаси,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзтўқимачилик саноати» уюшмаси</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фармацевтика соҳасида дори воситаларига бўлган эҳтиёжнинг <b>70 фоизини</b> ички ишлаб чиқарувчилар ҳисобига қоплаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">фоиз</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>48</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">45</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">46</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">47</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">48</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фармацевтика агентлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>49-мақсад: Мамлакатимизнинг инвестициявий жозибадорлигини янада ошириш ва қимматли қоғозлар бозорини жадал ривожлантириш</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">16.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>110 миллиард доллар</b> хорижий инвестицияларни жалб қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">миллиард доллар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>42</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4,8</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14,2</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">26,5</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">42</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">17.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>30 миллиард доллар</b> давлат-хусусий шериклик доирасидаги инвестицияларни жалб қилиш бўйича битимларни имзолаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">миллиард доллар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>2,5</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">0,1</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">0,5</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">0,6</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1,3</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">19.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт тармоқлари ва ҳудудларда умумий қиймати 150 миллиард доллар бўлган <b>500 дан</b> зиёд стратегик аҳамиятига эга бўлган технологик ва инфратузилмавий инвестиция лойиҳаларини амалга ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">та</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>301</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">30</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">86</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">301</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">20.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Пай ва венчур жамғармалари фаолиятини йўлга қўйиш орқали портфель инвестициялар ҳажмини ҳар йили <b>3 — 5 фоизга</b> ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">фоиз</span></span></p></td><td style="b