="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">28.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:12.2pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Доривор ва озиқ-овқатбоп ўсимликларни етиштириш ва кўпайтириш бўйича ҳар йили <b>25 минг гектар</b> майдонда маданий плантацияларни ташкил этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">минг гектар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>25</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4