adding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>20</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">18</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">19</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">20</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">30.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:12.2pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маиший чиқинди йиғиш шохобчаларини қуриш, реконструкция қилиш, таъмирлаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">та</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>100</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">25</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">25</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">25</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">25</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>73-мақсад: Атмосфера ҳавоси ифлосланишининг олдини олиш, унинг табиий таркибини сақлаш бўйича кескин чоралар кўриш</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">31.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:12.2pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Атмосферага чиқариб ташланаётган ифлослантирувчи моддалар миқдорини <b>10,5 фоизга</b> камайтириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">фоиз</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>1,5</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1,5</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">32.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:12.2pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Атроф-муҳитга таъсири бўйича I ва II тоифага кирувчи хўжалик юритувчи субъектлардаги ифлослантирувчи технологияларни тўлиқ модернизация қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">та</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>122</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">20</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">20</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">77</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">33.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:12.2pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>249 та</b> саноат корхоналарида локал оқова тозалаш иншоотларини қуриш ва реконструкция қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">та</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>74</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">10</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">42</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372319" id="7372319">Изоҳ. Чораклар кесимидаги мақсадли кўрсаткичларга асосий масъул ташкилот раҳбарининг асослантирилган таклифи асосида «Ўзбекистон — 2030» <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/6600413#6605157">стратегиясини</a> амалга ошириш бўйича Республика комиссияси раиси — Бош вазир томонидан ўзгартиришлар (белгиланган йиллик мақсадли кўрсаткичлар доирасида) киритилиши мумкин.</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372034" id="7372034"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372036" id="7372036">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />10-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372320" id="7372320">«Ўзбекистон — 2030» стратегиясининг Қонун устуворлигини таъминлаш, халқ хизматидаги давлат бошқарувини ташкил этиш йўналиши бўйича 2025 йилга мўлжалланган</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372321" id="7372321">АМАЛИЙ ТАДБИРЛАР РЕЖАСИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372322" id="7372322"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372323" id="7372323"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="2%"><p align="center"><a name="7372323"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Т/р</span></b></a></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="25%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Вазифа</span></b></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="31%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Амалий чора-тадбирлар</span></b></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро муддати</span></b></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Молиялаштириш манбалари</span></b></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ҳамижрочилар</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">IV. ҚОНУН УСТУВОРЛИГИНИ ТАЪМИНЛАШ, ХАЛҚ ХИЗМАТИДАГИ ДАВЛАТ БОШҚАРУВИНИ ТАШКИЛ ЭТИШ</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">74-мақсад: Аҳоли фаровонлигини таъминлаш ва ҳудудларда кундалик масалаларни ҳал этишда маҳаллани жамоатчилик ҳамда давлат органлари ўртасидаги «таянч кўприк»ка айлантириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">1.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ҳудудий ижтимоий-иқтисодий ривожланиш дастурларини ишлаб чиқишда маҳалла институтининг ролини ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Ҳудудий ижтимоий-иқтисодий ривожланиш дастурлари лойиҳаларини маҳаллалар билан келишиш амалиётини жорий қилиш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Ҳудудий ижтимоий-иқтисодий ривожланиш дастурлари лойиҳаларини ишлаб чиқишда «Open budget» тизимидан фойдаланиш кўламини кенгайтириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил февраль ойидан бошлаб</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ўзбекистон маҳаллалари уюшмаси</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(К. Куранбаев)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">75-мақсад: Маҳаллий давлат ҳокимияти вакиллик органларини халқнинг чинакам «овозига» айлантириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Олий Мажлис Сенати (келишув асосида)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">2.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Маҳаллий бюджетни шакллантириш жараёнига маҳаллий кенгаш депутатларини фаол жалб этиш орқали аҳолининг турмуш фаровонлигини ошириш, депутатлар ташаббусларини қўллаб-қувватлаш тизимини яратиш. </span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Бюджет лойиҳасини шакллантиришда ҳудудлар тоифасидан келиб чиқиб, бюджет харажатларининг уч — беш фоизи бевосита маҳаллий Кенгаш депутатларининг ташаббуси асосида йўналтирилиши амалиётини йўлга қўйиш. Бунда Сенат билан ҳамкорликда <b>«сайловчи — депутат — ҳоким — кенгаш» тўрт бўғинли</b> ўзаро ҳамкорлик тизими жорий этилиши назарда тутилади.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил май</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(А. Ташкулов)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Жўқорғи Кенгеси, халқ депутатлари вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри кенгашлари</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">76-мақсад: Маҳаллий давлат ҳокимияти ижро органлари фаолиятини трансформация қилиб, ҳудудий бошқарувни «аҳоли манфаатларига хизмат қилиш» тамойили асосида йўлга қўйиш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">3.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ҳудудларни ривожлантиришнинг устувор йўналишлари бўйича «Индикаторлар тўплами»ни юритиш амалиётини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Индикаторлар тўпламида туман ва шаҳарларни <b>15</b> <b>та</b> <b>йўналиш</b>да ривожлантириш бўйича <b>чораклик кўрсаткичлар</b>ни белгилаш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Вазирликлар томонидан маҳаллий ҳокимликлар билан биргаликда «Индикаторлар тўплами»ни амалга ошириш бўйича маҳаллалар кесимида ойлик ва чораклик иш режаларини тасдиқлаш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> «Индикаторлар тўплами»нинг жойлардаги ижросини таҳлил қилиб, натижаларини ҳокимлар ва масъул ташкилотлар раҳбарлари иштирокида танқидий кўриб чиқиш амалиётини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йилдан бошлаб ҳар йили</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Вазирлар Маҳкамаси</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="73%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги (Ш. Шерматов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> «Индикаторлар тўплами»ни <b>шакллантириш</b>, унинг ижросини <b>мониторинг </b>ва<b> назорат қилиш</b> бўйича электрон платформани ишга тушириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил май</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Давлат хизматини ривожлантириш агентлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(А. Мусаев)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">77-мақсад: Давлат хизматларини рақамлаштиришнинг кўламини кенгайтириш орқали аҳоли учун «Сервис давлат» тизимини жорий қилиш, фуқаро ва давлат ўртасидаги муносабатларда бюрократик тартиботларга барҳам бериш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Адлия вазирлиги (А. Ташкулов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">4.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">«Ўзархив» агентлиги томонидан кўрсатиладиган электрон давлат хизматлари қамров даражасини ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йилдан электрон давлат хизматларини 10 тага етказиш, шу жумладан, <b>нодавлат архив фаолиятини ташкил этишни</b> <i>(Нодавлат архивнинг фаолияти бошланганлиги ёки тугатилганлиги тўғрисидаги хабарнома)</i> Электрон лицензиялаш тизими орқали, <b>корхоналар, муассасалар ва ташкилотлар ҳужжатларини тартибга келтиришга масъул шахсни компетентлиги юзасидан аттестациядан ўтказишни</b> Давлат хизматлари марказлари ёки Ягона интерактив давлат хизматлари портали орқали амалга ошириш имкониятини яратиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил август</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари асосида</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">«Ўзархив» агентлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">5.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Айрим давлат хизматларини кўрсатишни «фойдаланувчи учун мослаштирилган» тамойили асосида соддалаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Ягона интерактив давлат хизматлари порталида жорий этилган 25 та давлат хизматларидан фойдаланишда ариза (сўровнома) бериш жараёнларини соддалаштириш, маълумотлар ва бошқа ҳужжатларни аҳоли ва тадбиркорлик субъектларидан талаб қилмаган ҳолда автоматик тарзда олиш нуқтаи назаридан қайта кўриб чиқиш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Хизмат кўрсатиш жараёнлари соддалаштирилган давлат хизматлари бўйича Ягона интерактив давлат хизматлари порталига тегишли техник ўзгартиришлар киритиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги (Ш. Шерматов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">6.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ягона интерактив давлат хизматлари порталидаги хизматлар ва сервислар сонини 780 тага етказиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. </span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Йил давомида электрон шаклга ўтказиладиган ва Ягона интерактив давлат хизматлари портали орқали кўрсатилиши йўлга қўйиладиган хизматлар ва сервислар рўйхатини шакллантириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил апрель</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Адлия вазирлиги,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. </span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Рўйхат асосида уларни босқичма-босқич Ягона интерактив давлат хизматлари портали орқали кўрсатишни йўлга қўйиш режа-графигини ишлаб чиқиш ва Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил май</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. </span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Тасдиқланган режа-график асосида хизматлар ва сервисларни Ягона интерактив давлат хизматлари порталида жорий қилиб бориш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Режа-график асосида</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">78-мақсад: Давлат бошқаруви органлари фаолиятини «Халқ хизматидаги давлат» тамойили асосида ташкил этиш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Адлия вазирлиги (А. Ташкулов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">7.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Давлат функцияларини хусусий секторга ўтказиш орқали иш жараёнларини мақбуллаштириш ишларини жадаллаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> 2025 йилда республика ва маҳаллий ижро этувчи ҳокимият органлари кесимида давлат функцияларини хусусий секторга ўтказиш бўйича чора-тадбирлар дастури лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш ва амалга оширишни ташкиллаштириш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Давлатнинг иқтисодиётдаги ролини тубдан камайтириш мақсадида қурилиш, транспорт, таълим, қишлоқ хўжалиги каби соҳаларда хусусий сектор улушини ошириш бўйича таклифларни ишлаб чиқиб, Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил март</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">79-мақсад: Янги Ўзбекистонни барпо этишда Олий Мажлис палаталари ва сиёсий партиялар ролини янада ошириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Олий Мажлис Қонунчилик палатаси (келишув асосида)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">8.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Тегишли соҳа ва тармоқларда давлат назорати ва текширувни амалга оширувчи <b>давлат</b> <b>инспекцияларининг</b> Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталари билан <b>ҳамкорлик тизимини</b> йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Бунда: </span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Давлат инспекцияларини Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталарига <b>бириктириш</b>; </span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталари билан давлат инспекциялари ўртасида ўзаро <b>маълумот алмашишни</b> йўлга қўйиш, парламент назорати тадбирлари ўтказишда Давлат инспекциялари ходимларини <b>жалб қилиш</b>, тегишли соҳаларни ҳуқуқий тартибга солишни такомиллаштириш бўйича <b>таклифлар</b> ишлаб чиқишда <b>ҳамкорлик</b> қилиш;</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил февраль</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталари мажлисларида тегишли Давлат инспекцияларининг фаолиятига оид <b>ҳисоботларини эшитиб бориш</b> назарда тутилади.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Йил давомида</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">9.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Олий Мажлис Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталарининг <b>илмий-тадқиқот ташкилотлари, таҳлил марказлари</b> билан ҳамкорлигини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Бунда:</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="9%"><p></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталари томонидан ўз фаолият йўналишидан келиб чиқиб, <b>илмий-тадқиқот ташкилотлари, таҳлил марказлари</b> рўйхатини шакллантириш;</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил январь</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталари томонидан ҳамкорлик қилиш мумкин бўлган илмий-тадқиқот ташкилотлари, таҳлил марказлари билан <b>ҳамкорлик меморандумларини</b> имзолаш;</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">меморандумлар асосида Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталари ва илмий-тадқиқот ташкилотлари, таҳлил марказлари ўртасида <b>ҳамкорлик режаларини</b> тасдиқлаш;</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил январь — март</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталари ҳамда илмий-тадқиқот ташкилотлари ва таҳлил марказлари ҳамкорлигини тизимли ташкил қилиш назарда тутилади.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Йил давомида</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">80-мақсад: Норма ижодкорлиги фаолиятининг ислоҳотлар билан уйғунлигини таъминлаш ва давлат ҳуқуқий сиёсатининг институционал асосларини ривожлантириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Адлия вазирлиги (А. Ташкулов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">10.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қабул қилинаётган норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжатларнинг ижросини таъминлаш самарадорлигини ошириш бўйича механизмларни такомиллаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Тармоқлар кесимида амалдаги қонунчилик ҳужжатларини босқичма-босқич хатловдан ўтказиб, улардаги амалга ошириш механизми билан таъминланмаган ҳаволаки нормаларни аниқлаш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Амалга ошириш механизми билан таъминланмаган ҳаволаки нормаларни бартараф этиш бўйича режа-графикни ишлаб чиқиш ва тасдиқлаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил август</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Бу борада амалга оширилган ишлар юзасидан ҳар ярим йилда Олий Мажлис палаталарига маълумот киритиб бориш назарда тутилади.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил ноябрь ойидан бошлаб</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">81-мақсад: Давлат фуқаролик хизматини меритократия, ҳалоллик ва профессионаллик тамойиллари асосида ташкил этиш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Давлат хизматини ривожлантириш агентлиги (А. Мусаев)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">11.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Давлат хизматининг раҳбарлик лавозимларига хотин-қизларни мақсадли тайёрлаш тизимини яратиш. </span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Иқтидорли хотин-қизлар орасида «Раҳбар аёллар мактаби»га қабул доирасида мақсадли танловлар эълон қилиб, 100 нафар хотин-қизларнинг махсус ўқув дастури асосида бошқарувга оид кўникмаларини ошириш. </span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. </span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Онлайн ўқувлар орқали 20 минг нафардан ортиқ хотин-қизларнинг билимлари ва касбий кўникмаларини ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил март ойидан бошлаб йил давомида</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Хорижий грант маблағлари, Давлат хизматини ривожлантиришни қўллаб-қувватлаш жамғармаси маблағлари ҳамда манфаатдор вазирлик ва идораларнинг ўз маблағлари</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Давлат бошқаруви академияси</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(А. Бекмуродов)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Оила ва хотин-қизлар қўмитаси</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(З. Махкамова)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">12.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Республика ва маҳаллий ижро этувчи ҳокимият органларининг раҳбарлик лавозимлари учун <b>компетенция моделини</b> ҳамда <b>профессионал компетенцияларини </b>баҳолаш тизимини жорий этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Юқори, ўрта ва қуйи бўғин раҳбарларининг намунавий профессионал компетенцияларини ишлаб чиқиш ва амалиётга жорий этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил март</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идораларнинг ўз маблағлари</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(И. Норқулов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Давлат хизматини ривожлантириш агентлиги қошидаги Раҳбар кадрларни баҳолаш марказида р</span></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">еспублика ва маҳаллий ижро этувчи ҳокимият органларининг раҳбарлик лавозимларидаги шахсларини, шу жумладан, захирадагиларнинг <b>профессионал компетенцияларини </b>босқичма-босқич баҳолашдан ўтказиш<span>.</span></span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Баҳолаш натижаларига кўра ходимларнинг касбий ривожланиш режаларини ишлаб чиқиш ва амалга ошириш тизимини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Йил давомида</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">82-мақсад: Халқ билан мулоқотни янада кенгайтириш орқали аҳоли муаммоларини аниқлаш ва ҳал этиш тизимининг самарадорлигини ошириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президенти Халқ қабулхонаси (У. Мухаммадиев) ва Ўзбекистон маҳаллалари уюшмаси (К. Куранбаев)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">13.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Халқ билан мулоқот тизимини рақамлаштириш орқали аҳоли муаммолари билан ишлаш тизимини янада такомиллаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Аҳоли муаммоларини «хонадонбай» ўрганиш ва ҳал этиш тизимини рақамлаштириш, «маҳалла еттилиги» томонидан бевосита хонадондан туриб мурожаат қабул қилиш ва ижросини назорат қилиш имконини берувчи «Обод маскан» мобиль иловасини ишга тушириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил май</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">Камбағалликни қисқартириш ва бандлик вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">(Б. Зохидов),</span></i></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">Оила ва хотин-қизлар қўмитаси</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">(З. Махкамова)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">Ёшлар ишлари агентлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">(А. Саъдуллаев)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">(П. Бобожонов)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">Ижтимоий ҳимоя миллий агентлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">(Ж. Абруев)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">Солиқ қўмитаси</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">(Ш. Кудбиев),</span></i></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line">маҳаллий ҳокимликлар</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">83-мақсад. Эркин фуқаролик жамиятини ва оммавий ахборот воситалари фаолиятини янада ривожлантириш, Ўзбекистонни фуқаролик жамиятини ривожлантириш бўйича хабга айлантириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Ахборот ва оммавий коммуникациялар агентлиги (А. Ходжаев)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">14.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ҳар йили «энг яхши ахборот хизмати» танловини йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Давлат органлари ва ташкилотлари Ахборот хизматлари фаолиятини доимий ўрганиб бориш ва танлов ҳақида камида 6 ой олдин эълон бериш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Танлов шартларини ишлаб чиқиш ва шу асосда давлат органлари ва ташкилотларидаги ахборот хизматлари фаолиятини самарадорлиги ошириш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Танловда 3 та ўрин белгилаш ҳамда танлов ғолибларини Матбуот ва оммавий ахборот воситалари ходимлари кунида тақдирлаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил февраль</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">15.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Давлат органлари ва фуқаролик жамияти институтлари ўртасида яқин мулоқотни йўлга қўйиш, соҳа ва тармоқда сақланиб қолаётган муаммоларни биргаликда ҳал қилиш механизмларини кенгайтириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Вазирлик ва идоралар раҳбарлари, Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши раиси, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимларининг соҳавий ва ҳудудий фуқаролик жамияти институтлари вакиллари билан очиқ мулоқотларини ўтказиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил давомида</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Вазирлик ва идораларнинг бюджетдан ташқари маблағлари</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Олий Мажлис Сенати (келишув асосида)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">16.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Давлат органлари ва ташкилотлари фаолиятининг шаффофлигини оширишда парламент назорати самарадорлигини ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Давлат органлари ва ташкилотлари фаолияти шаффофлигини баҳолаш бўйича «Очиқлик индекси» маълумотларини таҳлил қилиш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Таҳлил натижаларига кўра «Қониқарсиз» деб топилган давлат органлари ва ташкилотлари фаолиятини жойларга чиққан ҳолда ўрганиш, аниқланган камчиликларни бартараф этиш юзасидан чора-тадбирлар ишлаб чиқиш ва Сенат Кенгашида тасдиқлаш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Чора-тадбирлар ижроси юзасидан Ўзбекистон Республикаси Коррупцияга қарши курашиш миллий кенгашида масъул давлат органлари биринчи раҳбарлари ахборотини эшитиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил август</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Бош прокуратура</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(Н. Йўлдошев)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Коррупцияга қарши курашиш агентлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(А. Бурханов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">84-мақсад. Конституция ва қонунларнинг устуворлигини таъминлаш, инсон ҳуқуқ ва эркинликларининг ишончли ҳимоя қилинишини таъминлашни суд-ҳуқуқ ислоҳотларининг бош мезонига айлантириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Олий суд (Б. Исламов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">17.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Судлар фаолиятини рақамлаштириш ишларини жадаллаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Судлар фаолиятига сунъий интеллект технологияларини жорий этиш, «SMART SUD» концепцияси асосида ишларни босқичма-босқич тўлиқ электрон шаклда юритиш амалиётини жорий қилиш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Олий суд ҳузурида Ахборот технологиялари марказини ташкил этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил октябрь</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(И. Норқулов)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(А. Ташкулов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">85-мақсад. Давлат органлари ва мансабдор шахсларнинг фаолияти устидан самарали суд назоратини ўрнатиш ҳамда маъмурий адлия тизимини янада ривожлантириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Судьялар олий кенгаши (Х. Ёдгоров)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">18.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Судьялар ҳамжамияти органларининг фаолиятини такомиллаштириш, уларда шаффофлик ва очиқлик тамойилларини кенг жорий қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Судьялар ҳамжамияти органларининг қарорларини қабул қилиш ва уларни қайта кўриб чиқиш тартибини янада такомиллаштириш бўйича илғор хорижий тажрибани ўрганган ҳолда асослантирилган таклифларни киритиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Олий суд</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(Б. Исламов)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қонунчилик ва ҳуқуқий сиёсат институти</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(М. Рахманкулов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">86-мақсад. Суд ҳокимиятининг мустақиллигини кучайтириш ва унинг фаолиятида очиқликни таъминлаш орқали одил судловга эришиш даражасини ошириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> <b>масъул</b> — Судьялар олий кенгаши (Х. Ёдгоров)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">19.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Судьялар фаолиятига ноқонуний аралашув ҳолатларининг олдини олиш механизмларини такомиллаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Судьялар дахлсизлигини бузиш ҳолатларининг олдини олиш бўйича чоралар юзасидан кенг тарғибот олиб бориш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Судьялар дахлсизлигини бузиш ҳолатлари ҳақида Судьялар олий кенгашини хабардор қилиш тартибини жорий қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил май</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Олий суд</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(Б. Исламов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">87-мақсад. Ҳуқуқни муҳофаза қилувчи органларнинг фаолиятини инсон манфаатлари, қадр-қиммати ва ҳуқуқларини ҳимоя қилишга йўналтириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Ички ишлар вазирлиги (П. Бобожонов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">20.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Автомобиль йўлларида транспорт воситаларини эркин ва хавфсиз ҳаракатланишини таъминлаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Республика бўйича барча тартибга солинган чорраҳаларга интеллектуал транспорт тизимларини ўрнатиш ва ягона рақамли бошқарув тизими жорий этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил апрель ойидан бошлаб йил давомида</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар маблағлари</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, Тошкент шаҳри ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Транспорт вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(И. Махкамов)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">21.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Тергов фаолияти устидан назоратни электрон шаклда олиб бориш имконини берувчи рақамлаштирилган тизим яратиш. </span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Тергов фаолияти устидан назоратни тўлиқ электрон шаклда олиб бориш имконини берувчи «Электрон жиноий-ҳуқуқий статистика» ягона ахборот тизимининг «Э-тергов» модулини ишлаб чиқиш ва ушбу тизимни ишга тушириш билан боғлиқ барча ташкилий-техник чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(Ш. Шерматов),</span></i></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(А. Ташкулов),</span></i></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(И. Норқулов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Марказий банк (Т. Ишметов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">22.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Банк ва тўлов тизимларида киберхавфсизликни таъминлаш чораларини такомиллаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Марказий банк киберхавфсизлик марказини замонавий аппарат-дастурий ва дастурий таъминот воситалари билан жиҳозлаш ҳамда доимий равишда такомиллаштириб бориш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Доимий</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Банк ва тўлов тизимларида киберхавфсизлик стратегиясини ишлаб чиқиш ҳамда киберхавфсизлик таваккалчиликларини аниқлаш ва баҳолаш бўйича халқаро ташкилотлардан (Халқаро валюта фонди, Жаҳон банки, Европа тикланиш ва тараққиёт банки) экспертларни жалб қилиш ва амалий чораларни белгилаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил июль</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> <b>масъул</b> — Миллий гвардия (Р. Джураев)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">23.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Тошкент ва Нукус шаҳарлари ҳамда вилоятлар марказларидаги истироҳат боғлари, хиёбонларда жамоат тартибини сақлаш ва хавфсизликни таъминлаш борасидаги фаолиятини такомиллаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Тошкент ва Нукус шаҳарлари ҳамда вилоятлар марказларидаги истироҳат боғлари, хиёбонларда жамоат тартибини сақлаш ва хавфсизликни таъминлаш борасидаги фаолиятни такомиллаштириш бўйича қуйидаги чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш:</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">хиёбонлар ва истироҳат боғларида «Хавфсиз бозор», «Хавфсиз сайилгоҳ» ва «Хавфсиз истироҳат боғи» янги моделини жорий этиш; </span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">объектларда кузатув камералари қамровини кенгайтириш ва мазкур камераларга ҳуқуқбузарликларни аниқлаш бўйича фото ва видео қайд этиш дастурларини ўрнатиш ҳамда улар орқали ҳуқуқбузарликларнинг барвақт олдини олиш ва жиноятчиликни жиловлашда самарали фойдаланиш;</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">объектларда жамоат тартибини сақлаш ва хавфсизликни таъминлаш бўйича «кузатув масканлари»ни ташкил этиш;</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">мазкур ҳудудларда қўриқлаш бўлинмаларининг шартнома асосида (пуллик) жамоат тартибини сақлаш ва жамоат хавфсизлигини таъминлаш борасидаги фаолиятини ташкил этиш;</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">жамоат тартибини сақлаш соҳасида маҳаллий ҳокимият органлари, истироҳат боғи ва хиёбонлар маъмуриятининг масъулиятини ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил июнь</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></i></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(П. Бобожонов),</span></i></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(И. Норқулов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">88-мақсад: Адвокатура институтининг салоҳиятини тубдан ошириш, шунингдек, малакали ҳуқуқий ёрдам кўрсатиш тизимини ривожлантириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Адлия вазирлиги (А. Ташкулов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">24.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Адвокатура тизимига ёш малакали кадрларни жалб этиш ва уларни адвокатлик фаолиятини амалга оширишда ҳар томонлама қўллаб-қувватлаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Адвокатура тизимига ёш малакали кадрларни жалб этиш ва уларни адвокатлик фаолиятини амалга оширишда ҳар томонлама қўллаб-қувватлаш мақсадида Ўзбекистон Республикаси Адвокатлар палатаси ҳузурида <b>«Ёш адвокатлар» </b>жамоатчилик кенгашини тузиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил апрель</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">-</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Адвокатлар палатаси</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(келишув асосида)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">89-мақсад: Коррупциявий омилларни бартараф этиш тизимининг самарадорлигини ошириш, жамиятда Коррупцияга нисбатан муросасиз муносабатни шакллантириш ишларини жадал давом эттириш</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center"><span><b><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></i></b></span><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> — Коррупцияга қарши курашиш агентлиги (А. Бурханов)</span></i></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt;COLOR: black">25.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="25%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Давлат хизматчиларида коррупцияга нисбатан муросасиз муносабатни шакллантириш, уларга «ҳалоллик вакцинаси»ни сингдириш ҳамда ушбу борада превентив механизмларни жорий этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="31%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Давлат хизматини ривожлантириш агентлигининг раҳбар кадрларни баҳолаш марказида Коррупцияга қарши курашиш агентлигининг буюртмаси асосида 2025 йил давомида камида 500 нафар раҳбарлик лавозимларида ишлаётганлар ва ушбу лавозимлар учун захирада турганларнинг коррупцияга қарши барқарорлиги даражасини баҳолаш.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.35pt"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></b></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> Давлат хизматчиларида коррупцияга нисбатан муросасиз муносабатни сингдириш бўйича қадриятлар тизимини шакллантириш юзасидан тадқиқотлар олиб бориш асосида таъсирчан чора-тадбирларни жорий этишга оид таклифларни мунтазам (йилига камида бир марта) киритиб бориш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="9%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил февралдан бошлаб йил давомида</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="13%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Хорижий грант маблағлари, манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар маблағлари</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Давлат хизматини ривожлантириш агентлиги</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(А. Мусаев)</span></i></span><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372324" id="7372324">Изоҳ: Дастурда назарда тутилган чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш жараёнида уларнинг молиялаштириш манбаларига ҳамда тадбирларни амалга ошириш муддатларига «Ўзбекистон — 2030» <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/6600413#6605157">стратегиясини</a> амалга ошириш бўйича Республика комиссияси раиси — Бош вазир томонидан ўзгартиришлар киритилиши мумкин.</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372037" id="7372037"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372095" id="7372095">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />11-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372325" id="7372325">«Ўзбекистон — 2030» стратегиясининг Қонун устуворлигини таъминлаш, халқ хизматидаги давлат бошқарувини ташкил этиш йўналиши бўйича 2025 йилда ишлаб чиқиладиган норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжатлар лойиҳалари</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372326" id="7372326">РЎЙХАТИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372327" id="7372327"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="7372328" id="7372328"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Т/р</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасида назарда тутилган </span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">чора-</span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тадбирлар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро муддати</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Масъул ижрочилар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">IV. ҚОНУН УСТУВОРЛИГИНИ ТАъМИНЛАШ, ХАЛҚ ХИЗМАТИДАГИ ДАВЛАТ БОШҚАРУВИНИ ТАШКИЛ ЭТИШ</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">75-мақсад: Маҳаллий давлат ҳокимияти вакиллик органларини халқнинг чинакам «овозига» айлантириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий Мажлис Сенати</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">келишув асосида</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маҳаллий кенгашлардаги партия гуруҳлари фаолияти самарадорлигини ошириш бўйича қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маҳаллий кенгашлардаги партия гуруҳлари ўз партиясининг йўналишидан келиб чиққан ҳолда ҳудудларни ривожлантириш дастурларини ишлаб чиқиш ва қабул қилишда иштирок этишини йўлга қўйиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маҳаллий кенгашларда ҳудудий ижтимоий-иқтисодий ривожланиш дастурлари тасдиқланаётганда уларнинг лойиҳалари бўйича маҳаллий кенгашлардаги партия гуруҳлари фикрини ҳисобга олиш амалиётини жорий қилиш масалалари назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">август</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">76-мақсад: Маҳаллий давлат ҳокимияти ижро органлари фаолиятини трансформа</span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ц</span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ия қилиб, ҳудудий бошқарувни «аҳоли манфаатларига хизмат қилиш» тамойили асосида йўлга қўйиш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Адлия вазирлиги (А. Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="2"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Вазирлар Маҳкамаси қарорлари, фармойишлари ва бошқа топшириқлари ижросини назорат қилишнинг самарали механизмларини жорий этиш бўйича норматив-</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада </span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«ijro.gov.uz» тизими орқали</span></span><b> </b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ижро этувчи ҳокимият тизимига кирувчи идора ва ташкилотлар томонидан</span></span></b> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳукумат топшириқлари ижроси ва назоратини ташкил этиш тартиби</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">назарда тутилади</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">август</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ш. Шерматов</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий Мажлис Сенати </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">келишув асосида</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="3"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқ депутатлари маҳаллий Кенгаши томонидан </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кенгаш сўрови юбориш тартиб-таомилларини белгилаш бўйича Олий Мажлис Сенати қарори лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кенгаш сўрови лойиҳасини тайёрлаш тартиби;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кенгаш сўровининг матнига қўйилган талаблар;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кенгаш сўрови юбориш масаласини маҳаллий Кенгаш доимий комиссияси ва Кенгаш сессиясида кўриб чиқиш тартиб-таомиллари назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">77-мақсад: Давлат хизматларини рақамлаштиришнинг кўламини кенгайтириш орқали аҳоли учун «Сервис давлат» тизимини жорий қилиш, фуқаро ва давлат ўртасидаги муносабатларда бюрократик тартиботларга барҳам бериш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Адлия вазирлиги (А. Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="4"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тадбиркорлик фаолиятини давлат томонидан тартибга солиш юкини камайтириш бўйича Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг қарори лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада қуйидагилар назарда тутилади:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">лицензия ва рухсат этиш хусусиятига эга ҳужжатларни беришда талабгор мавжуд талаб ва шартларга мос келиш-келмаслигини аниқлашга қаратилган дастлабки баҳолаш хизматини йўлга қўйиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">13 турдаги лицензия ва рухсат этиш тартиб-таомилларини бекор қилиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ягона интерактив давлат хизматлари портали, «Лицензия» ахборот тизими, Тадбиркорлик суб</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ъ</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ектларини давлат рўйхатидан ўтказиш ва ҳисобга қўйишнинг автоматлаштирилган тизими ҳамда «Ягона дарча» божхона ахборот тизимида ахборот ва маслаҳат хизматларини сун</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ъ</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ий интеллект ёрдамида кўрсатишни йўлга қўйиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳудудий архитектура-шаҳарсозлик кенгашлари томонидан бинолар ва иншоотларнинг лойиҳаларини келишиш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ни </span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">фақат</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">э</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">лектрон шаклда</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Шаффоф қурилиш» тизими воситасида амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="5"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Айрим давлат хизматларини «композит» шаклда кўрсатишни назарда тутувчи Вазирлар Маҳкамаси қарори лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада қуйидагилар назарда тутилади:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тураржой об</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ъ</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ектларига кадастр паспортини шакллантириш учун ариза юборилганда композит шаклда тураржой об</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ъ</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ектларига бўлган ҳуқуқларни давлат рўйхатидан ўтказиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">қишлоқ хўжалигига мўлжалланган ер участкаларини ижарага беришда электрон онлайн аукцион савдо ғолибининг иштирокисиз якка тартибдаги тадбиркор сифатида деҳқон хўжалигини ташкил этиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">фермер хўжаликлари қайта ташкил этилганда ёки тугатилганда уларни Кўп тармоқли фермер хўжаликлари реестрига киритиш ва чиқариш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил</span></span> <span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Абду</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">х</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">акимов</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="6"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат ўрмон фондига кирмайдиган дарахтлар ва буталарни кўчириб ўтказиш фаолиятини тартибга солиш бўйича </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">лойиҳаси</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада давлат ўрмон фондига кирмайдиган дарахтлар ва буталарни кўчириш, кесиш учун рухсатнома бери</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ш</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил</span></span> <span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">77-мақсад: Давлат хизматларини рақамлаштириш кўламини кенгайтириш орқали аҳоли учун </span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«</span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сервис давлат</span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">»</span></span></b><b> </b><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тизимини жорий қилиш, фуқаро ва давлат ўртасидаги муносабатларда бюрократик тартиботларга барҳам бериш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Абду</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">х</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">акимов</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="7"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат органлари ва ташкилотлари фаолиятида </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">иш жараёнларини рақамлаштириш доирасида </span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">қоғоздан фойдаланиш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ни тартибга солиш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада </span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">давлат органлари ва ташкилотлари фаолиятида қоғоздан фойдаланишга қатъий меъёрлар ўрнати</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ш</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ва унинг айланмасини тубдан камайтириш бўйича </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">чоралар назарда тутилади.</span></span> </span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июн</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Норқулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">79-мақсад: Янги Ўзбекистонни барпо этишда Олий Мажлис палаталари ва сиёсий партиялар ролини янада ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий Мажлис Қонунчилик палатаси (келишув асосида)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="8"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий Мажлис </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қонунчилик палатаси томонидан Давлат бюджети ижросини назорат қилиш<b> механизмларини такомиллаштиришга </b>қаратилган<b> </b>норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳукуматнинг Давлат бюджетига доир <b>барча ҳисоботларини</b> Қонунчилик палатасига фақат <b>Бюджет кодексида белгиланган аудит хулосаси</b> билан биргаликда киритиш; </span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">вазирлик ва идоралар учун белгиланган бюджет маблағларидан фойдаланиш билан боғлиқ <b>мақсадли индикаторларнинг</b> бажарилиши юзасидан тегишли ҳисоботларни Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталарида <b>ҳар чорак якунида</b> эшитиб бориш амалиётини жорий этиш; </span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг Давлат бюджетининг ижроси тўғрисидаги ҳисоботларини Қонунчилик палатасининг мажлисларида <b>ҳар ярим йилда </b>эшитиш,<b> </b>Қонунчилик палатасининг <b>қўмиталарида </b>эса<b> ҳар чорак якуни бўйича </b>кўриб бориш амалиётини йўлга қўйиш; </span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳукумат томонидан тегишли ҳисобот даври учун тақдим этилган Давлат бюджетининг ва давлат мақсадли жамғармалари бюджетларининг ижроси тўғрисидаги ҳисоботлар билан биргаликда Ўзбекистон Республикасининг ижтимоий ва ишлаб чиқариш инфратузилмасини ривожлантириш дастурининг ижро этилиши ҳолати бўйича маълумотни Олий Мажлис Қонунчилик палатасига киритиш амалиётини йўлга қўйиш;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижтимоий ва ишлаб чиқариш инфратузилмасини ривожлантириш дастурида лойиҳалар портфелини ишлаб чиқиш ва маҳаллий кенгашларда кўриб чиқиш жараёнида Олий Мажлис Қонунчилик палатаси депутатларининг иштирокини таъминлаш;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳар йилнинг 1 июнига қадар тегишли вазирликлар, идоралар ва маҳаллий ижро этувчи ҳокимият органлари томонидан тайёрланиб тақдим этиладиган лойиҳалар портфели бўйича таклифларни Ҳукумат томонидан Олий Мажлис Қонунчилик палатаси депутатларига кўриб чиқиш учун тақдим этиш амалиётини жорий этиш;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳар бир қўмита томонидан ўз фаолият йўналиши бўйича Давлат бюджети ижросини назорат қилиш амалиётини янада фаоллаштириш; </span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">биринчи даражали <b>бюджет маблағларини тақсимловчиларнинг харажатлари</b> устидан парламент назоратини кучайтириш мақсадида Қонунчилик палатаси қўмиталари мажлисларида тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар раҳбарларининг <b>Давлат бюджети маблағлари ҳисобидан </b>амалга оширилаётган <b>ривожлантириш дастурлари </b>ҳамда<b> </b>ушбу дастурлар<b> мақсадли индикаторларининг бажарилиши </b>юзасидан<b> </b>ўз фаолият йўналишларидан келиб чиқиб, <b>ҳисоботларини</b> эшитиб бориш назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="9"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Парламентда<b> мухолифатнинг </b>кафолатланган ҳуқуқларини янада кенгайтириш бўйича қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">мухолифатнинг кафолатланган ҳуқуқлари сонини <b>3 тадан 6 тага</b> ошириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">мухолифат вакиллари <b>1 нафар қўмита раиси </b>ва <b>2 нафар қўмита раиси ўринбосари</b> лавозимларига номзодлар кўрсатиш ҳуқуқини кафолатлаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">қонун лойиҳаси иккинчи ўқишда кўриб чиқилгунига қадар ўша масалага доир қонун лойиҳасининг, шунингдек, Қонунчилик палатаси қарори лойиҳасининг муқобил таҳририни киритиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳар чоракда <b>«ҳукумат соати»</b> ва <b>парламент сўрови</b> доирасида мухолифат томонидан <b>камида биттадан масала киритиш</b> каби масалалар назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Парламент тадқиқотлари институти</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(келишув асосида)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Олий Мажлис палаталари (келишув асосида)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="10"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қонунчилик палатасига <b>қонун лойиҳаларини киритишнинг</b> ҳуқуқий асосларини такомиллаштириш ҳамда қонунлардаги <b>ҳуқуқий бўшлиқларни тўлдиришнинг</b> аниқ тартибларини белгилашга қаратилган қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қонун лойиҳасида қуйидагилар назарда тутилади: </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">қонун лойиҳаларини парламентга киритишда <b>халқаро шартнома матнининг</b>, <b>ҳуқуқий экспертиза</b> ҳамда <b>коррупцияга қарши экспертизаси</b> натижаларининг, жамоатчилик муҳокамаси натижаларининг тақдим этилишини, шунингдек, қонун лойиҳаси <b>иккинчи ўқишда</b> кўриб чиқилгунига қадар ташаббускор томонидан уни чақириб олишни белгилаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий Мажлис</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">палаталари</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(келишув асосида)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="11"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Парламент назорати</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> натижаларининг таъсирчанлигини оширишга қаратилган қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қонун лойиҳаси билан «Парламент назорати тўғрисида»ги Қонуннинг </span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/2929477#2929805">21</a><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">, </span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/2929477#2929815">22-моддаларига</a><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> тегишли ўзгартиш ва қўшимчалар киритиш назарда тутилади. Жумладан: </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">парламент назорати субъектлари томонидан тегишли давлат органларидан қонун ҳужжатларининг, давлат дастурларининг ижроси, ўз зиммаларига юклатилган вазифалар ҳамда функцияларнинг амалга оширилишини <b>талаб қилиши</b>,<b> </b>шунингдек, ушбу масалалар бўйича давлат органлари фаолияти самарадорлигини оширишга қаратилган <b>чора-тадбирлар кўриш юзасидан таклиф ва тавсиялар киритиш</b> ҳуқуқи; </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">давлат органлари томонидан парламент назорати натижалари бўйича парламент назорати субъектларининг <b>қонуний талабларини бажариш</b>, уларнинг ишлаб чиқилган таклифлар ва тавсияларини <b>кўриб чиқиш натижаларини</b> ҳамда улар бўйича кўрилган чора-тадбирлар тўғрисида парламент назорати <b>субъектларига хабар қилиш мажбурияти</b> назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий Мажлис</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">палаталари</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(келишув асосида)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Олий Мажлис </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сенати</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(келишув асосида)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="12"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сенат қўмиталаридаги эшитув институти асосларини мустаҳкамлаш</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">бўйича қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада Сенат фаолиятида эшитув билан боғлиқ қонунчилик ҳужжатларини халқаро тажриба ва хорижий давлатлар қонунчилиги асосида ўрганиб, маъқулланган илғор тажриба асосида парламентга оид қонунчиликни мувофиқлаштириш назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="13"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тошкент шаҳрида Парламентлараро иттифоқнинг 150-юбилей Ассамблеясини юқори савияда ўтказиш бўйича қарор лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада Тошкент шаҳрида Парламентлараро Иттифоқнинг 150-юбилей Ассамблеясига тайёргарлик кўриш ва уни ўтказиш чора-тадбирлари назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">80-мақсад. Норма ижодкорлиги фаолиятининг ислоҳотлар билан уйғунлигини таъминлаш ва давлат ҳуқуқий сиёсатининг институ</span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ц</span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ионал асосларини ривожлантириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Худаяров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="14"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Интеллектуал мулк об</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ъ</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ектларини</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">нг</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳуқуқий ҳимоясини янада кучайтиришга қаратилган норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">дори воситалари, тиббий буюмлар ва тиббий техникани давлат рўйхатидан ўтказишда мажбурий тақдим этиладиган ҳужжатлар қаторига интеллектуал мулк объектларига бўлган ҳуқуқларни тасдиқловчи муҳофаза ҳужжатлари (гувоҳнома, патент) ёки улардан фойдаланиш тўғрисидаги шартномаларни киритиш; </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">интеллектуал мулк ҳуқуқларига қатъий риоя қилишни, жумладан, дори воситалари, тиббий буюмлар ва тиббий техниканинг контрафакт нусхаларини ишлаб чиқариш, тайёрлаш, сақлаш ҳамда реализа</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ц</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ия қилишни фарма</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ц</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">евтика фаолияти билан шуғулланиш учун бериладиган лицензия талаблари ва шартларининг қўпол равишда бузилиши сифатида эътироф этиш назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил феврал</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташкулов)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бош прокуратура ҳузуридаги Иқтисодий жиноятларга қарши курашиш департаменти,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тадбиркорлик ҳуқуқларини ҳимоя қилиш бўйича вакил</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Д.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Касимов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Адлия вазирлиги (А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="15"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Товар белгилари ва патент божлари тўғрисидаги қонунчиликни такомиллаштириш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">интеллектуал мулк ҳуқуқ эгаларининг ҳуқуқларини тиклаш мақсадида тадбиркорлик субъекти тугатилиб, товар белгисига бўлган ҳуқуқ маълум бир шахсга ўтказилмасдан қолдирилганда, унинг юридик тақдирини белгилаш тартибини ишлаб чиқиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">товар белгисидан фойдаланиш сифатида эътироф этиладиган ҳолатларни аниқлаштириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">айрим интеллектуал мулк объектларига доир муҳофаза </span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳужжатларига ва лицензия шартномаларига ўзгартириш киритиш, тизим бўйича келиб тушган талабномаларнинг ўтказилган муддатини тиклаш учун </span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тўланадиган патент божларини халқаро шартномаларга мувофиқлаштириш назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хайдаров),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қудратов)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Вазирлар Маҳкамаси</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="16"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қонун ижодкорлиги жараёнида <b>барқарорликни</b> таъминлашга қаратилган ишлар самарадорлигини ошириш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада: </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">қонунларда муайян вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> мақоми, номи, вазифалари ўзгарганида <b>техник, ташкилий</b> хусусиятдаги ўзгартиришлар киритишнинг олдини олиш мақсадида <b>ягона ёндашувни белгилаш</b>;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">амалдаги қонунларга тегишли соҳа бўйича ваколатли давлат органлари <b>номларини</b> <b>эмас</b>, балки қонун тартибга соладиган ижтимоий муносабатлар бўйича <b>соҳага масъул</b> <b>ваколатли орган</b> деган таҳрирда ўзгартиришлар киритиш; </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ушбу таклифни амалга ошириш механизми сифатида <b>Президент </b>ёки<b> Ҳукумат қарорлари билан тасдиқланган вазирлик ва идоралар тўғрисидаги низомларда </b>уларнинг қайси соҳада ваколатли орган эканлигини аниқлаштириш ва қонунлар билан ўзаро<b> </b>мувофиқлаштириш, соҳага оид масъул ваколатли органлар рўйхатини белгилаш назарда тутилади. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил август</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">81-мақсад. Давлат фуқаролик хизматини меритократия, ҳалоллик ва профессионаллик тамойиллари асосида ташкил этиш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Давлат хизматини ривожлантириш агентлиги (</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">А</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">. </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мусаев</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="17"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат органларида масофавий ишни ташкил этиш ва мослашувчан иш тизимини такомиллаштириш</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">бўйича </span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Вазирлар Маҳкамаси қарори лойиҳаси</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:15.05pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:15.05pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">масофадан туриб амалга ошири</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ли</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ши мумкин бўлган функциялар рўйхати;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:15.05pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">давлат органларида давлат хизматчиларининг масофадан туриб ишлаш қоидалари;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:15.05pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">давлат органларида давлат хизматчиларининг мослашувчан иш вақти режимида ишлаш қоидалари</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">назарда тутилади</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Камбағалликни қисқартириш ва бандлик вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Зохидов)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Шерматов)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">А. Ташкулов</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хайдаров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Б</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">. </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Саидов</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="18"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат органлари ва ташкилотлари ходимлари хорижга</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">хизмат сафарларига </span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">чиқишини енгиллаштириш мақсадида хизмат паспортларини жорий этиш </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">бўйича </span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">хизмат паспортларидан фойдаланиш ҳуқуқига эга давлат органлари ва ташкилотлари ходимлари рўйхатини тасдиқлаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">хизмат паспортларини расмийлаштириш ва улардан фойдаланиш тартибини белгилаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">хизмат паспортларини жорий этиш юзасидан тегишли норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжатлар қабул қилиш ва амалдаги ҳужжатларга ўзгартиришлар киритиш</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">назарда тутилади</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(П.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бобожонов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">8</span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2</span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-мақсад. Халқ билан мулоқотни янада кенгайтириш орқали аҳоли муаммоларини аниқлаш ва ҳал этиш тизимининг самарадорлигини ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президенти Халқ қабулхонаси (У. Мухаммадиев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="19"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Жисмоний ва юридик шахсларнинг мурожаатлари тўғрисида»ги Қонун</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">га ўзгартириш ва қўшимчалар киритиш тўғрисидаги қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="a0" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада «колл марказ», «ишонч телефони» каби тушунчаларни киритиш, бу тизимлар билан ишлаш тартиби назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><strong>86-мақсад. Суд ҳокимиятининг мустақиллигини кучайтириш ва унинг фаолиятида очиқликни таъминлаш орқали одил судловга эришиш даражасини ошириш</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Олий суд (Б. Исламов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="20"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Судьялар ҳамжамияти органларининг ҳуқуқий асосларини белгилаш мақсадида «Судьялар ҳамжамияти органлари тўғрисида»ги қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада: </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Судьялар ҳамжамияти органларига суд ҳокимиятининг мустақиллиги конституциявий принципига риоя этилишини таъминлашга кўмаклашиш, суд ҳокимиятининг нуфузини мустаҳкамлаш, Судьяларнинг ҳуқуқ ва қонуний манфаатларини ҳимоя қилиш, судлар фаолиятини ташкилий жиҳатдан, кадрлар ва ресурслар билан таъминлаш ҳамда шу каби бошқа муҳим асосий вазифаларни юклаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Судьялар ҳамжамияти органларининг вазифалари, функциялари ва ваколатлари, уни шакллантириш, шу жумладан, ушбу органларга номзод кўрсатиш тартиби, шунингдек, судьялар ҳамжамияти органлари фаолияти механизмлари, ўзаро ва бошқа идоралар билан ҳамкорлик қилиш тартиби назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Судьялар олий кенгаши</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Х.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ёдгоров),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Конституциявий суд</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(М.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Абдусаломов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="21"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Судьялар мустақиллигини таъминлашда судьялар мақомининг ҳуқуқий асосларини янада такомиллаштиришга қаратилган «Судьялар мақоми тўғрисида»ги қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада судьянинг дахлсизлиги, судьянинг малакасини ошириш, судьяларнинг моддий ва ижтимоий кафолатлари, судьяни лавозимга тайинлаш ва озод этиш, судьянинг ваколатлари, судьяни бошқа лавозимга ўтказиш шартлари каби муҳим қоидалар назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Конституциявий суд</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(М.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Абдусаломов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хайдаров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="22"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Суд тизимини молиялаштиришда суд ҳокимияти мустақиллигининг кафолатларини кучайтириш бўйича қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада <b>суд тизимини молиялаштириш</b> учун маблағлар <b>ажратиш</b> ва <b>тақсимлаш</b> жараёнида <b>судьялар ҳамжамиятининг</b> <b>иштирок этиши кафолатлари</b> белгиланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хайдаров),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Конституциявий суд</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(М.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Абдусаломов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий Мажлис Сенати (келишув асосида)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="23"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий Мажлис Сенатида Конституциявий суд ва Олий суд судьялигига, Судьялар олий кенгаши аъзолигига номзодларни кўриб чиқиш тартибини такомиллаштириш бўйича қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада Конституциявий суд ва Олий суд судьялигига, Судьялар олий кенгаши аъзолигига номзодларни Сенат томонидан сайлашда мазкур масалани дастлаб Сенат қўмиталари томонидан муҳокама қилиш тартибини жорий этиш масалалари назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Судьялар олий кенгаши</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Х.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ёдгоров),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий суд</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Исламов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Конституциявий суд</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">М.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Абдусаломов</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">87-мақсад. Ҳуқуқни муҳофаза қилувчи органларнинг фаолиятини инсон манфаатлари, қадр-қиммати ва ҳуқуқларини ҳимоя қилишга йўналтириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Бош прокуратура</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Н.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Йўлдошев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="24"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Прокуратура органлари ҳузуридаги жамоатчилик кенгашлари фаолиятини белгиловчи норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада прокуратура органлари ҳузуридаги жамоатчилик кенгашларининг ҳуқуқий мақоми белгиланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="25"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ишни судга қадар юритиш босқичига ахборот технологиялари</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ни</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">жорий этиш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">процессуал ҳаракатларни автоматик қайд этиш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маълумотларни онлайн олиш имконини яратиш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маълумотлар ўртасида тафовутлар юзага келишининг олдини олиш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">иш материалларини онлайн узатиш имконини яратиш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">жиноятларни квалификация қилишда сунъий интеллект технологияларидан фойдаланиш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">жиноят ишини қўзғатишни рад этишнинг ягона ҳисобини юритиш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">суд экспертизасини онлайн тайинлаш механизмлари белгиланади</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(П.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бобожонов)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат хавфсизлик хизмати</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Курбанов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — </span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инсон ҳуқуқлари бўйича миллий марказ (А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Саидов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="26"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инсон ҳуқуқларини таъминлаш бўйича узоқ муддатли миллий стратегияни тасдиқлашга оид норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">шахсий ва сиёсий ҳуқуқларни ҳимоя қилиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">иқтисодий, ижтимоий ва маданий ҳуқуқларни ҳимоя қилиш ҳамда барқарор ривожланиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">инсон ҳуқуқлари соҳасидаги халқаро стандартларни қонунчиликка ва ҳуқуқни қўллаш амалиётига имплементация қилиш ҳамда мониторинг қилиш механизмларини такомиллаштириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">инсон ҳуқуқлари соҳасида ҳуқуқий саводхонликни ошириш, жумладан, бу борада ахборот тарқатиш, таълим бериш фаолиятини самарали ташкил этиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">инсон ҳуқуқларини ҳимоя қилиш соҳасидаги халқаро ва минтақавий тузилмалар, хорижий мамлакатларнинг инсон ҳуқуқлари бўйича миллий институтлари билан ҳамкорликни ривожлантириш бўйича устувор чора-тадбирлар назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташкулов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бош прокуратура</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Н.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Йўлдошев)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(П.</span></span></i><i> </i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бобожонов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Адлия вазирлиги (А. Ташкулов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="27"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Суд экспертиза соҳасини янада такомиллаштириш мақсадида <b>«Суд-экспертлик фаолияти тўғрисида»ги</b> Қонун</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">га ўзгартириш ва қўшимчалар киритиш бўйича қонун</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">: </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">суд экспертларини тайёрлаш</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ва уларнинг малакасини ошириш масалаларини такомиллаштириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">нодавлат суд-экспертиза ташкилотларининг мақоми, уларга қўйиладиган талаблар, улар томонидан суд экспертизалари ва тадқиқотларини ўтказиш тартиб-таомилларини белгилаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">нодавлат суд-экспертлик фаолиятини методик таъминлаш ҳамда тартибга солиш механизмини жорий этиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">жисмоний ва юридик шахсларнинг мурожаатларига асосан экспертлар томонидан мутахассис фикрини бериш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">махсус ваколатли органнинг ҳуқуқ ва мажбуриятларини белгилаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">суд экспертлари томонидан қасамёд қабул қилиш ва касб-этика қоидаларини белгилаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">суд-экспертлик фаолиятининг янада ишончлилигини ошириш мақсадида аккредита</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ц</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ия ва валида</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ц</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ия институтларини жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">П. Бобожонов</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий суд</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Б</span></span></i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">. <i>Исламов</i></span></span><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бош прокуратура</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Н. Йўлдошев</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">89-мақсад: Коррупциявий омилларни бартараф этиш тизимининг самарадорлигини ошириш, жамиятда коррупцияга нисбатан муросасиз муносабатни шакллантириш ишларини жадал давом эттириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Коррупцияга қарши курашиш агентлиги (А. Бурханов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="28"><li align="center" class="a0" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:24%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат органлари ва ташкилотлари, шу жумладан</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">маҳаллий давлат ҳокимияти органларида Коррупцияга қарши курашиш ишларининг самарадорлигини рейтинг баҳолаш тизимини такомиллаштириш</span></span> <span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">бўйича </span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ички назорат тузилмалари томонидан ўтказилган мониторинг ва назорат тадбирлари, ўрганишлар ва хизмат текширувлари натижасида кўрилган превентив чоралар самарадорлиги</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ни ошириш</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">айрим индикатор кўрсаткичларини бирлаштириш, бекор қилиш, уларга ўзгартириш ва қўшимчалар киритиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">рейтинг баҳолашни мустақил амалга оширувчи экспертлар гуруҳи сонини кўпайтириш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">давлат ташкилотлари томонидан рейтинг баҳолашга оид маълумотларни ҳар ярим йилликда киритиб бориш назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июл</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:18%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">А. Ташкулов</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат хизматини ривожлантириш</span></span> <span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">А. Мусаев</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372329" id="7372329">Изоҳлар:</div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372330" id="7372330">Дастурда назарда тутилган чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш учун қабул қилинадиган ҳужжатлар шакли заруратга қараб ўзгартирилиши, бошқа бандлардаги ҳужжатлар билан бирлаштирилиши ёки бир неча турдаги ҳужжатларга бўлиниши мумкин.</div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372331" id="7372331">Норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжатлар лойиҳаларини ишлаб чиқиш жараёнида мутасадди вазирлик ва идораларнинг таклифлари асосида Дастурда белгиланган чора-тадбирларнинг мазмунига мос келадиган бошқа масалалар ҳам назарда тутилади.</div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372332" id="7372332">Дастурда назарда тутилган чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш жараёнида уларнинг молиялаштириш манбаларига ҳамда тадбирларни амалга ошириш муддатларига «Ўзбекистон — 2030» <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/6600413#6605157">стратегиясини</a> амалга ошириш бўйича Республика комиссияси раиси — Бош вазир томонидан ўзгартиришлар киритилиши мумкин.</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372096" id="7372096"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372102" id="7372102">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />12-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372333" id="7372333">«Ўзбекистон — 2030» стратегиясининг қонун устуворлигини таъминлаш, халқ хизматидаги давлат бошқарувини ташкил этиш йўналиши бўйича 2025 йилга мўлжалланган</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372334" id="7372334">МАҚСАДЛИ КЎРСАТКИЧЛАР</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372335" id="7372335"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="7372336" id="7372336"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Т/р</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Мақсадли кўрсаткич</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Ўлчов бирлиги</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>2025</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>I чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>II чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>III чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>IV чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Масъуллар</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>4.1. Халқ хизматидаги давлат бошқарувини ташкил этиш ва жамоатчилик бошқарувини такомиллаштириш бўйича ислоҳотлар</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>74-мақсад: Аҳоли фаровонлигини таъминлаш ва ҳудудларда кундалик масалаларни ҳал этишда маҳаллани жамоатчилик ҳамда давлат органлари ўртасидаги «таянч кўприк»ка айлантириш</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Аҳоли ташаббуси билан инфратузилмани яхшилашга ажратиладиган маблағларни йилига <b>24 триллион</b> <b>сўмга</b> етказиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">трлн сўм</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="page-break-after:avoid"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>6</b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="page-break-after:avoid"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">0,8</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="page-break-after:avoid"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2,7</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="page-break-after:avoid"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5,2</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="page-break-after:avoid"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">6</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>75-мақсад: Маҳаллий давлат ҳокимияти вакиллик органларини халқнинг чинакам «овозига» айлантириш</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маҳаллий Кенгашлар фаолиятига оид қонунчилик ҳужжатларини такомиллаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">та</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>7</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий Мажлис Сенати</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>(келишув асосида)</i></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>76-мақсад: Маҳаллий давлат ҳокимияти ижро органлари фаолиятини трансформация қилиб, ҳудудий бошқарувни «аҳоли манфаатларига хизмат қилиш» тамойили асосида йўлга қўйиш</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳокимликлар ва вазирликлар бўлинмаларининг бир-бирини такрорловчи <b>70 дан ортиқ</b> функцияларини оптималлаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0