der-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="page-break-after:avoid"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1,5</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:13%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="page-break-after:avoid"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="page-break-after:avoid"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат хизматини ривожлантириш агентлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">10.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.25pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат бошқарувида мавжуд бўлган <b>5 мингга</b> яқин функцияларни амалга ошириш жараёнларини босқичма-босқич рақамлаштириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">та</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-