б чиққан ҳолда изчил амалга ошириш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 3"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги (Б. Саидов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 4"><td rowspan="5" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ўзбекистон Республикасининг <strong>Бирлашган Миллатлар Ташкилотидаги</strong> ўрни ва нуфузини ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ўзбекистон Республикасининг ташаббусларини Бирлашган Миллатлар Ташкилоти Бош Ассамблеяси резолюциялари сифатида қабул қилишни ташкил этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Доимий</span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">-</span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 5"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> БМТ Бош Ассамблеясининг 80-сессияси умумий мунозараларида Ўзбекистон делегацияси иштирокини юқори савияда ва самарали таъминлаш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> БМТнинг Иқлим ўзгариши бўйича ҳадли конвенцияси томонлари конференциясининг 30-сессиясида <em>(COP30, Бразилия, 10 — 21 ноябрь) </em>Ўзбекистон делегацияси иштирокини юқори савияда ва самарали таъминлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил сентябрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 6"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> БМТнинг 2026 — 2030 йилларда Ўзбекистон учун Барқарор ривожланиш мақсадлари соҳасида ҳамкорлик бўйича ҳадли дастурини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил ноябрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 7"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">6.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> ЮНЕСКО Бош конференциясининг 43-сессиясини Самарқанд шаҳрида юқори савияда ўтказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил май</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 8"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">7.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> БМТ агентликлари билан ҳамкорликда давлат хизматлари сифатини ошириш бўйича халқаро форум ўтказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил октябрь-ноябрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 9"><td rowspan="3" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ўзбекистон Республикасининг <strong>нуфузли халқаро ва минтақавий ташкилотлар</strong> (ШҲТ, МДҲ, ТДТ, ЕХҲТ ва бошқалар) ҳамда етакчи <strong>молиявий институтлар</strong> (Жаҳон банки, ЕТТБ, ОТБ, ОИИБ ва бошқалар) билан истиқболли ҳамкорлик йўналишларида фаол ҳамкорликни давом эттириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ўзбекистон Республикасининг кўптомонлама дипломатия йўналишидаги фаолиятини тизимли шаклда амалга оширилишини таъминлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">-</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 10"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Тегишли халқаро ва минтақавий тузилмалар билан ҳамкорликни ривожлантириш, уларнинг фаолиятида ўрнатилган тартибда иштирок этиш, янги ҳамкорлик лойиҳаларини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Тегишли фаолият тақвимига асосан</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 11"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ушбу тузилмалар доирасидаги саммит ва учрашувларга пухта тайёргарлик кўриш, Ўзбекистон ҳамда халқаро ҳамжамият манфаатларига жавоб берадиган янги ташаббусларни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 12"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">91-мақсад: Марказий Осиё минтақасида амалий ҳамкорликни сифат жиҳатидан янги босқичга олиб чиқиш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 13"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги (Б. Саидов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 14"><td rowspan="4" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Марказий Осиё</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> минтақасидаги барча давлатлар билан аҳил қўшничилик муносабатларини мустаҳкамлаш, ўзаро манфаатли амалий ҳамкорликни сифат жиҳатидан янги босқичга олиб чиқиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1. </span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Марказий Осиё давлатлари билан олий даражадаги мулоқот ва икки томонлама ҳамкорликнинг барча форматдаги механизмлари асосида (ҳукуматлараро комиссиялар, сиёсий маслаҳатлашувлар, парламентлараро ҳамкорлик комиссияси ва бошқалар) йиғилишларни доимий ташкил этиб бориш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">-</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Марказий Осиё халқаро институти</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 15"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Марказий Осиё давлатлари етакчиларининг навбатдаги Маслаҳат учрашувини юқори савияда ўтказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил сентябрь</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 16"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ўзбекистон Республикасининг чегара олди назорат-ўтказиш пунктларини реконструкция қилиш ва кенгайтириш орқали уларнинг ўтказувчанлигини ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 17"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Марказий Осиёда экология, атроф-муҳитнинг ифлосланиши ва табиатни муҳофаза қилиш борасида ҳамкорликни янги босқичга олиб чиқиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 18"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">92-мақсад: Анъанавий шериклар билан ўзаро манфаатли алоқаларни ривожлантириш, халқаро ҳамкорлик географиясини кенгайтириш, глобал ишлаб чиқариш ва етказиб бериш занжирларига қўшилиш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 19"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги (Б. Саидов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 20"><td rowspan="3" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4.</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Россия Федерацияси</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> ва <strong>Мустақил Давлатлар Ҳамдўстлиги мамлакатлари</strong> билан кўп қиррали амалий ҳамкорликни тизимли асосда ривожлантириш. </span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мазкур минтақа давлатлари билан ўзаро келишилган асосда олий ва юқори даражалардаги мулоқот, ҳудудлараро ҳамкорлик, икки ва кўптомонлама муносабатларни изчил давом эттириш. </span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 21"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ўзаро ҳамкорликда асосий эътиборни иқтисодий дипломатияга қаратиш, бу борада ташкил этилаётган тегишли тадбирларнинг натижадорлигини таъминлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 22"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> МДҲ доирасида ўтказиладиган саммит ва бошқа йирик тадбирларнинг кун тартиби ҳамда дастурларини белгилашда фаол иштирок этиш, уларга пухта тайёргарлик кўриш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Тегишли ташкилот ва давлатларнинг ҳамда Ўзбекистон Республикасининг халқаро фаолият тақвимига асосан</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 23"><td rowspan="3" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">5.</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Хитой, Япония, Корея Республикаси</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> ҳамда <strong>Жануби-шарқий Осиё ва Осиё-Тинч Океани минтақасининг бошқа давлатлари</strong> билан ўзаро ҳамкорликни сифат жиҳатидан янги босқичга кўтариш. </span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Хитой Халқ Республикаси билан барча шароитларда ҳар томонлама стратегик шериклик муносабатларини мунтазам равишда мустаҳкамлашга қаратилган чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 24"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Япония, Корея Республикаси ҳамда Осиё-Тинч Океани минтақасининг бошқа етакчи давлатлари билан кенг қамровли стратегик шериклик муносабатларини ўзаро келишувлар асосида тизимли тарзда кенгайтириб бориш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 25"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3. </span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Жануби-шарқий Осиё минтақаси давлатлари билан ўзаро муносабатларни ҳар томонлама мустаҳкамлаш. Бу йўналишда олий ва юқори даражаларда тегишли саммитлар ҳамда бошқа тадбирларни амалга ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">тегишли давлатларнинг ҳамда Ўзбекистон Республикасининг халқаро фаолият тақвимига асосан</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 26"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">6.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">АҚШ ва Америка қитъаси давлатлари</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> билан ҳамкорлик алоқаларини изчил ривожлантириш ва мазмунан бойитиб бориш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> АҚШ билан янги даврдаги стратегик шериклик алоқаларининг узвийлигини таъминлаш ҳамда турли йўналишларда мунтазам равишда мустаҳкамлаб бориш чораларини кўриш, хусусан, сиёсий мулоқот, парламентлараро ҳамкорлик алоқалари ҳамда иқтисодий шериклик муносабатларини кенгайтириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил якунига қадар</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">-</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Олий Мажлис Сенати</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(келишув асосида)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Қонунчилик палатаси</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(келишув асосида)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Л. Кудратов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">бошқа манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 27"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Канада, Мексика, Бразилия, Аргентина ва Лотин Америкасининг бошқа мамлакатлари билан муносабатларда янги йўналишларни ривожлантириш, фойдаланилмаган салоҳиятни амалга ошириш чораларини кўриш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ўзаро келишилган муддатларда</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 28"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">7.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Европа мамлакатлари</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> ва <strong>Европа Иттифоқи институтлари</strong> билан сиёсий мулоқот, савдо-иқтисодий, молиявий, инвестициявий ва технологик ҳамкорликни ривожлантириш, кенг кўламли шериклик ва амалий ҳамкорликнинг асосларини мустаҳкамлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ўзбекистон Республикаси ва Европа Иттифоқи ўртасида кенгайтирилган шериклик ва ҳамкорлик тўғрисидаги битимни имзолаш бўйича Европа Иттифоқи ва унга аъзо давлатлар билан музокараларни жадаллаштириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Доимий асосда</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">-</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Л. Кудратов),</span></em></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 29"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Европа мамлакатлари билан ташқи савдо, хорижий инвестициялар, инновациялар, «яшил иқтисодиёт», иқлим ўзгариши оқибатларини юмшатиш, рақамлаштириш, банк-молия тизимини модернизация қилиш ҳамда капитал бозори ва молиявий технологияларни ривожлантиришга қаратилган ўзаро манфаатли ҳамкорликни изчил давом эттириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ўзаро келишилган муддатларда</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 30"><td rowspan="4" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">8.</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Араб-мусулмон дунёси, Яқин ва Ўрта Шарқ, Жанубий Осиё ҳамда Африка минтақаси</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">даги етакчи давлатлар билан юқори суръатларда ривожланиб бораётган ўзаро манфаатли муносабатларга янги шиддат бағишлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ушбу минтақалардаги асосий ҳамкор давлатлар билан олий даражадаги ташрифлар алмашинувини юқори савияда ташкил этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 31"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> «Марказий Осиё — Кўрфаз араб давлатлари» стратегик мулоқотининг иккинчи саммитини юқори даражада ўтказиш бўйича аниқ чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил май</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 32"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ўзбекистоннинг ташаббуслари ва халқаро даражадаги дастурларини ИҲТ, «МО-КАДҲК» АЙСЕСКО ҳамда ҳамкор араб-мусулмон давлатлари билан биргаликда қабул қилинишини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Тегишли тузилмаларнинг фаолият тақвимига асосан</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 33"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4. </span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Жанубий Осиё, Яқин ва Ўрта Шарқ минтақасидаги асосий ҳамкор давлатлар билан навбатдаги сиёсий маслаҳатлашувлар ҳамда Ҳукуматлараро комиссиялар йиғилишларини ташкил этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ўзаро келишилган муддатларда</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 34"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">93-мақсад: Жаҳон савдо ташкилотига тўлақонли аъзо бўлиш.</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 35"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Жаҳон савдо ташкилоти масалалари бўйича махсус вакил (А. Урунов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 36"><td rowspan="4" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">9.</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ўзбекистоннинг ЖСТга аъзо бўлиши доирасида кўп томонлама музокараларни жадаллаштириш, аъзолик мажбуриятларини шакллантириш ва келишиш орқали ишчи гуруҳи ҳисоботининг лойиҳасини якунига етказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> АҚШ, Европа Иттифоқи ва бошқа давлатлар билан аъзолик мажбуриятларини келишиш ва уни ишчи гуруҳи ҳисоботининг лойиҳасида акс эттириш чораларини кўриш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил март — декабрь</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(И. Норқулов,</span></em></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">А. Хайдаров)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Л. Кудратов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 37"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ўзбекистоннинг ЖСТга аъзо бўлиши бўйича ишчи гуруҳнинг 10-йиғилишини ташкил этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил май</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 38"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ўзбекистоннинг ЖСТга аъзо бўлиши бўйича ишчи гуруҳнинг 11-йиғилишини ташкил этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил ноябрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 39"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ишчи гуруҳ ҳисоботи лойиҳасининг якуний босқичига ўтиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил декабрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 40"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">10.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ЖСТга аъзо давлатлар билан икки томонлама музокараларни тўлиқ якунлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Қизиқиш билдирган аъзо давлатлар билан музокараларни жадаллаштириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Л. Кудратов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(У. Абидходжаев)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 41"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Икки томонлама музокаралар якунланганлиги ҳақида баённомаларни имзолаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил декабрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 42"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">11.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ЖСТ ва савдо сиёсатини ўрганиш ва таҳлил қилиш маркази (<em>think tank</em>) ҳамда савдо ҳимояси бўлинмасини (<em>Trade defence unit</em>) ташкил этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> ЖСТ ва савдо сиёсатини ўрганиш ва таҳлил қилиш маркази (<em>Think tank</em>) ва фаолияти концепциясини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил октябрь</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра, донор ташкилотлар маблағлари</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Л. Қудратов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(У. Абидходжаев)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ЖИДУ</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 43"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> ЖСТнинг савдо ҳимояси талабларига мос мутахассислар ва <strong>савдо ҳимояси нуқтаси концепциясини ишлаб чиқиш</strong>.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил декабрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 44"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Вазирлар Маҳкамаси (Ж. Ходжаев)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 45"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">12.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Қонунчиликни ЖСТ битимлари ва халқаро амалиётга мослаштириш. </span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Вазирлар Маҳкамаси томонидан «Озиқ-овқат маҳсулотининг хавфсизлиги тўғрисида», «Антидемпинг чоралари тўғрисида», «Компенсация чоралари тўғрисида» «Муҳофаза чоралари тўғрисида»ги қонун лойиҳаларини Олий Мажлис Қонунчилик палатасига киритиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил апрель-май</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Жаҳон савдо ташкилоти масалалари бўйича махсус вакил</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(А. Урунов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Л. Кудратов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(А. Худаёров, Б. Юсупалиев)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 46"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги (Л. Кудратов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 47"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">13.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Жаҳон савдо ташкилотига аъзолик жараёни доирасида Европа Иттифоқи билан кенг қамровли ҳамкорлик бўйича ишларни якунлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> ЖСТга аъзо давлатлар билан икки томонлама музокаралар ўтказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил март</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Давлат бюджети маблағлари</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Адлия вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(<em>А. Ташкулов),</em></span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Б. Саидов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Савдо-саноат палатаси</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Д. Вахобов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(А. Жуманазаров)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 48"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> ЖСТга аъзо давлатлар билан икки томонлама музокараларни якунлаб, ички қонунчиликни мослаштириш, янги стандартларни жорий этиш ишларини жадаллаштириш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Стандартлар институтида ташкил этилган Савдодаги техник тўсиқлар бўйича ахборот маркази учун сунъий интеллект асосида таржима қилиш дастурини яратиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 49"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Адлия вазирлиги (А. Ташкулов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 50"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">14.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Миллий қонунчиликни ва ҳуқуқни қўллаш амалиётини Жаҳон савдо ташкилотининг (ЖСТ) қоида, меъёр ва битимларига мослаштириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> ЖСТ қоидаларига зид бўлган нормаларни аниқлаш бўйича амалдаги қонунчиликни хатловдан ўтказиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> ЖСТ қоидаларига мувофиқ бўлган чора-тадбирларни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Қонунчилик ҳужжатларини ташаббус қилиш ёки амалдаги қонунчилик ҳужжатларига тегишли ўзгартириш ва қўшимчалар киритишни назарда тутувчи таклифларни ўрнатилган тартибда Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил июнь</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">-</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-