2.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(О. Хасанов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 61"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Учта мавсум учун оромгоҳ иштирокчиларининг рўйхатини шакллантириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">март-апрель</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 62"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Дастур доирасида ўтказиладиган семинар ва учрашувларнинг режа-графигини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">май</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 63"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Учта мавсум учун оромгоҳни режа-жадвал асосида ташкил этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">июнь-август</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 64"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">95-мақсад: Ташқи меҳнат миграцияси тизимини такомиллаштириш, хорижда меҳнат фаолиятини юритаётган фуқароларга ҳар томонлама кўмак кўрсатиш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 65"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Вазирлар Маҳкамаси ҳузуридаги Миграция агентлиги (Б. Мусаев)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 66"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">19.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ҳудудлардаги аҳоли сони ва мавжуд ишсизлар сонидан келиб чиққан ҳолда хорижда аниқланган иш ўринларини ҳудудлар кесимида тақсимлаш ҳамда ушбу иш ўринлари асосида ишга кетмоқчи бўлган фуқароларни хорижий тилларга ва касб-ҳунарга ўқитишни таъминлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Хорижда аниқланган иш ўринларини ҳудудлар кесимида тақсимлаш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ажратилган квота асосида ишга кетмоқчи бўлган фуқароларни хорижий тилларга ва касб-ҳунарга ўқитиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">-</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Камбағалликни қисқартириш ва бандлик вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Б. Зохидов),</span></em></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(К. Шарипов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 67"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">20.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ноқонуний ташқи меҳнат миграцияси ва одам савдосига қарши курашиш соҳасида халқаро ҳамкорликни янада ривожлантириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Халқаро миграция ташкилоти (IOM) билан ноқонуний ташқи меҳнат миграцияси ва одам савдосига қарши курашиш соҳаларида ҳамкорлик меморандумини ишлаб чиқиш ва имзолаш чораларини кўриш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Хорижий давлатларнинг турдош ташкилотлари билан соҳада маълумот ва тажриба алмашиш, миграция муаммоларини ҳамкорликда ҳал этишга қаратилган келишувларга эришиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил декабрь</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">-</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 68"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">21.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ташқи меҳнат миграциясини диверсификация қилиш доирасида хорижий давлатлар билан янги меҳнат бозорларига чиқиш ва мазкур йўналишдаги тартиб-таомилларни соддалаштириш бўйича ҳамкорликни жадаллаштириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ўзбекистон фуқароларига ташкиллаштирилган тарзда хорижда ишга жойлашишига кўмаклашиш мақсадида хорижий иш берувчилар ва рекрутинг компаниялари билан ҳамкорлик шартномаларини тузиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Хорижда меҳнат фаолиятини амалга ошириш истагида бўлган фуқароларни, айниқса, аёллар ва ёшларни хорижга чиқишдан олдин мослаштириш, хорижий тилларга ва касб-ҳунарга ўқитиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Хавфсиз, ташкиллаштирилган тарзда меҳнат миграцияси тизими асосида фуқароларга хорижда ишга жойлашишига кўмаклашиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил декабрь</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Вазирлар Маҳкамаси ҳузуридаги Миграция агентлиги маблағлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 69"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">96-мақсад: Фуқароларнинг ахборотни эркин излаш, олиш ва тарқатишга доир ҳуқуқларини амалга ошириш кафолатларини янада кучайтириш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 70"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Республика Маънавият ва маърифат маркази (О. Хасанов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 71"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">22.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Интернет ва ижтимоий тармоқлар учун миллий фойдали контентлар яратиш чораларини кўриш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Интернет ва ижтимоий тармоқлардаги контентларни мониторинг ва таҳлил қилиш, бу борадаги хорижий тажрибани ўрганиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил март</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">-</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ахборот ва оммавий коммуникациялар агентлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(А. Ходжаев)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Маданият вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(О. Назарбеков)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Қ. Шарипов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мактабгача ва мактаб таълими вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Х. Умарова)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ёшлар ишлари агентлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(А. Саъдуллаев)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(П. Бобожонов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 72"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Миллий қадриятлар, маънавий-маърифий ва тарбиявий ишлар тарғиботига доир миллий контентларни яратиш, илмий асосларни ўрганиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Болалар учун хавфсиз интернет муҳитини яратиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Интернетдан хавфсиз фойдаланиш борасидаги ижтимоий роликлар ОАВларда мунтазам эълон қилиб борилишини йўлга қўйиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил якунига қадар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 73"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">97-мақсад: Жаҳонда содир бўлаётган мураккаб глобал жараёнларни инобатга олган ҳолда Қуролли Кучларнинг қудрати, мамлакатнинг мудофаа қобилияти ва ҳарбий салоҳиятини янада ошириш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 74"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул </span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">— Мудофаа вазирлиги (Ш. Халмухамедов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 75"><td rowspan="3" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">23.</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Қуролли Кучларини замонавий геоахборот дастурий таъминот воситалари, топогеодезик таъминотнинг махсус техникалари билан таъминлашни давом эттириш, топогеодезик ишларни бажариш ҳамда бу борада кадрлар салоҳиятини ошириб бориш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мудофаа вазирлиги бўлинмаларини зарур топогеодезик ва геоахборот дастурий таъминот воситалари ва махсус техникалар билан босқичма-босқич таъминлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025-2026 йиллар</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлигига ҳар йили ажратиладиган бюджет маблағлари</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 76"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ерни масофадан зондлаш материаллари (космик суратлар) ёрдамида электрон хариталар яратиш ва янгилаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 77"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Соҳа мутахассисларининг замонавий геоахборот ва топогеодезик таъминот бўйича билим ва кўникмаларини ошириб бориш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 78"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">24.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлиги қўшинларида маънавий-маърифий ишлар тизимини ҳамда ахлоқий-руҳий тайёргарлик ва психологик ишларни янада такомиллаштириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мудофаа вазирлиги Маънавият ва маданият департаменти ҳамда республикадаги нуфузли маданият ва санъат муассасалари ўртасида самарали ҳамкорликни йўлга қўйиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Қуролли Кучлар таркибидаги вазирлик ва идоралар билан ҳамкорликда қўшинлардаги ахлоқий-руҳий тайёргарлик ва психологик ишларни янги босқичга кўтариш бўйича ҳамкорликдаги амалий чора-тадбирларни изчил давом эттириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Алоҳида ҳисоб-китобларга асосан Мудофаа вазирлиги ҳамда Қуролли Кучлар таркибига кирувчи вазирлик ва идораларга ҳар йили ажратиладиган бюджет маблағлари, бюджетдан ташқари маблағлар ҳамда қонунчиликда тақиқланмаган бошқа манбалар</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Маданият вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(О. Назарбеков)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 79"><td rowspan="4" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">25.</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Аҳоли ва ёшлар ўртасида ватанпарварлик тарбияси ва тарғиботини янада кучайтириш, Ватан ҳимоячиларини тайёрлаш ва тарбиялаш тизимини ривожлантириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> «Ватан таянчи» отрядлари ўртасида «Ватанпарварлар» ҳарбий-спорт мусобақаларини ўтказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил май</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Алоҳида ҳисоб-китобларга асосан Мудофаа вазирлиги ҳамда Қуролли Кучлар таркибига кирувчи вазирлик ва идораларга ҳар йили ажратиладиган бюджет маблағлари, бюджетдан ташқари маблағлар ҳамда қонун ҳужжатлар билан тақиқланмаган бошқа манбалар,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ҳарбий-маъмурий секторларни ривожлантириш жамғармаси маблағлари</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ёшлар ишлари агентлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(А. Саъдуллаев)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мактабгача ва мактаб таълими вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Х. Умарова)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ҳарбий-маъмурий секторлар раҳбарлари</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 80"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ёшларни ҳарбий-ватанпарварлик руҳида тарбиялаш бўйича тармоқ ва ҳудудий дастурларни ишлаб чиқиш ва амалга ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 81"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3. </span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Умумтаълим ташкилотларида чақирувга қадар бошланғич тайёргарлик фанини ўқув-услубий ва дастурий жиҳатдан такомиллаштириб бориш, фан ўқитувчиларининг фаолиятини янада қўллаб-қувватлаш, шунингдек, белгиланган тартибда босқичма-босқич моддий-техник жиҳатдан таъминлаб бориш ишларини амалга ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 82"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4. </span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ватанни ҳимоя қилишда қаҳрамонларча ҳалок бўлган ўғлонлар ҳаёти ва қаҳрамонликлари ҳақида кўрсатув ва лавҳалар тайёрлаш ҳамда намойиш этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 83"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">26.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлиги тизимида кадрлар билан ишлаш соҳасига замонавий ахборот-коммуникация технологияларини жорий қилиш ишларини давом эттириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мудофаа вазирлиги тизими (марказий аппарат, ҳарбий округ, бирлашма, қўшилма, ҳарбий қисм ва муассасалар)да ягона кадрлар ахборот электрон платформасини яратиш ва ишга тушириш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мудофаа вазирлиги қўшинлари кадр бўлинмаларининг ягона кадрлар ахборот электрон платформасини юритиш бўйича мутахассисларнинг билим ва кўникмаларини ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлигига</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ҳар йили ажратиладиган бюджет маблағлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(К. Шарипов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 84"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">27.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлиги тизимидаги алоҳида батальон ва ундан юқори бўлинмаларнинг истиқболли командир ва бошлиқларининг назарий билим ва профессионал тайёргарлик даражасини босқичма-босқич ошириб бориш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Истиқболли командир ва бошлиқларни маҳаллий (Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президенти ҳузуридаги Давлат бошқаруви академияси, Жаҳон иқтисодиёти ва дипломатия университети ҳузуридаги Дипломатик академия, Стратегик таҳлил ва истиқболни белгилаш олий мактаби ва бошқалар) ҳамда хорижий таълим ва илмий-тадқиқот муассасаларида босқичма-босқич ўқитиш ва малакасини ошириш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Истиқболли командир ва бошлиқларни хорижий тилларни ўргатиш курсларида босқичма-босқич ўқитиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлигига ҳар йили ажратиладиган бюджет маблағлари доирасида</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(К. Шарипов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Б. Саидов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президенти ҳузуридаги Хавфсизлик кенгаши</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 85"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">28.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Илғор хорижий тажрибани инобатга олган ҳолда Мудофаа вазирлиги тизимида истиқболли кадрлар захирасини яратиш тизимини такомиллаштириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Соғлом рақобат тамойили асосида истиқболли кадрлар захирасини шакллантириш бўйича шаффоф тизимни яратиш (идоравий ҳужжат).</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Кадрлар билан ишлаш соҳасига ходимларни бошқариш бўйича (Human Resourse Management ва бошқалар) замонавий тизимларни татбиқ этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлигига ҳар йили ажратиладиган бюджет маблағлари доирасида</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 86"><td rowspan="5" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">29.</span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ҳарбий-тиббий муассасаларнинг инфратузилмаси ва моддий-техник базасини такомиллаштириш, уларни замонавий тиббиёт аппаратуралари ва техникалар билан босқичма-босқич таъминлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Самарқанд ҳарбий госпитали учун бино ва иншоотларни лойиҳалаш, қуриш ҳамда уни замонавий тиббиёт асбоб-ускуна ва жиҳозлари билан таъминлаш ишларини давом эттириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлигига ҳар йили ажратиладиган бюджет маблағлари доирасида, бюджетдан ташқари маблағлар ҳамда қонунчиликда тақиқланмаган бошқа манбалар</span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(И. Норқулов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 87"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мудофаа вазирлиги ҳарбий госпиталларини замонавий МСКТ, МРТ ва ЭхоКГ (ВЕМ тизими) билан белгиланган тартибда таъминлашни давом эттириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 88"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мудофаа вазирлиги ҳарбий госпиталларини 6 дона реанимобиль билан босқичма-босқич таъминлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025-2026 йилларда</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 89"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Эҳтиёждан келиб чиққан ҳолда Мудофаа вазирлиги қўшинларини санитар автомобиллар билан босқичма-босқич таъминлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 — 2027 йиллар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 90"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">5.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мудофаа вазирлигининг шахсий таркибини шахсий ҳимоя воситалари ва тиббий сумкалар билан таъминлашни давом эттириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 91"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">30.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлиги қўшинларини замонавий қурол-аслаҳа, ҳарбий ва махсус техника ҳамда жиҳозлар билан таъминлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1. </span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Қўшинларни замонавий комплекс тренажёрлар билан белгиланган тартибда босқичма-босқич таъминлашни давом эттириш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ўзбекистон Республикаси Мудофаа вазирлиги бўлинмаларини 2022 — 2026 йиллар мобайнида замонавий қурол-аслаҳа, ҳарбий ва махсус техника, бошқа зарур жиҳозлар ва воситалар билан таъминлаш, мавжуд техникаларни таъмирлаш ва модернизация қилиш бўйича комплекс дастурининг ижроси юзасидан 2025 йил учун режалаштирилган товар (иш, хизмат)ларнинг харидини амалга ошириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлигига ажратилган бюджет маблағлари,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлигига ажратиладиган бюджет маблағлари</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Комплекс дастурда 2025 йил учун режалаштирилган пул миқдоридан келиб чиққан ҳолда)</span></em></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">«Ўзтехтрейд» ДУК,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа саноати агентлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(М. Ибодуллаев)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 92"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ҳарбий-маъмурий сектор раҳбарлари</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 93"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">31.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлигининг мудофаа ишлари бошқармалари ва бўлимларининг инфратузилмаси ва ўқув моддий-техника базасини замон талаблари асосида жиҳозлаш, уларни зарур хизмат техникалари билан босқичма-босқич таъминлаш ишларини давом эттириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа ишлари бошқармалари ва бўлимларининг инфратузилмаси (маъмурий, чақирув пунктлари бино ва иншоотлари), ўқув моддий-техника базасини замон талаблари асосида жиҳозлаш ва такомиллаштириш, уларни зарур хизмат техникалари билан таъминлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ҳарбий-маъмурий сектор ҳамда қонун ҳужжатлари билан тақиқланмаган бошқа манбалар</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мудофаа вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Ш. Халмухамедов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 94"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">98-мақсад: Фавқулодда вазиятлар ва глобал иқлим ўзгариши билан боғлиқ аҳоли ҳаётига хавф солувчи офатларнинг олдини олиш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 95"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Фавқулодда вазиятлар вазирлиги (А. Кулдашев)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 96"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">32.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Сендай ҳадли дастурининг асосий мақсадларига эришиш бўйича аниқ тадбирларни белгилаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Барқарор ривожланишни таъминлаш бўйича мамлакатда олиб борилаётган ислоҳотларга мослашишни ҳисобга олган ҳолда юксак самарадорликка эришиш мақсадида Сендай ҳадли дастурини амалга ошириш даврини қуйидаги икки босқичга бўлиш:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1-босқич: 2025-2026 йиллар;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2-босқич: 2027 — 2030 йиллар.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ҳар бир босқичда Сендай ҳадли дастурининг асосий мақсадларига эришиш бўйича аниқ тадбирларни белгилаш бўйича идоравий дастур лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Тегишли босқичларга мўлжалланган тадбирлар режаларида бошқа стратегик ва дастурий ҳужжатлардаги фавқулодда вазиятлардан муҳофаза қилиш соҳасининг турли йўналишлари ва офатлар хавфини камайтириш хусусиятларига оид вазифалар ва тадбирларни бирлаштириш ва инобатга олиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил декабрь</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Республика бюджети маблағлари,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">халқаро молия институтлари ва хорижий ташкилотларнинг грантлари ва кредитлари,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">шунингдек, қонунчиликда тақиқланмаган бошқа манбалар</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(А. Абдухакимов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Ш. Хамраев)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Тоғ-кон саноати ва геология вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Б. Исламов),</span></em></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 97"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">33.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Республика аҳолисининг барча қатламларини шаҳар ва туманлар ҳамда маҳаллалар кесимида зилзиладан олдин, зилзила пайтида ва зилзиладан сўнг ҳаракат қилиш қоидаларига ўргатиш кўрсаткичини (қамраб олиш даражасини) 50 фоизга етказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Қуйидаги тартибда аҳолини зилзилада ҳаракатланишга тайёрлаш ишларини амалга ошириш:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">мактабгача таълим (тарбияланувчилари), умумий ўрта ва ўрта махсус, профессионал (ўқувчилари) ҳамда олий таълим ташкилотларида (талабалари) муаммоли-вазиятли ўйинлар ва машғулотларда, миллий электрон платформа орқали, шунингдек, аҳолини зилзила шароитида ҳаракатланишга тайёрлашга мўлжалланган машғулотлар орқали тайёргарликдан ўтказиш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">республика ва маҳаллий ижро этувчи ҳокимият органлари ҳамда бошқа ташкилотларнинг раҳбарлари ва ходимлари билан йиллик жамлаш режаси асосида, шунингдек, фуқаролар билан ихтиёрий равишда миллий электрон платформа орқали аҳолини зилзилада ҳаракатланишга тайёрлашга мўлжалланган масофавий ўқув курсларини ташкил этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Давлат бюджети, бюджетдан ташқари маблағлар ҳамда ҳомийлик маблағлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Мактабгача ва мактаб таълими вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Х. Умарова)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(К. Шарипов),</span></em></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ўзбекистон кўзи ожизлар жамияти,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ёшлар ишлари агентлиги</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 98"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">34.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Потенциал хавфли объектларга хизмат кўрсатувчи ФВВ ёнғин-қутқарув бўлинмаларининг моддий-техника базасини мустаҳкамлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ФВВ билан шартномалар асосида ташкил этилган ёнғин-қутқарув бўлинмаларидаги хизмат кўрсатиш муддатини ўтаган ва етишмаётган ёнғин-қутқарув техникалари ва асбоб-анжомлари тўғрисида маълумотларни йиғиш ҳамда объектлар раҳбариятига ва (ёки) уларнинг юқори турувчи ташкилотларига ёнғин-қутқарув техника ҳамда асбоб-анжомлар билан таъминлаш бўйича маълумотнома ва ахборот хатларини киритиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ФВВ ёнғин-қутқарув бўлинмалари хизмат кўрсатадиган объектлар маблағлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Фавқулодда вазиятлар вазирлиги ёнғин-қутқарув бўлинмалари томонидан хизмат кўрсатиладиган объектлари мавжуд вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 99"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">35.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ЎзМТРКнинг «Ўзбекистон» ҳамда барча ҳудудий телеканалларида «<strong>Фавқулодда 20 дақиқа</strong>» (шартли ном) номли ҳафтада бир маротаба даврий эфирга узатиладиган кўрсатувни ташкил этиш. </span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> «Фавқулодда 20 дақиқа» (шартли ном) номли ҳафтада бир маротаба даврий эфирга узатиладиган кўрсатувни ташкил этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил ноябрь</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Давлат бюджетидан ажратилган маблағлар</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ўзбекистон Миллий телерадиокомпанияси</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 100"><td rowspan="3" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">36.</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Фавқулодда вазиятлар вазирлигида қутқарувчиларнинг малакасини ошириш фаолиятини тубдан ислоҳ қилиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Вазирлар Маҳкамаси қарори лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил июнь</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Давлат бюджетидан ажратилган маблағлар</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(К. Шарипов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 101"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;l