ноябрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 103"><td rowspan="3" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">37.</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Тошкент, Наманган, Самарқанд, Жиззах, Бухоро, Хоразм вилоятлари ҳудудидаги баланд қаватли бино ва иншоотларга видеокузатув қурилмаларини ўрнатиш орқали атроф-муҳитни кузатиш ва ёнғинларни барвақт аниқлаш тизимини жорий этиш. </span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Видеокузатув тизимини яратиш учун лойиҳанинг техник топшириқ ҳужжатларини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил март</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Давлат бюджетидан ажратилган маблағлар</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Маҳаллий ҳокимликлар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 104"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Видеокузатув тизими ва унинг техник дастурий таъминотини харид қилиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил июль</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 105"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Видеокузатув тизими ускуналарини белгиланган жойларга ўрнатиш ва тизимни жорий этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил ноябрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 106"><td rowspan="3" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">38.</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Тошкент, Жиззах, Фарғона, Наманган вилоятлари ва «Қамчиқ» МҚЁҚБга ГАТ технологиялари ва учувчисиз учиш аппаратидан фойдаланган ҳолда республика бўйича етиб бориш имконияти чекланган ҳудудларни кузатиш, мониторинг ва таҳлил қилиш ҳамда огоҳлантириш имкониятини берувчи кўп функцияли мониторинг мобиль комплексларини жорий этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Кўп функцияли мониторинг мобиль комплексларини тасдиқланган техник талаблар асосида харид қилиш учун танлов (тендер) савдоларини ўтказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил август</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Давлат бюджетидан ажратилган маблағлар</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 107"><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Кўп функцияли мониторинг мобиль комплекс қурилмаларини ўрнатилган тартибда харид қилиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил октябрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 108"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Кўп функцияли мониторинг мобиль комплексларини амалиётга татбиқ этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил декабрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 109"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">99-мақсад: Чегаралар хавфсизлигини мустаҳкамлаш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 110"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — ДХХ Чегара қўшинлари (С. Хусанов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 111"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">39.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Давлат чегараси дахлсизлигини таъминлаш, уни қўриқлаш ва ҳимоя қилиш тизимини мустаҳкамлаш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президенти ва Ҳукумат қарорларида Давлат чегараси дахлсизлигини таъминлаш, уни қўриқлаш ва ҳимоя қилиш тизимини мустаҳкамлашга оид вазифаларнинг ижросини масъул вазирлик ва идоралар ҳамда маҳаллий давлат ҳокимияти органлари билан биргаликда амалга оширишни давом эттириш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил давомида</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Алоҳида ишлаб чиқилган қарорлар билан белгиланади</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(Ш. Шерматов)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">маҳаллий давлат ҳокимияти органлари</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 112"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">100-мақсад: Жамиятда миллатлараро тотувлик муҳитини мустаҳкамлаш ва хорижий мамлакатлар билан дўстлик алоқаларини ривожлантириш</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 113"><td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> — Миллатлараро муносабатлар қўмитаси (Р. Курбанов)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 114"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"