top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Маданият вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(О. Назарбеков)</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 115"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мақолалар эълон қилинадиган ОАВларни белгилаш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Мақолаларни тайёрлаш ва эълон қилиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил декабрь</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 116"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">41.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">30 июль — Халқлар дўстлиги куни муносабати билан «Дўстлик» фестивалини ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ишчи гуруҳни шакллантириш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Ишчи гуруҳнинг ташкилий йиғилишини ўтказиш.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3. </span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">30 июль — Халқлар дўстлиги куни муносабати билан «Дўстлик» фестивалини ўтказиш бўйича Вазирлар Маҳкамаси фармойиши лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш ва Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш. </span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border: none;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил июнь</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг захира маблағлари</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Маданият вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(О. Назарбеков)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 117"><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4.</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> 30 июль — Халқлар дўстлиги куни муносабати билан «Дўстлик» ҳафталигини ўтказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил 30 июль</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 118;mso-yfti-lastrow: yes"><td style="width: 3.66%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">42.</span></p></td><td style="width: 19.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="19%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">16 ноябрь — Халқаро бағрикенглик кунига бағишлаб республиканинг барча ҳудудларида «Бағрикенглик ҳафталиги»ни ўтказиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 28.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="28%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-indent: 15.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">16 ноябрь — Халқаро бағрикенглик кунига бағишлаб республиканинг барча ҳудудларида «Бағрикенглик ҳафталиги»ни ўтказиш билан боғлиқ барча ташкилий масалаларни ҳал этиш.</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.3%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2025 йил октябрь</span></p></td><td style="width: 14.56%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="14%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг захира маблағлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 18.82%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;padding: 0cm 4.3pt 0cm 4.3pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Дин ишлари бўйича қўмита</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(С. Тошбоев)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Маданият вазирлиги</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">(О. Назарбеков)</span></em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">,</span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7938918" id="7938918">Изоҳ: Дастурда назарда тутилган тадбирларнинг амалга оширилиши жараёнида уларнинг молиялаштириш манбаларига ҳамда тадбирларни амалга ошириш муддатларига «Ўзбекистон — 2030» <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/6600413#6605157">стратегиясини</a> амалга ошириш бўйича Республика комиссияси раиси — Бош вазир томонидан ўзгартиришлар киритилиши мумкин.</div></div><div class="CHANGES_ORIGINS"><label id="s1104"></label><div name="7938919" id="7938919">(13-илова Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 18 декабрдаги ПФ-255-сонли Фармони таҳририда)</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372112" id="7372112"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372113" id="7372113">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />14-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372344" id="7372344">«Ўзбекистон — 2030» стратегиясининг «Хавфсиз ва тинчликсевар давлат» тамойилига асосланган сиёсатни изчил давом эттириш йўналиши бўйича 2025 йилда ишлаб чиқиладиган норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжатлар лойиҳалари</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372345" id="7372345">РЎЙХАТИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372346" id="7372346"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="7372347" id="7372347"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Т/р</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:23%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:40%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасида назарда тутилган тадбирлар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро муддати</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Масъул ижрочилар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">V. «ХАВФСИЗ ВА ТИНЧЛИКСЕВАР ДАВЛАТ» ТАМОЙИЛИГА АСОСЛАНГАН СИЁСАТНИ ИЗЧИЛ ДАВОМ ЭТТИРИШ</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>90-мақсад: Янги Ўзбекистон ташқи сиёсатини халқ ва давлатнинг манфаатларидан келиб чиққан ҳолда изчил амалга ошириш</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><i>Ижро учун асосий масъул</i></b><i> — Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги (Б. Саидов)</i></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol><li align="center" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:23%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«<b>Дипломатик хизмат тўғрисида»</b>ги қонун лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:40%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қонун лойиҳасида:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">дипломатик хизмат тушунчаси ва турлари, дипломатик хизмат вазифаси ва функциялари, ходимларнинг ҳуқуқ ва мажбуриятлари;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">дипломатик хизматга қабул қилиш, ротация тартиби ва дипломатик хизмат ходимларининг узоқ муддатли сафарда бўлиш муддатлари;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">дипломатик хизмат ходимларини касбий тайёрлаш ва уларнинг малакасини ошириш тартиби, ходимлар фаолиятининг самарадорлигини баҳолаш механизмлари;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">дипломатик хизмат кўрсатувчи шахслар мақоми, хорижий ҳамкорлар билан ишлаш механизми;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">дипломатик хизмат органларини молиявий ва моддий-техник таъминлаш механизмлари, ходимларни моддий рағбатлантириш ва уларнинг ижтимоий таъминоти назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Ташкулов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Л. Кудратов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Камбағалликни қисқартириш ва бандлик вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б. Захидов),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><strong>96-мақсад: Фуқароларнинг ахборотни эркин излаш, олиш ва тарқатишга доир ҳуқуқларини амалга ошириш кафолатларини янада кучайтириш</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Ахборот ва оммавий коммуникациялар агентлиги (А. Ходжаев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="2"><li align="center" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:23%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Миллий ахборот майдонида қонунчиликка риоя этилишини таъминлаш, ахборотдан фойдаланиш маданиятини юксалтириш ҳамда аҳолини деструктив маълумотлар таъсиридан ҳимоя қилишда фуқаролик жамияти институтларини жалб қилишни кенгайтириш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳаси. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:40%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада интернет тармоғидаги жиноятларни аниқлаш ва уларнинг олдини олишда жамоатчилик назоратини амалга оширишнинг самарали инструменти назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(П. Бобожонов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">97-мақсад: Жаҳонда содир бўлаётган мураккаб глобал жараёнларни инобатга олган ҳолда Қуролли Кучларнинг қудрати, мамлакатнинг мудофаа қобилияти ва ҳарбий салоҳиятини янада ошириш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Мудофаа вазирлиги (Ш. Халмухаммедов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="3"><li align="center" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:23%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йилда ҳарбий йиғинларни ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш тўғрисида»ги Президент қарори лойиҳаси.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:40%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада Ўзбекистон Республикаси Қуролли Кучлари резервидаги ҳарбий хизматга мажбурлар билан 2025 йилда ҳарбий йиғинларни ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш чора-тадбирлари назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Хайдаров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="4"><li align="center" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:23%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг 2019 йил 9 апрелдаги «Чақирилувчиларни танлаб олиш тартиби тўғрисидаги низомни тасдиқлаш ҳақида»ги 291-сон қарорига ўзгартириш ва қўшимчалар киритиш бўйича <b>Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг қарори лойиҳаси.</b></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:40%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Электрон ҳукумат» тизимининг Идоралараро интеграллашув платформаси ва Мудофаа вазирлиги «Автоматлаштирилган ахборот тизими ва маълумотлар базаси»нинг «Чақирув» тизим ости дастури билан интеграция қилиш орқали энг илғор, ватанпарвар ёшларни муддатли ҳарбий хизматга тавсия этиш бўйича шаффоф ва холис тизим яратиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Қуролли Кучлари сафига муддатли ҳарбий хизматга чақириш учун ҳар томонлама етук, соғлом, жисмонан бақувват, интеллектуал салоҳиятли чақирилувчиларни ўрганиш ва танлаб олишда мудофаа ишлари органлари ва маҳалла фаолларининг вазифалари назарда тутилади. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон маҳаллалари уюшмаси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Қ. Қуронбоев),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ёшлар ишлари агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Саъдуллаев),</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Хайдаров)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">98-мақсад: Фавқулодда вазиятлар ва глобал иқлим ўзгариши билан боғлиқ аҳоли ҳаётига хавф солувчи офатларнинг олдини олиш</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул</span></span></i></b><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — Фавқулодда вазиятлар вазирлиги (А. Кулдашев)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><ol start="5"><li align="center" style="text-align:center"></li></ol></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:23%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг айрим қарорларига инновацион ёнғин ўчириш воситаларини жорий этишга қаратилган ўзгартириш ва қўшимчалар киритиш бўйича <b>Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг қарори лойиҳаси.</b></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:40%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">бино-иншоотлар ва транспорт воситаларининг хавфсизлигини таъминлашда инновацион ёнғин ўчириш воситаларини, шу жумладан ўт ўчириш аэрозоли генераторини жорий этиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.4pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">инновацион ёнғин ўчириш воситалари билан бино-иншоотлар ва транспорт воситаларини жиҳозлаш меъёрларини белгилаш назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:20%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(П. Бобожонов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ш. Хидоятов)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Транспорт вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(И. Махкамов)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372348" id="7372348">Изоҳлар:</div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372349" id="7372349">Дастурда назарда тутилган тадбирларни амалга ошириш учун қабул қилинадиган ҳужжатлар шакли заруратга қараб ўзгартирилиши, бошқа бандлардаги ҳужжатлар билан бирлаштирилиши ёки бир неча турдаги ҳужжатларга бўлиниши мумкин.</div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372350" id="7372350">Норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжатлар лойиҳаларини ишлаб чиқиш жараёнида мутасадди вазирлик ва идораларнинг таклифлари асосида Дастурда белгиланган тадбирларнинг мазмунига мос келадиган бошқа масалалар ҳам назарда тутилади.</div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7372351" id="7372351">Дастурда назарда тутилган тадбирларнинг амалга оширилиши жараёнида уларнинг молиялаштириш манбаларига ҳамда тадбирларни амалга ошириш муддатларига ўзгартиришлар «Ўзбекистон — 2030» <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/6600413#6605157">стратегиясини</a> амалга ошириш бўйича Республика комиссияси раиси — Бош вазир томонидан киритилиши мумкин.</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372115" id="7372115"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372117" id="7372117">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />15-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372352" id="7372352">«Ўзбекистон — 2030» стратегиясининг «Хавфсиз ва тинчликсевар давлат» тамойилига асосланган сиёсатни изчил давом эттириш йўналиши бўйича 2025 йилга мўлжалланган</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372353" id="7372353">МАҚСАДЛИ КЎРСАТКИЧЛАР</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8050551" id="8050551"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8050554" id="8050554"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Т/р</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:38%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Мақсадли кўрсаткичлар</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Ўлчов бирлиги</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>2025</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>I чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>II чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>III чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>IV чорак</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:16%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>Масъуллар</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>5.1. Очиқ, прагматик ва фаол ташқи сиёсат олиб бориш бўйича ислоҳотлар</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>90-мақсад: Янги Ўзбекистон ташқи сиёсатини халқ ва давлатнинг манфаатларидан келиб чиққан ҳолда изчил амалга ошириш</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:38%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>Мақсадли кўрсаткичлар алоҳида қарорлар асосида белгиланади</i></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="f