ваколатхона (вакиллик)ларини очиш орқали меҳнат мигрантларига кўрсатилаётган ҳуқуқий ва моддий ёрдамлар кўламини ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">та</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>1.2. Мамлакатимиз хавфсизлиги ва мудофаа салоҳиятини кучайтириш бўйича ислоҳотлар</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>96-мақсад: Фуқароларнинг ахборотни эркин излаш, олиш ва тарқатишга доир ҳуқуқларини амалга ошириш кафолатларини янада кучайтириш</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">13.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:38%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>Мақсадли кўрсаткичлар алоҳида қарорлар асосида белгиланади</i></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:16%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ЎзМТРК</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>97-мақсад: Жаҳонда содир бўлаётган мураккаб глобал жараёнларни инобатга олган ҳолда Қуролли Кучларнинг қудрати, мамлакатнинг мудофаа қобилияти ва ҳарбий салоҳиятини янада ошириш</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:38%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i>Мақсадли кўрсаткичлар алоҳида қарорлар асосида белгиланади</i></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding