center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">21.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:38%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.3pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Биродарлашган шаҳарлар сони.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:10%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">та</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>73</b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:5%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">73</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="8050556" id="8050556">Изоҳ. Чораклар кесимидаги мақсадли кўрсаткичларга асосий масъул ташкилот раҳбарининг асослантирилган таклифи асосида «Ўзбекистон — 2030» <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/6600413#6605157">стратегиясини</a> амалга ошириш бўйича Республика комиссияси раиси — Бош вазир томонидан ўзгартиришлар (белгиланган йиллик мақсадли кўрсаткичлар доирасида) киритилиши мумкин.</div></div><div class="CHANGES_ORIGINS"><label id="s1104"></label><div name="8050558" id="8050558">(15-илова Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг  2026 йил 5 февралдаги ПФ-19-сонли <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/8037353?ONDATE=07.02.2026 00#8043934">Фармони </a>таҳририда — Қонунчилик маълумотлари миллий базаси, 07.02.2026 й., 06/26/19/0118-сон)</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372118" id="7372118"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372120" id="7372120">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />16-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372359" id="7372359"><strong>2025 йилда атроф-муҳитни асраш йўналишида вазирлик ва идоралар томонидан биринчи навбатда амалга оширилиши зарур бўлган</strong></div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372361" id="7372361">ЧОРА-ТАДБИРЛАР РЕЖАСИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372362" id="7372362"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7709800" id="7709800"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7709801" id="7709801"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Т/р</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Вазифалар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Амалий чора-тадбирлар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро муддати</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Молиялаштириш манбалари</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳамижрочилар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Оқова сувларни тозалаш самарадорлигини ошириш мақсадида 32 та йирик шаҳарлардаги оқова сув тозалаш иншоотларида автоматик равишда намуналар олиш тизимини жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Автоматик мониторинг қурилмалари бўйича техник топшириқ ишлаб чиқиш ва харид қилиш учун шартнома имзолаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Автоматик мониторинг станциясини харид қилиш ва ўрнатиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Юқори самарадорликка эга локал сув тозалаш иншоотларини ўрнатиш ҳамда мавжудларини модернизация қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бюджетдан ажратилган маблағлар,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ҳомийлик ва грант маблағлари,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">бошқа манбалар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзсувтаъминот» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Нотурар бино-иншоотларда энергия самарадорлиги бўйича мажбурий сертификатлаш тизимини жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Халқаро миқёсда тан олинган кўрсаткичларга мувофиқ нотурар биноларда энергия самарадорлигини сертификатлашни такомиллаштириш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхоналар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзэнергоинспекция,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Нотурар бинолар учун энергия самарадорлиги сертификатларини берадиган энергия аудиторларини аккредитация қилиш тартибини ишлаб чиқиш ва тасдиқлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Нотурар биноларда энергия самарадорлиги сертификатларини босқичма-босқич мажбурий этиб белгилаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2026 йил январь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Янги қурилган тураржой ва нотурар бино ва иншоотларда минимал энергия сарфини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Халқаро амалиётда синовдан ўтган ва халқаро миқёсда тан олинган кўрсаткичларга мувофиқ биноларнинг энергия самарадорлигининг минимал мезонларини ҳисоблашнинг янги методологиясини ишлаб чиқиш ва жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхоналарнинг ўз маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Энергетика вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзэнергоинспекция,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Бинолар энергия самарадорлигининг минимал мезонларини ҳисоблаш методологиясига мувофиқ кВт/м² комплекс кўрсаткичини ҳисоблайдиган дастурий таъминотни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Лойиҳани ишлаб чиқиш ва биноларни фойдаланишга топшириш жараёнида барча янги ва капитал таъмирланган бинолар учун энергия самарадорлигининг минимал мезонларига мослигини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2026 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳайвонларнинг ўта хавфли ва бошқа юқумли касалликларининг тарқалишини ҳамда бошқа ҳайвонларга ва одамга ўтишини олдини олиш мақсадида нобуд бўлган ва отиб ташланган уй ва ёввойи ҳайвонларнинг жасадларини йўқ қилиш учун крематорий ва биотермик (Bekkeri) ўраларни қуриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳар бир туман (шаҳар)да крематорий ва биотермик ўраларни қуриш учун белгиланган тартибда ер участкаларини ажратиш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="layout-grid-mode:char"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, <span class="clausesuff1" style="display:none">вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри</span> ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="layout-grid-mode:char"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ветеринария ва чорвачиликни ривожлантириш қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Танланган намунавий лойиҳа асосида</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> ҳайвонларнинг жасадларини йўқ қилиш учун крематорий ва биотермик ўраларни қуриш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳайвонларнинг жасадларини йўқ қилиш учун қуриб битказилган крематорий ва биотермик ўраларни туман (шаҳар) ободонлаштириш бошқармалари ҳузуридаги қаровсиз қолган ҳайвонларни тутиш бўлимларига топшириш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="layout-grid-mode:char"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="layout-grid-mode:char"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ветеринария ва чорвачиликни ривожлантириш қўмитаси,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="layout-grid-mode:char"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Санитария-эпидемиологик осойишталик ва жамоат саломатлиги қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалигида ер ресурсларининг мониторингини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Қишлоқ хўжалиги ерларининг (шўрланиш, гумус миқдорининг ўзгариши ҳолатлари) мониторингини юритиш. Олдинги ва ҳозирги тупроқ унумдорлиги тўғрисидаги маълумотларни Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлигининг ягона геоахборот тизимига киритиш орқали салбий ўзгаришларни ўз вақтида аниқлаш. Аниқланган тупроқдаги салбий ҳолатларда (шўрланиш, эрозия, гумус, азот миқдорини камайиши ва б.) тупроқ унумдорлигини тиклаш, сақлаш ва ошириш бўйича тегишли ҳокимликлар билан биргаликда чора-тадбирлар режасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон фермер, деҳқон хўжаликлари ва томорқа ер эгалари кенгаши,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Қишлоқ хўжалиги ер майдонларининг оғир металлар ва пестицидлар билан ифлосланишини мониторинг қилиш, тупроқнинг унумдор қатламини сақлаб қолиш тадбирларини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йилдан бошлаб</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">6.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ер ресурсларининг деградация суръатларини камайтириш бўйича олдини олувчи чоралар ишлаб чиқиш ва амалга ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Дарёларнинг сувини муҳофаза қилиш ва соҳил бўйи минтақаларида қирғоқни мустаҳкамловчи ўрмонлар ва иҳота дарахтзорларни барпо этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ ва ўрмон хўжалиги ҳудудларида тупроқ деградацияси жараёнларининг суръатларини пасайтириш бўйича тадбирларни амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025-2026 йиллар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижрочиларнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўрмон хўжалиги агентлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тупроқ деградациясига қарши курашиш, олдини олиш, деградацияга мойил тупроқда экинларни алмашлаб экиш, лалми ерларнинг тупроқ деградациясини олдини олиш бўйича илмий асосланган тавсиялар ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Яйловлардан самарали фойдаланиш бўйича норматив ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш. Яйловларнинг босқичма-босқич тўлиқ хатловдан ўтказилишини ҳамда электрон хариталари ишлаб чиқилишини ва электрон ҳисоби юритилишини таъминлаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Яйлов ерларидан самарали фойдаланиш, жумладан, илғор хорижий тажриба асосида яйловлар тушунчаси ва унинг ҳуқуқий мақомини қайта кўриб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Яйловлар деградациясининг олдини олиш, яйловларни барпо этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Яйлов ерларини жисмоний ва юридик шахсларга фойдаланишга, ижарага бериш ва бошқа қоидаларни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Яйловларнинг ҳар бир контур ва фойдаланувчи кесимида электрон хариталарни яратиш ва Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлигининг ягона геоахборот тизимига киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўрмон хўжалиги агентлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Хатлов натижаларига кўра, захирадаги бўш турган ер участкаларини очиқ электрон танловлар асосида ижарага бериш орқали республика бўйича яйловлардан субъектлар кесимида (фермер, деҳқон хўжалиги ва бошқалар) фойдаланилишини босқичма-босқич таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">6.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Деградацияга учраган яйловларни қайта тиклаш ва уларнинг маҳсулдорлигини ошириш мақсадида истиқболли озуқабоп яйлов ўсимликларининг бирламчи уруғчилик майдонларини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 — 2028 йиллар давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">8.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалигида иқлим ўзгариши оқибатларига мослаштириш халқаро илмий марказини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Жанубий деҳқончилик илмий-тадқиқот институтида «Икарда» ҳамда БМТнинг Озиқ-овқат ва қишлоқ хўжалиги ташкилоти (ФАО) билан биргаликда Қишлоқ хўжалигида иқлим ўзгариши оқибатларига мослаштириш халқаро илмий марказини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">10.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сув ресурсларидан оқилона фойдаланиш бўйича чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Қишлоқ хўжалигида фойдаланиладиган сувларни ҳисобга олиш ва мониторинг қилиш тизимини такомиллаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Сув тежовчи технологияларини жорий қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тупроқ қопламали каналларни бетон қопламага ўтказиш ҳамда ёпиқ қувурли суғориш тармоқларини реконструкция қилиш орқали ирригация тизими ва суғориш тармоқларининг фойдали иш коэффициенти кўрсаткичини 0,68 гача етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижрочиларнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги, Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">11.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Коллектор-дренаж тармоқларидаги сувлари сифатининг мониторингини олиб бориш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мониторингнинг йиллик дастурини ишлаб чиқиш ва тасдиқлаш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижрочиларнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Дала тадқиқотларини ташкил этиш ва коллектор-дренаж тармоқлари сувидан намуналар олиш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март — ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Намуналарни таҳлил қилиш ва олинган натижаларни баҳолаш, мелиоратив кадастрни ишлаб чиқиш</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2026 йил январь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Маҳаллий давлат ҳокимияти органларига, манфаатдор вазирлик ва идораларга маълумотларни белгиланган тартибда тақдим этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Доимий</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">12.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:83.0pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Анъанавий энергия хариди нархига нисбатан юқори нархларни назарда тутувчи «яшил тариф»ларни жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:83.0pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қуйидагиларга анъанавий энергия хариди нархига нисбатан юқори нархларни назарда тутувчи «яшил тариф»ларни жорий этиш:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:83.0pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">юридик шахсларнинг шамол ва қуёш манбаларидан ишлаб чиқариладиган электр энергияси;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:83.0pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">юридик шахсларнинг чиқиндини термик утилизация қилиш ва биогазни ёқиш орқали ишлаб чиқариладиган электр энергияси;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">аҳолининг шамол ва қуёш манбаларидан олинган ва фойдаланишда ўз эҳтиёжидан орттириб, давлатга сотадиган электр энергияси.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="a2" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:13pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил октябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Энергетика вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">13.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат харидларида «яшил харидлар»нинг улушини доимий ошириб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Яшил харидлар» улушини ошириш ва ривожлантириш юзасидан қуйидагиларни назарда тутувчи норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">атроф-муҳитга таъсири кам бўлган, экологик тоза ёки иккиламчи хомашё ва чиқиндилардан тайёрланган товарлар ишлаб чиқарувчиларига қулайликлар яратиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">товарлар ишлаб чиқарувчилар экотизимини жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тадбиркорлик субъектларининг давлат харидлари жараёнидаги фаолиятини инобатга олган ҳолда баҳолашнинг скоринг тизимини жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Соҳага сунъий интеллектни жорий этиш орқали барқарор, шунингдек, «яшил харидлар»ни янада ривожлантириш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">давлат харидларида «яшил харид» мезонларини белгилаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">давлат харидларини амалга оширишда экологик муҳитнинг яхшиланишига кўмаклашадиган ёки атроф-муҳитга салбий таъсирни камайтиришга қаратилган (энергия тежовчи маҳсулотларни харид қилиш, товарларнинг ҳаётийлик даври мезонларидан фойдаланиш ва бошқа) чора-тадбирларни назарда тутиш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">электрон харид ҳужжатларига мувофиқ таклифларни баҳолашда харид комиссияларининг фаолиятини босқичма-босқич қисқартиришни белгилаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Яшил харидлар»ни амалга ошириш бўйича давлат харидлари субъектларининг билим ва малакаларини ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Яшил харидлар» бўйича қўлланмалар, методик материаллар ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳар бир ҳудудда «яшил» давлат харидларини жорий этиш бўйича ўқув тренерларини тайёрлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳудудларда ўқув курсларини ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025-2026 йиллар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">16.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экологик тоза технологиялар ва инновацион ечимларни қўллаш орқали ишлаб чиқарувчиларнинг давлат харидларидаги иштирокини янада қўллаб-қувватлаш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Лойиҳада:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">давлат харидларида ишлаб чиқарувчиларнинг «яшил технологиялар»дан фойдаланишини рағбатлантириш ва уларнинг иштирокини қўллаб-қувватлаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">давлат харидларидаги иштироки вақтинчалик тақиқланган ва чегараланган импорт товарлар, шунингдек, хорижий шахслар томонидан бажариладиган ишлар (хизматлар) рўйхатини кенгайтиришни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" class="CxSpMiddle" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Транспорт вазирлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">17.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Автотранспорт корхоналари, автовокзаллар, автобекатларнинг транспорт воситалари ҳаракати ва юк ортиш-тушириш ишларини амалга ошириш корхоналарида автомобилларни ювиш шохобчаси фаолиятини янада такомиллаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Автомобилларни ювиш шохобчасида ҳосил бўладиган ишлаб чиқариш оқова сувларини зарарли кимёвий қўшимчалар, нефть ва мой аралашмаларидан тозаланиши учун самарадорлиги 99,5 фоиздан кам бўлмаган маҳаллий тозалаш иншоотини ўрнатиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ер ости сув захираларини нефть маҳсулотидан ифлосланишига йўл қўймаслик учун автомобилларни ювиш майдончаси, автомобиль турар жойи, кириш-чиқиш йўлларининг ер майдонини махсус бетон тўшама билан қоплаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ишлаб чиқариш оқова сувлари маҳаллий тозалаш иншоотида (махсус фильтр) тозалангандан кейин автомобилларни ювиш учун қайта ишлатилиши мақсадида айланма сув таъминоти тизимини ўрнатиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025-2026 йиллар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхоналарнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Автотранспорт корхоналари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзсувтаъминот» АЖ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">18.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республиканинг йирик шаҳарларида тирбандликларнинг олдини олиш ва транспорт воситаларининг атмосфера ҳавосига салбий таъсирини камайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ақлли бошқарув» тизимини йўлга қўйиш, бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">таълим муассасаларида ўқиш вақтларини мақбуллаштириш ҳисобига тиғиз вақтларда транспортга бўлган юкламани камайтириш;</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тиғиз вақтларда катта ҳажмли ва оғир вазнли юк автомобилларининг ҳаракатланишини чеклаш ёки тартибга солиш;</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">транспорт оқими юқори бўлган чорраҳаларда светофорлар фазаларини қайта кўриб чиқиш;</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">чорраҳа ва кесишмаларда мувофиқлаштирилган светофор бошқарувини «ақлли светофорлар» тизимига ўтказиш;</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">шаҳарларга кирувчи асосий автомобиль йўлларида вазн ва габарит назорати бўйича стационар шохобчаларни ташкил этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхоналарнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">хўжалик юритувчи субъектлар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Энергетика вазирлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">19.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Энергетика соҳасида сув таъминотининг айланма тизимини кенг жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сув таъминотининг айланма тизимини кенг жорий этишни таъминлаш ва унинг умумий сув истеъмолидаги улушини 30 фоизга етказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхоналарнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">хўжалик юритувчи субъектлар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">20.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Газ конларида метан газининг сизиб чиқишини олдини олиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Газ конларида метан газининг сизиб чиқишини аниқлашда ЛДАР (Леак Детестион анд Репаир) технологияларини жорий этиш, бунда:</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">газ конларида метан сизиб чиқишини масофадан зондлаш ва учувчисиз учиш аппаратларига асосланган замонавий таҳлилий тизимлар орқали аниқлаш;</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">аниқланган сизиш жойларини зудлик билан таъмирлаш амалиётини жорий қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхоналарнинг маблағлари ҳамда хорижий грантлар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекнефтгаз» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">21.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Атмосфера ҳавосига салбий таъсир кўрсатувчи кўмир ва мазут ёқилғисида фаолият олиб борувчи иссиқлик ва электр энергия ишлаб чиқариш корхоналарини чанг-газ тозалаш ускуналари билан жиҳозлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Кўмир ва мазут ёқилғисида фаолият олиб борувчи иссиқлик ва электр энергиясини ишлаб чиқариш корхоналарининг устувор турғун манбаларини чанг-газ тозалаш ускуналари билан жиҳозлаш бўйича 2025 — 2028 йилларга</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> мўлжалланган дастурни ишлаб чиқиш ва Вазирлар Маҳкамасида тасдиқлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тасдиқланган дастур асосида биринчи навбатда республиканинг йирик шаҳарларига яқин бўлган </span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">иссиқлик ва электр энергияси ишлаб чиқариш корхоналарини чанг-газ тозалаш ускуналари билан жиҳозлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> — 2028 йиллар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Амалга оширилган ишлар бўйича Вазирлар Маҳкамаси ва Экология вазирлигига ҳар чоракда маълумот тақдим этиб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳар чоракда</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Саноат, радиация ва ядро хавфсизлиги қўмитаси</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">22.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Уран конлари чиқиндилари жойлашган ҳудудларни ер усти ва ер ости сувларида радионуклидлар ва токсик металлар миқдорини мониторинг қилиш<s> </s>тизимини жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Чотқол-Қурама ҳудудидаги ва Зарафшон дарёси водийсидаги уран конлари чиқиндилари жойлашган ҳудудларда ҳар чоракда радионуклидлар ва токсик металлар миқдорини мониторинг қилиш амалиётини жорий этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил мартдан бошлаб</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тоғ-кон саноати ва геология вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Санитария-эпидемиологик осойишталик ва жамоат саломатлиги қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Мониторинг натижаларини ҳар чорак якуни билан Вазирлар Маҳкамаси ва Экология вазирлигига киритиб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давомий</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тоғ-кон саноати ва геология вазирлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">23.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фойдали қазилмаларни қазиб олиш натижасида бузилган ер майдонларини рекультивация қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2 075</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> гектар</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> бузилган ер майдонининг рекультивация қилинишини таъминлаш, мазкур соҳада экологик назорат тадбирларини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхоналарнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">24.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ер ости сувлари ифлосланишининг олдини олиш ва уларни муҳофаза қилиш, улардан фойдаланиш назоратини ҳамда мониторингини кучайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ер ости сув сатҳи пасайиб бораётган ҳудудлардаги кузатув қудуқларида ўлчов ишларини олиб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Сув сатҳи <b>5 — 20 метрга</b> пасайган ҳудудларда ичимлик мақсадларидан бошқа мақсадлар учун қудуқлар бурғиланишини, сув тежовчи технологияларсиз ерлар суғорилишини олдини олиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекгидрогеология» ДМ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Тоғ-кон саноати ва геология соҳасини назорат қилиш инспекцияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон фермер, деҳқон хўжаликлари ва томорқа ер эгалари кенгаши,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимлари</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">25.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республиканинг тоғ ва тоғ олди ҳудудларида фаол геологик жараёнлар намоён бўладиган минтақаларда жойлашган объектларда хавфли экзоген геологик жараёнлар (кўчки, ёрилиш, ўпирилиш, ювилиш, силжиб тушиш, тош кўчишнинг ҳосил бўлиши) юзасидан мониторинг тизимини тизимли асосда юритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республиканинг тоғ ва тоғ олди ҳудудлари чегарасида дала тадқиқот ишларини ташкил қилиш ва хавфли геологик жараёнлар юзасидан юқори тайёргарлик усулида (февраль-июнь, ноябрь-декабрь) ва кунлик фаолиятни (йилнинг қолган даврида) режимли кузатувни йўлга қўйиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхоналарнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекгидрогеология» ДМ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Хавфли геологик жараёнлар ривожланиши эҳтимоли бўлган ҳудудларни аниқлаш ҳамда манфаатдор вазирлик ва идораларни хабардор қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Доимий</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Хавфли геологик жараёнлар ривожланишининг олдини олиш бўйича тавсиялар ишлаб чиқиш ва аҳолини ҳимоя қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Доимий</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">26.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ер ости сувларининг ҳолатига салбий таъсир кўрсатаётган фойдаланилмаётган, эгасиз, ноқонуний қазилган ер ости сув қудуқларини ёпиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республикада фойдаланилмаётган, эгасиз, ноқонуний қазилган ер ости сув қудуқларини хатловдан ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекгидрогеология» ДМ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бош прокуратура,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон фермер, деҳқон хўжаликлари ва томорқа ер эгалари кенгаши</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хатлов натижаларига кўра фойдаланилмаётган, эгасиз, ноқонуний қазилган ер ости сув қудуқларини ёпиш (тампонаж) қилиш бўйича дастур ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Тампонаж ишларини бошлаш ва ҳар чоракда ёпилган қудуқлар бўйича маълумотларни Вазирлар Маҳкамаси ва Экология вазирлигига киритиб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июлдан бошлаб</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">27.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Чучук ер ости сувларидан ҳосил бўладиган зоналарни қайта ўрганиб чиқиш ва уларга муҳофаза қилинадиган табиий ҳудудлар мақомини бериш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Чучук ер ости сувлари зоналари доирасида чучук ер ости сувлари ресурсларидан оқилона фойдаланиш ва уларни ифлосланишдан муҳофаза қилиш бўйича хатловдан ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хатлов натижаларидан келиб чиққан ҳолда потенциал экологик хавфли объектларни аниқлаш ва чучук ер ости сувларини ифлослантириш ва қуритиб қўйишнинг олдини олишга доир чора-тадбирларни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ўзбекгидрогеология» ДМ,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон фермер, деҳқон хўжаликлари ва томорқа ер эгалари кенгаши,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">28.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«НКМК» АЖнинг атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иссиқхона газлари ташланмаларини камайтиришга қаратилган чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Навоий КМК» АЖнинг ифлослантирувчи манбаларида инсон омилисиз мониторинг олиб бориш мақсадида намуна олиш ва таҳлил қилиш бўйича автоматик станциялар ўрнатиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Навоий КМК» АЖнинг маблағлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология жамғармаси</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Навоий КМК» АЖ</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Замонавий чанг-газ тозалаш ускуналарини ўрнатиш ва эскиларини алмаштириш бўйича зарур чораларни кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Иқлим стратегиясини ишлаб чиқиш, «яшил иқтисодиёт» тамойилларига ўтиш бўйича чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">29.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология ва атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш соҳасидаги ҳуқуқбузарликлар профилактикаси ва уларга қарши курашиш тизимини янги даражага кўтариш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фотосуратлар ва (ёки) видеоёзувлардаги шахснинг юз қиёфаси бўйича биометрик маълумотлар асосида шахсни аниқлаш тизимини жорий қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бунда Давлат персоналлаштириш марказининг биометрик маълумотлар асосида шахсни аниқлаш тизимини Экология вазирлигининг маълумотлар базасига интеграция қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Персоналлаштириш агентлиги, Ички ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Миллий гвардия</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">30.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий таълим муассасаларининг талабалари ўртасида «<b>Eko-innovation — 2025» </b>экологик муаммолар ечимига бағишланган инновацион ишланмалар ва лойиҳалар кўргазмасини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Инновацион ишланмалар ва лойиҳалар кўргазмасини ўтказиш низомини ишлаб чиқиш ва тасдиқлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижрочилар маблағлари ҳисобидан</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инновацион ривожланиш агентлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маданият вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Кўргазмани ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш юзасидан вазирлик ва идораларнинг вакилларидан иборат ишчи гуруҳини тузиш ва тасдиқлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Олий таълим муассасалари талабалари ўртасида «<b>Eko-innovation — 2025» </b>экологик муаммолар ечимига бағишланган инновацион ишланмалар ва лойиҳалар кўргазмасини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь-октябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">31.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инновацион ривожланиш агентлиги ҳузурида<b> «Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши»</b> илмий-техник кенгашини тузиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши соҳасидаги илмий лойиҳаларни кўриб чиқиш мақсадида илмий-техник кенгашлар фаолиятини таҳлил қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил март-апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Инновацион ривожланиш агентлиги ҳузурида «Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши» илмий-техник кенгашини тузиш ва унинг таркибини тасдиқлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мактабгача ва мактаб таълими вазирлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">32.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижтимоий соҳа объектларини чиқинди контейнерлари билан таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Мактабгача таълим, мактаб, техникумлар, соғлиқни сақлаш муассасаларини тўлиқ хатловдан ўтказиш ва чиқинди контейнерларига бўлган эҳтиёжини аниқлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Чиқинди контейнерлари билан таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил август</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижтимоий соҳа муассасаларига ажратилган бюджет маблағлари ва бюджетдан ташқари маблағлар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">33.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Таълим муассасаларида <b>«Экологик бурчаклар»</b>ни ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Мактабгача таълим ташкилотлари ва умумий ўрта таълим мактабларида қўл меҳнати билан яратилган асарлар, ўқувчилар томонидан чизилган расмлар ва ижодий ишларни ўз ичига олган <b>«Экологик бурчаклар»</b>ни ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Мактабларда <b>I</b> ва <b>III чоракнинг</b> сўнгида <b>«Табиатни асрашда менинг ҳиссам»</b> мавзусида туркум тадбирларни ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ўқув йили якунлари билан республика миқёсида «Энг намунали эко мактаб» танловини ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025/2026 ўқув йилидан бошлаб ҳар йили</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">34.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мактабгача таълим ташкилотларида <b>«Экологик йўлакчалар»</b> ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ўзбекистон Республикаси Қизил китобига киритилган ўсимлик ва ҳайвонлар ҳақида дастлабки тушунчаларни бериш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Муҳофаза қилинадиган ўсимлик ва ҳайвонлар расмларини чизиш орқали тарбияланувчиларда дастлабки экологик билимларни шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025/2026 ўқув йилидан бошлаб ҳар йили</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">вазирлик идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">35.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Республика миқёсида экологик маданиятни ошириш мақсадида оммавий тарғибот тадбирларини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> <b>«Дарахтга нафас беринг»</b> оммавий тадбирини ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июль</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология жамғармаси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ижрочиларнинг маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маданият вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ёшлар ишлари агентлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Вазирлик ва идоралар,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> <b>«Экологиянинг ёш ҳимоячилари»</b> лойиҳасини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. «Green Games» </span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">экологик туркум ўйинларини ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил октябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Боғ, сайилгоҳ, дарахтзор, яшил воҳалар ўртасида <b>«Яшил замин яратувчилари»</b> эко-марафонининг анъанавий кўрик-танловини ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги ҳамда</span></span></b><b> </b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ёшлар ишлари агентлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">36.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ёшлар келажак бунёдкорлари!» <b>IV экология ва туризм халқаро қурултойи</b>ни ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Қурултойни ўтказиш бўйича таклифларни шакллантириш мақсадида ишчи гуруҳлар тузиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Туризмни қўллаб-қувватлаш жамғармаси</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ишчи гуруҳлар томонидан таклифларни ўз ичига олган қурултой дастурининг лойиҳаларини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Ёшлар келажак бунёдкорлари!» IV экология ва туризм халқаро қурултойини ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил август</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъуллар —</span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги</span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> ҳамда Ёшлар ишлари агентлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">37.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Ёшлар ойлиги» доирасида экология ва атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилишга бағишланган туркум тадбирлар ўтказиш ҳамда <b>«Экология билимдонлари»</b> кўрик танловини ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Ёшлар ойлиги» доирасида экология ва атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилишга бағишланган туркум тадбирлар ўтказиш бўйича таклифларни шакллантириш мақсадида ишчи гуруҳлар тузиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ишчи гуруҳлар томонидан таклифларни ўз ичига олган туркум тадбирлар дастури ҳамда <b>«Экология билимдонлари»</b> кўрик танловининг низомини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Ёшлар ойлиги» доирасида экология ва атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилишга бағишланган туркум тадбирлар ўтказиш ҳамда <b>«Экология билимдонлари»</b> кўрик-танловини ўтказиш ва ғолибларни тақдирлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 30 июнь — «Ёшлар куни» доирасида экология ва атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш соҳасида фаол ва ташаббускор бўлган экофаол ёшларни рағбатлантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">38.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экологик муаммолар ва уларнинг ечимларига бағишланган <b>«Эко-оромгоҳ — 2025»ни</b> ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Экологик муаммолар ва уларнинг ечимларига бағишланган <b>«Эко-оромгоҳ — 2025»ни</b> ташкил этиш юзасидан вазирлик, идоралар ва ҳамкор ташкилотлар вакилларидан иборат ишчи гуруҳни шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ҳудудлар кесимида маҳалладаги ёшлар етакчилари, волонтёрлар ва экофаоллардан иборат иштирокчиларни шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Оромгоҳ дастурини ишлаб чиқиш ва тасдиқлаш, тадбирларни ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш мақсадида соҳа мутахассислари ва тренерларни шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Туризм қўмитаси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон волонтёрлари ассоциацияси</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Бўстонлиқ туманидаги <b>«Ёшлар оромгоҳида»</b> 1 ҳафталик <b>«Эко-оромгоҳ — 2025»</b>ни ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил май-июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="aCxSpFirst" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">39.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p class="aCxSpLast" style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Саноат йўналишларининг ўзига хос хусусиятларини ҳисобга олган ҳолда атроф-муҳитга салбий таъсирларнинг олдини олишга қаратилган «Энг мақбул технологиялар» ахборот-техник маълумотномаларини жорий қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Хорижий давлатларда саноат йўналишларининг атроф-муҳитга салбий таъсирини камайтириш бўйича соҳалар кесимида «Энг мақбул технологиялар» ахборот-техник маълумотномаларини ўрганиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Корхоналар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ўрганишлар натижаларига кўра уларни Ўзбекистон Республикаси шароитига мослаштириш имкониятларини ўрганиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Хорижий давлатларнинг «Энг мақбул технологиялар» ахборот-техник маълумотномаларини мослаштириш бўйича таклиф киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — </span></span></i><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги </span></span></b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ва Бош прокуратура</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">40.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ғишт заводларида экологик талабларга амал қилиниши бўйича назорат тадбирларини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.8pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ғишт заводларининг хомашё базасини қонунийлигини, тупроқ карьерларида рекультивация ишларининг амалга оширилганлиги, ер қаъридан фойдаланиш лойиҳа ҳужжатларига мослиги юзасидан назорат тадбирларини амалга ошириш.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2025 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="CHANGES_ORIGINS"><label id="s1104"></label><div name="7709807" id="7709807">(16-илова Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 12 августдаги ПФ-130-сонли <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7694880?ONDATE=15.08.2025 00#7698312">Фармони </a>таҳририда — Қонунчилик маълумотлари миллий базаси, 15.08.2025 й., 06/25/130/0762-сон)</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372121" id="7372121"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372122" id="7372122">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />17-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372376" id="7372376">2025 йилда атроф-муҳитни асраш бўйича халқаро ҳамкорлик йўналишида чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372378" id="7372378">РЕЖАСИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372380" id="7372380"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7562033" id="7562033"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7562043" id="7562043"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Т/р</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро шартнома ва халқаро ташкилотнинг номи</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Амалга оширилиши режалаштирилаётган тадбирлар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Масъул идоралар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Кутилаётган натижалар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">I. Халқаро конвенциялар ва шартномалар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">БМТнинг Иқлим ўзгариши тўғрисидаги ҳадли конвенцияси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1992 йил 9 май, Рио-де-Жанейро, Бразилия)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 1994 йил 21 мартда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> БМТнинг иқлим ўзгариши бўйича ҳадли конвенцияси томонлар конференциясининг 30-сессиясига <i>(2025 йил 10 — 21 ноябрь, Белем ш., Бразилия)</i> тайёргарлик кўриш бўйича тизимли чора-тадбирларни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> БМТ Тараққиёт Дастури билан биргаликда Учинчи Миллий даражада аниқланадиган ҳиссаларни <i>(</i></span></span><i><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">N</span></span></i><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">DC 3.0)</span></span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Вазирлик ва идоралар билан биргаликда секторал йўналишлар бўйича миллий манфаатдан келиб чиққан ҳолда қўшма таклифлар ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Бразилияда бўлиб ўтадиган СОР30 доирасида Ўзбекистонда иқлим ўзгариши ва атроф-муҳит муҳофазаси йўналишида амалга оширилиб келаётган ислоҳотларни намоён этувчи миллий павильон ташкил этилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Миллий павильонда 20 дан ортиқ тематик қўшма тадбирлар ташкил этилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Ўзбекистоннинг Париж битими доирасида белгиланган мажбуриятларини бажариш бўйича кўрсаткичлари янгиланади ва дунё ҳамжамиятига тақдим этилади. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Биологик хилма-хиллик тўғрисидаги конвенция </span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1992 йил 5 июнь, Рио-де-Жанейро, Бразилия)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 1995 йил 17 октябрда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Куньмин-Монреаль Глобал биологик хилма-хиллик мақсадлари» дастурини миллий даражада аниқлаш ва татбиқ этиш бўйича грант маблағларини жалб этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Конвенциянинг доимий бюросига Ўзбекистон вакили номзодини илгари суриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> 2025 йил 25 — 27 февраль кунлари молиявий ресурсларни мобилизация қилиш бўйича йиғилишда иштирок этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Биологик хилма-хиллик тўғрисидаги конвенциянинг Генетик ресурсларга кириш ва фойда алмашишни назорат қилиш тўғрисидаги Нагоя протоколига қўшилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Биологик хилма-хилликни муҳофаза этиш бўйича чора-тадбирлар дастурини ишлаб чиқиш ҳамда миллий ҳисоботни тайёрлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Биологик хилма-хилликни асраш ва экотизимларни тиклашга қаратилган грант маблағлари жалб этилади ва янги грант лойиҳаларига старт берилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Ўзбекистон Конвенциянинг ёрдамчи органида ҳамраис сифатида давлат манфаатларини илгари суриш имкониятига эга бўлади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Глобал даражада белгиланган биологик хилма-хиллик мақсадлари миллий шароитларга интеграция қилинади. </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4. Генетик ресурсларни бошқариш бўйича халқаро маълумотлар ва экспертлар базасидан фойдаланиш имконияти яратилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">БМТнинг Чўлланиш ва қурғоқчиликка қарши курашиш конвенцияси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1994 йил 14 октябрь, Бонн, Германия)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 1995 йил 31 октябрда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> БМТнинг Ўрмонлар бўйича форумида <i>(2025 йил 5 — 9 май, Нью-Йорк, АҚШ)</i> БМТ Бош Ассамблеясининг «Деградацияга учраган ва қурғоқ ҳудудларда барқарор ўрмонзорларни барпо этиш, дарахт экиш ва уларни тарғиб қилиш — экологик муаммоларга қарши курашишнинг самарали ечими» резолюциясини кенг тарғиб қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> «Яшил макон» умуммиллий лойиҳаси доирасида амалга оширилаётган кенг кўламли ишларни жаҳон ҳамжамиятига етказиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Конвенциянинг йиғилишларида тизимли равишда масъул вакилларнинг иштирок этишини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Қум ва чанг бўронларига қарши курашиш бўйича Самарқанд декларацияси қабул қилинади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Мамлакатимизда кўкаламзорлаштириш, деградацияга учраган ерларни қайта тиклаш ва шаҳарларни яшиллаштириш бўйича амалга оширилаётган ишлар тўғрисидаги ахборот дунё ҳамжамиятига етказилади ҳамда билим ва тажрибалар алмашилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. «Яшил макон» умуммиллий лойиҳасини Марказий Осиё минтақаси доирасида кенгайтириш бўйича тарғибот ишлари олиб борилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Йўқ бўлиб кетиш хавфи остидаги ёввойи фауна ва флора турларининг халқаро савдоси тўғрисидаги конвенция</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1973 йил 3 март, Вашингтон, АҚШ)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 1997 йил 8 октябрда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Йўқ бўлиб кетиш хавфи остидаги ёввойи фауна ва флора турларининг халқаро савдоси тўғрисидаги конвенция томонлари йиғилишининг 20-сессиясини Самарқанд шаҳрида ўтказиш <i>(2025 йил 24 ноябрь — 5 декабрь)</i>.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ўзбекистонда флора ва фауна турларининг халқаро савдоси бўйича йиллик ҳисоботни тайёрлаш ва конвенция котибиятига тақдим этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Самарқанд вилояти ҳокимлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Конвенция имзоланганлигининг 50 йиллик юбилейи Самарқанд шаҳрида 180 дан ортиқ давлатдан 3 500 дан ортиқ делегатлар иштирокида нишонланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Ўзбекистоннинг биологик хилма-хилликни муҳофаза қилиш йўналишида миллий ва глобал даражада амалга ошираётган саъй-ҳаракатлари глобал миқёсда ёритилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Йўқ бўлиб кетиш хавфи остидаги фауна ва флора турларининг халқаро савдосини тартибга солиш бўйича 300 дан ортиқ Конвенция қарор ва резолюциялари қабул қилинади ҳамда уларнинг барчасида <b>«Самарқанд» номи</b> акс эттирилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ёввойи ҳайвонларнинг кўчиб юрувчи турларини сақлаб қолишга доир конвенция</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1979 йил 6 ноябрь, Бонн, Германия)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 1998 йил 1 сентябрда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ўзбекистон Республикаси томонидан илгари сурилган «Устюрт платосида ёввойи табиатни муҳофаза этиш меморандуми»ни амалга ошириш бўйича музокаралар ўтказиш <i>(2025 йил 11-12 март, Остона, Қозоғистон)</i>.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Марказий Осиё сутэмизувчилар ташаббуси иштирокчи давлатларининг 3-йиғилишини ўтказиш <i>(2025 йил 24 — 26 июнь, Тошкент).</i></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Конвенция Доимий қўмитасининг ишида фаол иштирок этиш ва йиғилишларида <i>(2025 йил 25 — 27 март, Бонн, Германия) </i>қатнашиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Бухоро буғусининг Конвенциянинг 1-иловасидан чиқариш масаласини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Қозоғистон, Туркманистон ва Ўзбекистон ўртасида Устюрт платосида ёввойи табиатни муҳофаза қилиш бўйича қўшма чора-тадбирлар режаси ишлаб чиқилади ва тасдиқланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Бухоро буғусини сақлаш ва уни кўпайтириш бўйича амалга оширилган ишлар жаҳон ҳамжамиятига тақдим этилади ҳамда Конвенциянинг иловасидан чиқариш орқали мазкур турнинг халқаро мақоми ижобий томонга ўзгаради.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Ўзбекистоннинг Конвенция томонлари конференциясига раислиги доирасида бир неча қўшма тадбирлар амалга оширилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">6.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Сувда сузувчи қушларнинг асосий яшаш манзили бўлган халқаро аҳамиятга эга сув-ботқоқ ерлар тўғрисидаги конвенция</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1971 йил 2 февраль, Рамсар, Эрон)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 2002 йил 8 февралда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Конвенция Доимий қўмитасининг 64-йиғилишида иштирок этиш ҳамда Ўзбекистон вакили номзодини Доимий қўмитанинг раиси ўринбосари лавозимига илгари суриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Германия ҳукумати кўмагида Ўзбекистондаги сувли-ботқоқли ҳудудларни муҳофаза этиш ҳамда туристик салоҳиятни ривожлантиришга қаратилган ҳаракатлар режасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Ўзбекистоннинг сўнгги йилларда Конвенциянинг халқаро рўйхатига киритилган 3 та объект ҳақида маълумот кенг ёритилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Сувда сузувчи қушлар учун халқаро аҳамиятга эга сувли-ботқоқли ҳудудларни бошқариш бўйича тегишли стратегия лойиҳаси ишлаб чиқилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Хавфли чиқиндиларни чегаралараро ташиш ва йўқ қилиб юбориш устидан назорат қилиш тўғрисидаги Базель конвенцияси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1989 йил 22 март, Базель, Швейцария)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 1996 йил 7 майда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Базель конвенцияси томонлар конференцияси 17-сессиясига <i>(2025 йил 28 апрель — 9 май, Женева, Швейцария) </i>тайёргарлик кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Хавфли чиқиндиларни чегаралараро ташиш ва йўқ қилиб юбориш устидан назорат қилиш бўйича йиллик ҳисоботни котибиятга тақдим этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Конвенциянинг йиғилишларида тизимли равишда масъул вакилларнинг иштирок этишини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Хавфли чиқиндиларни чегаралараро ташиш ва йўқ қилиб юбориш устидан назорат қилиш бўйича миллий экспертлар салоҳияти мустаҳкамланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Мазкур йўналишда мамлакатимизда амалга оширилган кенг кўламли ислоҳотлар тўғрисидаги маълумотлар Конвенция йиғилишларида баён этилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">8.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Турғун органик ифлослантирувчи моддалар ҳақидаги Стокгольм конвенцияси </span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(2001 йил 22 май, Стокгольм, Швеция)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 2019 йил 28 июнда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Европа Иттифоқи билан ҳамкорликда қиймати 4 млн еврога тенг «Заҳарли кимёвий моддалар ва хавфли чиқиндиларни бошқариш ва Базель, Стокгольм ва Роттердам конвенциялари бўйича мажбуриятларни бажаришда ёрдам бериш» грант лойиҳасини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги ҳузуридаги Атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш соҳасида ихтисослаштирилган таҳлилий назорат маркази кимёвий лабораторияси моддий-техник базасини такомиллаштириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Стокгольм конвенцияси томонлар конференциясининг 12-сессиясига <i>(2025 йил 28 апрель — 9 май, Женева, Швейцария)</i> тайёргарлик кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Ўзбекистонда заҳарли кимёвий моддалар ва хавфли чиқиндиларнинг ягона онлайн реестри ишлаб чиқилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Хавфли кимёвий моддаларни бошқариш миллий стратегияси ишлаб чиқилади ҳамда вазирлик ҳузурида Кимёвий марказ ташкил этилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Қишлоқ хўжалигида кенг фойдаланиладиган пестицидлар ва ўғитларни онлайн рўйхатдан ўтказиш тизими йўлга қўйилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4. Атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш соҳасида ихтисослаштирилган таҳлилий марказининг моддий-техник базаси мустаҳкамланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">9.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Биологик хилма-хиллик тўғрисидаги конвенцияга биохавфсизлик бўйича Картахена протоколи</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(2000 йил 29 январь, Картахена, Колумбия)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 2019 йил 14 октябрда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> БМТ ФАО билан ҳамкорликда қиймати 2,0 млн АҚШ долларига тенг «Ўзбекистон Республикасида Картахена протоколига мувофиқ биохилмахилликни тарғиб қилиш, ўсимликлар генетик ресурсларидан барқарор фойдаланишни рағбатлантириш ва биохавфсизлик бўйича қонунчилик базасини жорий этиш» грант лойиҳасини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Картахена протоколига мувофиқ биохилмахилликни тарғиб қилиш, ўсимликлар генетик ресурсларидан барқарор фойдаланишни тартибга солиш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий асосларни ишлаб чиқиш ва бунда халқаро экспертларни жалб этиш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Ўзбекистонда биохавфсизлик сиёсатини юритиш тартиби ишлаб чиқилади ҳамда Картахена протоколига мувофиқ халқаро нормаларга интеграция қилинади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Глобал биохавфсизлик дастурини Ўзбекистонда татбиқ этиш ва генетик ресурсларни бошқариш бўйича техник ва билим салоҳияти мустаҳкамланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Халқаро экспертларни жалб этган ҳолда соҳага қўшимча грант маблағларини жалб этиш учун лойиҳа ҳужжатлари ишлаб чиқилади ва хорижий донор ташкилотларга молиялаштириш учун юборилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">10.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Озон қатламини муҳофаза қилиш тўғрисидаги Монреаль баённомаси<s> </s></span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1987 йил 16 сентябрь, Монреаль, Канада)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 1993 йил 18 майда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Монреаль баённомаси Кигали тузатмасига қўшилишнинг мақсадга мувофиқлигини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Монреаль баённомаси томонлар йиғилишининг 36-сессиясига <i>(2025 йил 28 октябрь — 1 ноябрь, Бангкок, Таиланд)</i> тайёргарлик кўриш. </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Конвенциянинг йиғилишларида тизимли равишда масъул вакилларнинг иштирок этишини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Гидрофторуглеродлар <i>(НFCs)</i> ишлаб чиқариш ва истеъмолини босқичма-босқич камайтириш орқали атмосферага чиқариладиган иссиқхона газларининг миқдорини сезиларли даражада қисқартириш ишлари олиб борилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Озон қатламини муҳофаза қилиш бўйича Ўзбекистонда амалга оширилган ишлар тўғрисидаги маълумотлар халқаро ҳамжамиятга етказилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">11.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Умумжаҳон маданий ва табиий меросни муҳофаза қилиш тўғрисидаги конвенция</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1972 йил 16 ноябрь, Париж, Франция)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 1995 йил 22 декабрда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Кўҳитанг тоғ тизмасида жойлашган Сурхон давлат қўриқхонаси <i>(Ўзбекистон Республикаси)</i> ва Қўйтендоғ қўриқхонаси <i>(Туркманистон)</i> мутахассислари ҳамда тегишли вазирлик ва идораларнинг масъул ходимлари билан ЮНЕСКОнинг Бутунжаҳон мероси рўйхатига номзоднома тайёрлаш учун 2025 йил июль ойига қадар онлайн йиғилиш ўтказиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Объектнинг Ўзбекистондан ўтган қисми бўйича 2027 йил декабрга қадар номзодномани тайёрлаш ва мувофиқлаштириш учун Туркманистон Республикасининг ЮНЕСКО ишлари бўйича миллий комиссиясига тақдим этиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Номзодномани Туркманистон давлати билан биргаликда 2025 йил сентябрь ойида ЮНЕСКОга техник экспертизага топшириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги, ЮНЕСКО ишлари бўйича Миллий комиссия,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Хорижий экспертларни жалб этган ҳолда ЮНЕСКО Бутунжаҳон мероси комиссиясига тақдим этиш учун номзоднома лойиҳаси ишлаб чиқилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Ўзбекистон ва Туркманистоннинг миллий экспертларининг ўзаро ташрифлари амалга оширилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Объектни бошқариш бўйича Ўзбекистон ва Туркманистон давлатларининг тегишли мутахассислари иштирокида халқаро қўмита тузилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">12.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Атроф-муҳит билан боғлиқ бўлган масалалар бўйича қарорлар қабул қилиш жараёнида жамоатчиликнинг ахборот олиш имконияти, иштироки ва одил судловга эришиш имконияти тўғрисидаги конвенция </span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1998 йил 25 июнь, Орхус, Дания)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Конвенция доирасидаги йиғилишларида тизимли равишда масъул вакилларнинг иштирок этишини таъминлаш. </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Марказий Осиё атроф-муҳит ва иқлим ўзгаришларини ўрганиш университети <i>(Green University) </i>базасида экологик ахборот-ресурс марказини ташкил этиш бўйича концепцияни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Ўзбекистон Республикаси Орхус конвенциясига қўшилиши таъминланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Ўзбекистон Республикаси Конституциясининг 49-моддасига мувофиқ экологик ҳуқуқларини таъминлаш ва атроф-муҳитга зарарли таъсир кўрсатилишига йўл қўймаслик мақсадида шаҳарсозлик фаолияти соҳасида жамоатчилик назоратини амалга ошириш йўлга қўйилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Жаҳон ҳамжамиятига Ўзбекистоннинг экология соҳасида очиқлик сиёсати йўналишидаги ислоҳотлари кенг намоён этилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">13.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро савдода айрим хавфли кимёвий моддалар ва пестицидларга нисбатан олдиндан асосланган келишув тартиб-таомили тўғрисидаги Роттердам конвенцияси</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1998 йил 11 сентябрь, Роттердам, Голландия)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Роттердам конвенцияси томонлар конференцияси 12-сессиясига <i>(2025 йил 28 апрель — 9 май, Женева, Швейцария)</i> тайёргарлик кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Европа Иттифоқининг техник кўмагини ҳамда халқаро экспертларни жалб этган ҳолда конвенцияга қўшилиш бўйича асосларни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Хорижий мутахассисларни жалб этган ҳолда Халқаро савдода айрим хавфли кимёвий моддалар ва пестицидларга нисбатан олдиндан асосланган келишув тартиб-таомили тўғрисидаги Роттердам конвенциясига қўшилиш мақсадга мувофиқлиги юзасидан таҳлилий ахборот тайёрланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Конвенцияга аъзо давлатларнинг аъзо бўлишига қадар ва аъзолик даврида дуч келган муаммолари ўрганилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">II. Халқаро ташкилотлар</span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">БМТ Атроф-муҳит Дастури (U</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">N</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">EP)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1972 йил 5 июнь, Найроби, Кения)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 1992 йил 2 мартда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">БМТ Атроф-муҳит дастурининг Ўзбекистонда ваколатхонаси очилиши масаласини кўриб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. БМТ Атроф-муҳит дастурининг Ўзбекистонда ваколатхонасини очишнинг ҳуқуқий асослари ишлаб чиқилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги вакили ташкилотнинг Доимий вакиллар қўмитасида соҳада қабул қилинаётган қарорлар ишлаб чиқилишида иштироки таъминланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">15.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Глобал экологик жамғарма (GEF)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1991 йил 15 октябрь, Вашингтон, АҚШ)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 2008 йил 22 январда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Марказий Осиё атроф-муҳит ва иқлим ўзгаришларини ўрганиш университети <i>(Green University)</i> негизида атроф-муҳитни сақлаш бўйича Глобал экологик жамғарманинг махсус грант дастурини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Донорлар йиғилишини 2026 йилнинг май-июнь ойларида Ўзбекистонда ташкил этиш таклифини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Жамғарманинг 9-молиялаштириш цикли доирасида амалга ошириш учун грант лойиҳалар дастурини шакллантириш ва доимий музокаралар ўтказиб бориш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Вазирлик мутахассисларининг Глобал экологик жамғарма томонидан амалга ошириладиган тренингларда иштирокини таъминлаш ҳамда котибиятига тажриба алмашишга юбориш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, савдо ва саноат вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Глобал экологик жамғарма томонидан молиялаштириладиган янги грант лойиҳалари ишга туширилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. 2026 — 2030 йиллар учун 9-молиялаштириш циклига топшириш учун грант лойиҳалари тўплами ишлаб чиқилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. 2026 йилда ташкилотнинг 8-ассамблеясини Самарқанд шаҳрида ўтказиш бўйича ҳуқуқий асослари ишлаб чиқилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4. Ташкилот томонидан ташкил этиладиган онлайн ва офлайн семинар ва тренингларда маҳаллий ёш мутахассисларнинг иштирок этиши таъминланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">16.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Яшил иқлим жамғармаси (GCF)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(2010 йил декабрь, Канкун, Мексика)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 2014 йил 6 июлда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Яшил иқлим жамғармасининг Ўзбекистон Республикасида минтақавий бюросини очиш бўйича музокаралар олиб бориш ва Ҳукуматга таклиф киритиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Яшил иқлим жамғармаси молиявий ресурсларидан тўғридан-тўғри фойдаланиш учун Ўзбекистон миллий агентликлари ва тижорат банкларини аккредитация қилиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Жамғарманинг грант ва кредит маблағларини жалб этиш учун лойиҳалар тўпламини шакллантириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Инвестициялар, саноат ва савдо вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Яшил иқлим жамғармасининг Ўзбекистон Республикасида минтақавий бюросини очиш бўйича музокаралар олиб борилади ва унинг ҳуқуқий асослари ишлаб чиқилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Ташкилотнинг молиявий ресурсларидан тўғридан-тўғри фойдаланиш учун Ўзбекистон миллий агентликлари ва тижорат банкларини аккредитация қилиш чоралари кўрилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Жамғарманинг грант ва кредит маблағларини жалб этиш учун лойиҳалар тўплами шакллантирилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">17.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">БМТнинг Европа иқтисодий комиссияси (U</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">N</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ECE)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1947 йил 28 март, Женева, Швейцария)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 1993 йил 30 июлда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ўзбекистон Республикаси экологик фаолияти самарадорлигининг тўртинчи шарҳини <i>(ОРЭД-4)</i> ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> ОРЭД-4ни ишлаб чиқиш мақсадида БМТ Европа иқтисодий комиссияси <i>(БМТ ЕИК)</i> эксперт гуруҳи миссиясининг Ўзбекистонга ташрифини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> БМТ ЕИК экологик сиёсат бўйича комиссияси ишида фаол иштирок этиш ҳамда комиссия йиғилишларида ҳамраислик қилиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ташкилотнинг бош қароргоҳида Ўзбекистоннинг экологик ва туристик салоҳиятини намоён этувчи тематик экспонатни ўрнатиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Ўзбекистон Республикаси экологик фаолияти самарадорлигининг тўртинчи шарҳини <i>(ОРЭД-4)</i> ишлаб чиқиш мақсадида БМТ Европа иқтисодий комиссияси <i>(БМТ ЕИК)</i> эксперт гуруҳи миссиясининг Ўзбекистонга ташрифи амалга оширилади ҳамда тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар билан учрашувлар ташкил этилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Ўзбекистоннинг сўнгги 5 йилликда экология ва атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш йўналишида амалга оширилган ислоҳотлари халқаро экспертлар гуруҳи томонидан баҳоланади ва ислоҳотлар самарадорлигини ошириш бўйича тавсиялар берилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Ташкилотнинг экологик сиёсат бўйича комиссияси йиғилишларида Марказий Осиё минтақаси номидан ҳамраислик қилинади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">18.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Халқаро табиатни муҳофаза қилиш иттифоқи (IUC</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">N</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1948 йил 5 октябрь, Фонтенбло, Франция)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон 2021 йил 20 октябрда қўшилган</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Табиатга асослантирилган ечимлар ва экотизимларни асрашга қаратилган лойиҳалар портфелини кенгайтириш.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2.</span></span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> Ёш тадқиқотчилар ва ёш кадрларнинг малакасини ошириш мақсадида ташкилот ваколатхоналарига стажировкага юбориш масаласини кўриб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">ЮНЕСКО ишлари бўйича Миллий комиссия,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Мустақил Давлатлар Ҳамдўстлиги ва Марказий Осиё давлатлари ўртасида Иттифоқнинг биринчи ваколатхонаси Тошкентда очилади. </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Иттифоқ билан ҳамкорликда умумий қиймати 20 млн АҚШ долларидан ортиқ грант маблағлари жалб қилинади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Республикадаги ихтисослаштирилган ташкилотлар кадрларининг салоҳияти институционал мустаҳкамланади ва ривожланади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4. Ўсимлик ва ҳайвонот дунёси объектлари кадастри, шунингдек, Ўзбекистон Республикасининг Қизил китобини ишлаб чиқишда Иттифоқнинг халқаро стандартлари ва методологияси жорий қилинади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">19.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">БМТнинг тураржойлар бўйича дастури</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(U</span></span><span lang="UZ" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">N</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">-Habitat)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(1978 йил, Найроби, Кения)</span></span></i></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:32%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ташкилот билан ҳамкорлик алоқаларини мустаҳкамлаш, хусусан шаҳар ҳудудларини кўкаламзорлаштириш ишларини ташкил этиш орқали аҳолининг турмуш тарзини яхшилаш ва қулай экологик шароит яратиш. </span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:15%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қурилиш ва коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Туризм қўмитаси,</span></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:29%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Ташкилот билан ўзаро алоқаларни мустаҳкамлаш орқали шаҳар ҳудудларида аҳоли учун қулай ва соғлом экологик муҳит яратиш ҳисобига уларнинг турмуш сифатини яхшилаш бўйича қўшма чора-тадбирлар амалга оширилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Шаҳар экологиясини яхшилашга қаратилган халқаро стандартлар ва инновацион ёндашувлар жорий этилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:16.05pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Найробидаги Бош қароргоҳда тематик майдон орқали Ўзбекистоннинг бой экологияси, табиий ресурслари ва туристик салоҳияти кенг намойиш этилади.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="CHANGES_ORIGINS"><label id="s1104"></label><div name="7562044" id="7562044">(17-илова Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 майдаги ПФ-90-сонли <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7552003?ONDATE=02.06.2025 00#7554495">Фармони </a>таҳририда — Қонунчилик маълумотлари миллий базаси, 02.06.2025 й., 06/25/90/0486-сон)</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372123" id="7372123"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7372124" id="7372124">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 30 январдаги ПФ-16-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/7369703">Фармонига</a><br />18-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7372407" id="7372407">Ўзбекистон Республикасида «Яшил туризм» дастурини амалга ошириш</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7372409" id="7372409">ЧОРА-ТАДБИРЛАРИ РЕЖАСИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7372412" id="7372412"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7540601" id="7540601"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7540602" id="7540602"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="2%"><p align="center"><a name="7372413"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Т/р</span></b></a></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="18%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Чора-тадбир номи</span></b></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="30%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Амалга ошириш механизми</span></b></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ижро муддати</span></b></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="15%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Молиялаштириш манбаси</span></b></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" width="23%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Масъул ижрочилар</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="18%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">«Яшил меҳмонхона» механизмини жорий этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Хорижий тажрибани ўрганиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил март</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="15%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="23%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Туризм қўмитаси,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. «Яшил меҳмонхона» талабларини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил май</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Босқичма-босқич жорий этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил давомида</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="18%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Меҳмонхоналарда яшил ҳудудларни кўпайтиришни тарғиб қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Меҳмонхонада яшил ҳудудни кўпайтириш бўйича тавсиялар ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил февраль</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="15%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Туризмни қўллаб-қувватлаш жамғармаси</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="23%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Туризм қўмитаси,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Савдо-саноат палатаси,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Тадбиркорлар орасида кенг тарғиб қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Доимий равишда</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="18%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">«Яшил меҳмонхона» тизимини жорий қилган тадбиркорларни рағбатлантириш механизмини жорий этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Янги меҳмонхоналар учун субсидия ажратишда «яшил меҳмонхона» талабини киритиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил июнь</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="15%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="23%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Туризм қўмитаси,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Янги тартибни тадбиркорлар орасида кенг тарғиб қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Доимий равишда</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="18%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Хорижий туристлар учун Ўзбекистон бўйлаб саёҳат давомида «Карбон пасс» тизимини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Саёҳат босқичларида углерод чиқиши ҳисоб-китобини тақдим этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил июль</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="B