TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Маҳаллий ва хорижий инвесторлар билан манзилли ишларни ташкил этиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил давомида</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">11.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="18%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Туризм намойиши объектлари ҳудудларида «автомобилдан холи ҳудуд» тизимини ташкил қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Туризм намойиши объектлари ҳудудларида «автомобилдан холи ҳудуд»ни ташкил этиш бўйича тавсиялар ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил апрель</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="15%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Маблағ талаб қилинмайди</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="23%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Туризм қўмитаси,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Маданий мерос агентлиги</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Аҳоли ва тадбиркорлик субъектлари орасида «автомобилдан холи ҳудуд» тизимини тарғиб қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил давомида</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">12.</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="18%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Умумий овқатланиш масканларида органик, веган ва диабетик ҳамда калориялар кўрсатилган менюларни жорий қилиш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.25pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Органик, веган ва диабетик менюлар намуналарини тайёрлаш.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #d4d0c8" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2025 йил март</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="15%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Туризмни қўллаб-қувватлаш жамғармаси</span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADDING-LEFT: 4.3pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #d4d0c8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid" valign="top" width="23%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Туризм қўмитаси,</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳри ҳокимликлари</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 4.3pt;BORDER-TOP: #d4d0c8;PADD